Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露～
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.11,0:02:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大家，空露露～
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛基本上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可能听不到游戏的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,噗噗噗这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,声音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.51,0:03:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,「完美」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,「看起来没问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「今天是浴衣嘛」对，是浴衣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.77,0:03:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,JSP3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,日本凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,监视协会！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,新作，因为已经出了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,想要来玩玩看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是盂兰盆节，而且我复归的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,JSP2呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就直播了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,印象深刻，印象深刻……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,已经直播过了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，那个的新作
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,听说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,相当的恐怖，传闻如此说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,2也很恐怖，但3更
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,会这么说是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,今天…莉泽大人也玩过了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,JSP很不妙，很恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,听到这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.32,0:04:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,会很恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,今天
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,日本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:04:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,监视协会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,想要继续
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,玩下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个游戏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是以现实存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,为原型的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对那一系列的凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,进行监视
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,如果发现异常
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是要去找异常呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，就
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,马上开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，喝口水
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,「真的存在吗？」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这个游戏，真的是日本有的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真实的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,以它为原型
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,制作的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？是为原型的……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.41,0:05:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请等我一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,同意，下一步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,「警告」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「接下来要玩的这个游戏」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「是以现实中实际存在的公司进行的」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「『凶宅监视业务』为原型」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「所制作」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上，好像真的有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,比如监视之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,已经变成凶宅的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,像房子之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要好好调查一番
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的工作……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,据说是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,「在本游戏中」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「登场的房子都是实际存在的」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,「灵障或事件也都是实际报告过的」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「注意」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,「在作为原型的业务中」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,「参与者失踪」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:06:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,「交通事故」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「以及在家中的受害的报告众多」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,「在游戏过程中」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,「以及游戏后产生的任何问题」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「本公司概不负责」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等……好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，稍微直播一下……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,观看，不是观看注意，但这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看的时候呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,请小心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「事前说明也太吓人了」有点可怕对吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么，有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,「日本凶宅监视协会 会员注册」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「请输入你的名字」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「名字之后可以更改」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，就用空露露
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.57,0:07:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,2有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,用空露露
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「空露露女士」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,「对这次您进行日本凶宅监视协会的」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,「会员注册」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常感谢」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「您从今天起」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,从事本会员……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,「从事本协会的」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「监视业务」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「在业务开始前{\alpha&H80&}请看{\alpha&H00&}请确认以下视频」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么，现在声音怎么样？顺便问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点小
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这个月的……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,○者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,「社训」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,「谨记歇息即罪恶」……不对，休息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「二、别忘了微笑」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「三、不可懈怠自我管理」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,「四、要有感恩和责任心」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「五、不可违抗上司」你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是黑心企业吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「六、舍弃个体，与协会成为一体吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「七、辞职是抹不掉的耻辱」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.32,0:09:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，不让我辞职
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:18.15,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※若殉职，致力于使自己成为下一任「监视对象」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,自己成为下……自己成为呐呐呐呐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,「协会才是独一无二的家族」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「没事的」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,「能做到」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「你是被需要的」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「爱」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「不可怕」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「思念」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,「没事的」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「大家都在」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「佛陀」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,「是同伴哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「能做到」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「需要」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,「不可怕」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「没事的」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因为大家都不害怕嘛～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,顺带一提稍稍的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.85,0:09:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在评论里看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.89,0:09:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,如果玩的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:10:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好像真的这次会狠狠的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,灵异现象之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是这么听说的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,直到现在，第一部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,第二部之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没有过的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我玩2的时候是没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,「会引来这种东西的人就会引来哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「真正的灵障会……」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,试
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,监视…啊，帮助！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也能两个人啊，以前有这样的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,单独监视业务
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,诶……我想以一个人开始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,「三重县」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,「衫屋旅馆」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:10:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色的房子，之前是不是也有过来着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.61,0:11:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是2吗？里面好像也有的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「观音崎公园」是公园啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，有一个是未开放的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.47,0:11:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,4个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的感觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,「蓝色的房子很不妙呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.93,0:11:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,相当有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,地方呢，蓝色的f……蓝色的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的，相当多的YouTuber之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,也会去过一夜的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定就是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是温泉旅馆呢，这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,杉屋旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,「以迷宫般错综复杂的构造为特色」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,从三重县的杉屋旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,开始业务吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「查看监控摄像头的显示器，监视是否有异常」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,「发现异常时，请迅速按下处理位置进行报告」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H80&}「业务失败例」{\alpha&H00&}\N「1. 发生了四个异常却漏掉了」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「2. 连续五次错误报告没有异常的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「这些会被视为业务失败，请注意」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「从午夜0点到5点必须持续监视」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「迄今的特殊异常报告例」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果发生覆盖整个摄像头监控的异常」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「可以选择视野内的任何位置进行报告」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「发生后长时间放置会立即失败的」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,「异常存在」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,「不切换摄像头的红外/通常模式」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「就无法看到的」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「异常存在」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,OK，摄像头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,用A和D切换
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.99,0:12:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,红外摄像？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,W
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,菜单
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:12:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,E……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,SC
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,OK哒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,「大体和平常一样的感觉」是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.46,0:13:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，因为我有点看不见文本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便问一下，声音没问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,「开始进行监视业务」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,「通常业务中，开始30分钟内不会检测出异常」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「关于房子的状况，请仔细的{\alpha&H80&}确认{\alpha&H00&}」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,声音有点轻？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再提高一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,相当小？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,异常
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好像会出来的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.04,0:13:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,杉屋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「反正会发出很大的声音吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:14:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说哦，确实有点小吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,声音已经出现异常了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.39,0:14:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是温泉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,异常没有检出
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉…这是不是动物皮一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,异常——
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.77,0:14:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,最初的30分钟还不会有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,花瓶放在奇怪的地方，这真的正常吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是原本就有的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，不过真是放的乱七八糟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，现在只能记住了……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有这种地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,「致社员的各位，现在是异常现象报告变多的时间」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果确认到任何变化请报告」从现在开始吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.95,0:14:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:14:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,春天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.07,0:14:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,梦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？之前没有这么多血啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「异常检出，请稍等」好诶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱也很干净
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,电视、浴室也没有异常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,兽皮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像大宴会厅一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么问题。这到底是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,话说，拉门里面是不是有写字？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这个也很奇怪，普通的以为这是异常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才这么亮吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.55,0:15:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是JSP常有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，眼珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我觉得之前没有。有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「异常检出请稍等」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,报告完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:16:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好像写着呢，红外……啊红外，忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.75,0:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不过红外说容易看清……也可以说是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉看起来像人的脸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在通知您，大约凌晨1点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.35,0:16:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,异常，一切都……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来有违和……感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,电视开着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,异常检出
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那边怎么样？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,涂鸦……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……涂鸦的好多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.09,0:16:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这个有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.11,0:17:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点讨厌，拉门
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，这里原来有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.60,0:17:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点违和感，结果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,在脚下，箭头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,「报告完成」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,攒了4个的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么呢，我到底在感觉什么违和感
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这种镜子之类的……果然还是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.21,0:17:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的拉门是开着的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.79,0:17:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，手印
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是乒乓球台吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不过总觉得温泉旅馆里会有这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,「已经能看到看不见的东西了…？」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感什么的，被说要去找异常什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.79,0:17:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,全部
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:18:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,都觉得是异常
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「在意的话也是有检查的哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么来着，连续
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,错三次的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就不太好了对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为声音是不是太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底也没那么……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是会𠳐——的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大声的那种吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这个凶宅，我要住一晚…这种的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，这里原来有这么深吗？绝对没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是感觉很奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.59,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为户型变了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是变了个漂亮的楼梯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,以前有这么漂亮吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微绕了一圈，异变……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，能感觉到违和感，好像
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有门吗难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那种感觉到的违和感
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是哪里的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.86,0:19:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然可能是异变
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吓了我一跳嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,人的脸不吓人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「铃原对什么都觉得有违和感」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.09,0:19:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,非常
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,演出好吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,吓人的地方很多吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,「是不快点处理掉不行的家伙」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是那种时间一长就不行的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉那种看上去挺多的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，这种、这种的也那个……神玉 神 神 神 神 神
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.61,0:20:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,叫神龛来着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看到被搞得翻天覆地的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,果然……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,果然感觉这样不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「从2开始加入的家伙吓死人」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，不过意外地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么感觉好像被发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点违和感，是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么的影子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还有缝隙好讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,就像普通的，在家里也是，有点缝隙……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,开着的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得好像被看着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，这样也能用红外啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异常才是异常？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不，也许被偷看了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.89,0:21:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,废屋？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么变成这样了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.09,0:21:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是相当气派的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,旅馆的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是客人吗，往这边偷看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,男和女……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.43,0:21:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上，监视……刚才有什么黑色的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,光是盯着监控摄像头的工作也有点可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不动
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是违和感
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,无法从这个房间逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有什么来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是脚印
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还没有异常呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也还没发现吗？不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.09,0:22:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,电视闪了……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,闪了一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,「哟？注意到了」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对违和感，还挺……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.87,0:22:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也许马上就能察觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也没有，不太有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是看起来像人脸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.86,0:22:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没有，没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.39,0:22:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得，到了深夜……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,水桶有两个来着吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,越是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.49,0:22:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,越容易出现异常吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等等普通在意的东西也太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:23:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为、为什么要把花瓶放在那里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.61,0:23:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而且花应该说还挺新的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是真的有的吧，在这个房子里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么花
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.51,0:23:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,放在那呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.55,0:23:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,骚灵……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.96,0:23:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是骚灵现象嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.99,0:23:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,实际真的有吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.79,0:23:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就算有看到人影之类的传闻，什么东西飞过来之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也不对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,被扔东西的话，就是普通的物理上的讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,骚灵君
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一下，我姑且把桌面音量稍微调大了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.68,0:23:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不会太吵或太小吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「致各位员工，目前在你的房子中发现了大量异常」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,第三个的时候，那个就会出现的来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.74,0:24:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道但总觉得w
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.25,0:24:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好多泡在里面的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.47,0:24:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在温泉里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.37,0:24:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,泡在温泉里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.22,0:24:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，刚才那个就是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.06,0:24:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大家注意到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.86,0:24:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我没注意到？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.68,0:24:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在混浴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.84,0:24:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不，饭菜好豪华
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.42,0:24:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,超豪华的饭菜
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.12,0:24:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.51,0:24:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.15,0:25:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可能意外地不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.08,0:25:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.59,0:25:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.44,0:25:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,保存方式不太好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.30,0:25:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还有呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.22,0:25:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很多的时候是3个左右吧？大概还差1个
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.47,0:25:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,声音…诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.03,0:25:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到声音
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.02,0:25:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，只有你们能听到的声音吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.55,0:25:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点没搞明白什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.72,0:25:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？漏了什么？真假啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.01,0:25:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下，再等一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙，请立刻
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.71,0:25:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,报告
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.20,0:25:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.88,0:25:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.07,0:26:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别搞什么恐怖的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.46,0:26:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.94,0:26:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哪……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.50,0:26:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.84,0:26:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，再
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.96,0:26:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,再调大一点吧我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.47,0:26:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,很好懂
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.65,0:26:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像有什么不过掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.50,0:26:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可能提交太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.38,0:26:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.15,0:26:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.64,0:26:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大家也把音量调高一点吗？桌面音频
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.14,0:26:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.21,0:26:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,直到现在都没怎么出来，那也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.93,0:26:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么很奇怪的东西呢，再来一次同样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.06,0:26:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.61,0:26:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.42,0:26:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很明显的……楼梯的大小不奇怪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.44,0:27:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是异常吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.96,0:27:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.61,0:27:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.85,0:27:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.68,0:27:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不是红外拍不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.96,0:27:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，还好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.17,0:27:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.54,0:27:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.36,0:27:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的东……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.99,0:27:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,「现在非常危险」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.40,0:27:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「请立即避难」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.15,0:27:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,非常危险？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.79,0:27:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.51,0:27:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,说错过了4个
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.32,0:27:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「在娱乐室的物体变多」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.77,0:27:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「走廊有入侵者」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.54,0:27:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊里被入侵得很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.98,0:27:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「大榻榻米间的物体变多」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.09,0:27:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哇……追加
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.65,0:27:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊有入侵者？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.06,0:27:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.34,0:28:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,「漏看了不少呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.75,0:28:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,果然那个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.04,0:28:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,像是异常频发的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说已经出了三个左右了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.08,0:28:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，我没看出来。这里有布呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.88,0:28:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.59,0:28:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,完全
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没看出来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.19,0:28:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也是原本就有的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.52,0:28:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，这里是不是有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.17,0:28:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,客房
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.42,0:28:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.18,0:28:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,用相机对着走廊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.61,0:28:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，电灯是不是有点不一样……不
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.46,0:28:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,因为写着幽灵嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.55,0:28:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,应该还没出现异常吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.45,0:29:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,相机
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.45,0:29:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.02,0:29:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,幽灵…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.60,0:29:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,再等一会
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.54,0:29:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,异常就要开始了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.28,0:29:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.42,0:29:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,水桶有两个
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.64,0:29:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,「致各位」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.35,0:29:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「现在是异常报告多发的时段」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.45,0:29:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果确认到任何变化请报告」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.63,0:29:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像是会让人问「有这种东西吗？」的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.21,0:29:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有这种吗，这种……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,污渍？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.47,0:29:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,血痕？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.76,0:29:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，糟糕，感觉全都异变
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.26,0:29:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,脚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.13,0:30:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.71,0:30:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「变得疑神疑鬼了嘛」
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.15,0:30:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉，声音……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.39,0:30:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好像听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.50,0:30:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大家听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.22,0:30:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.00,0:30:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,像是女性的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.41,0:30:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,声音
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.73,0:30:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,hmm……那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.15,0:30:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，听到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.00,0:30:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.93,0:30:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.42,0:30:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是会从缝隙里偷看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.64,0:30:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.27,0:30:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是我绝对会关掉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.38,0:30:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那种缝隙
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.19,0:30:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是开合顺畅程度之类的不太好，好像动不了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.11,0:30:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这种地方就是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.10,0:30:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，又关上了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.67,0:30:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,正好…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.66,0:31:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉的时候看到的，所以容易明白
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.32,0:31:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能会毫无注意呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.30,0:31:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,通知现在是凌晨1点左右
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.05,0:31:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉变大了？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.30,0:31:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不对，怎么会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.88,0:31:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.22,0:31:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.88,0:31:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,像「啪嚓」一样的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.43,0:31:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.88,0:31:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.88,0:31:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.39,0:31:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不是错觉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.48,0:31:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定漏掉了什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.62,0:31:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不过搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.77,0:31:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.34,0:31:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,果然啊，一有声音的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.57,0:32:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定就在那里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.46,0:32:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不在
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.55,0:32:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,的吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.57,0:32:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.32,0:32:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么普通地下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那个挺有人样的……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.78,0:32:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.20,0:32:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.00,0:32:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个房间最吓人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.04,0:32:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一般都有的吧，这种凶宅之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.74,0:32:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.67,0:32:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,住着的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.71,0:32:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,像是来迎接我们的人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.06,0:32:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,变得超豪华的！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.94,0:33:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,水晶吊灯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.37,0:33:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说还是看得出来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.12,0:33:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过意外地可能会错过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.05,0:33:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有收拾的这么干净吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.92,0:33:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,容易理解的有些那个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.38,0:33:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.66,0:33:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉变漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.81,0:33:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.37,0:33:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好像不对
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.73,0:33:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.97,0:33:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.47,0:33:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,春天 现实
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.01,0:33:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.53,0:33:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现实？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.99,0:33:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不是「梦」什么的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.22,0:33:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.11,0:33:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.50,0:33:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，刚才注意到的是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.77,0:33:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，睡着的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.23,0:33:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才注意到了不是很厉害吗，意外地
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.96,0:33:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.90,0:34:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，是谁放在这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.25,0:34:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也，稍微远看的话，看着像人也不是不像人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.27,0:34:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,通知现在是凌晨2点左右
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.36,0:34:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像能听到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.01,0:34:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.49,0:34:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,位置有点……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.94,0:34:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，还好还好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.23,0:34:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,反应了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是碰到过一次的异变的话，就能稍微注意一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.71,0:34:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,又「哐」地一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.60,0:34:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,叩击声
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.60,0:34:49.60,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※ラップ音（Rap Sound）\NRap取的是其原本的含义，即叩击的声音\N但一般来说叩击声更进一步的指向灵异性的声响
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.66,0:34:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，日常生活中也有不知道是不是叩击声的声音吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.25,0:34:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,判断的方法果然还是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.68,0:35:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是看有没有讨厌的感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.47,0:35:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不是房屋的异响，但就像是「卡当」一声那样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.07,0:35:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「砰」的一下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.89,0:35:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘎吱嘎吱那样的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.90,0:35:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不过正常生活也会有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.86,0:35:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「房屋异响的话……」「那是叩击声啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.99,0:35:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不，是……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.37,0:35:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.91,0:35:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不舒服或者害怕之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.98,0:35:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是就是那种东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.13,0:35:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「温差也会导致嘎吱嘎吱的声响呢」是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.39,0:35:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.89,0:35:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,「砰是叩击声吗……」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.14,0:35:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,像是爆破音那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.31,0:35:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔会有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.01,0:35:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,砰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.73,0:35:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘎吱…之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.06,0:35:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘎吱是房屋异响吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:36:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，是原本就在这里的东西，还是被带进来的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.37,0:36:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多搞不明白的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.27,0:36:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉完全没异常啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.84,0:36:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也很暗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.37,0:36:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有点在意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.03,0:36:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地，从人的意义上来说
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.66,0:36:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这种……废墟之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.74,0:36:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,废屋类的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.76,0:36:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好像真的有人住过一样，有点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.80,0:36:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,从这个意义上来说也很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.12,0:36:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,当然从灵异意义上来说也很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.19,0:36:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被问能不能在这里住一晚，那就真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.18,0:36:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,太讨厌了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.16,0:36:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,从各种意义上来说
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.71,0:36:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.45,0:36:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,从幽灵的角度来说也不想
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.15,0:36:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.42,0:36:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,随时进来都不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.63,0:37:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么异常吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.91,0:37:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,再慢慢看比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.07,0:37:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，如果慢慢看一个地方的话，总觉得会
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.29,0:37:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,时间
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.14,0:37:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,会漏掉经过太久时间就看不到的家伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.07,0:37:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「被子好多啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.57,0:37:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是旅馆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.83,0:37:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,碎了好多！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.28,0:37:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,正好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.87,0:37:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.26,0:37:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,通知……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.94,0:37:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是凌晨3点左右
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.86,0:37:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，我的……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.22,0:37:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,工作时间、业务时间是几点……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.05,0:37:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,结束来着
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.42,0:37:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,放着花的地方最……虽然这个也
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.42,0:37:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.75,0:37:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,到5点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.10,0:37:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有2小时
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.39,0:37:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快到5点的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.84,0:37:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.64,0:38:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,容易发生异变吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.59,0:38:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.06,0:38:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么异变
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.20,0:38:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才是不是啪嚓一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.15,0:38:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啪嚓一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.07,0:38:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好像
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.18,0:38:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,跳过了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.36,0:38:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,变宽敞了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.55,0:38:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是之前也有的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.98,0:38:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不宽敞吗……啊，真的？本来就很宽敞？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.24,0:38:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.00,0:38:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,全家福照片
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.47,0:38:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.06,0:38:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,照片什么的也有点讨厌呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.19,0:38:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在废墟里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.49,0:38:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,照片什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.69,0:38:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果放着的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.35,0:38:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有违和感
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.31,0:38:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,后面是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.51,0:38:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这么蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.17,0:39:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.86,0:39:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.99,0:39:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.57,0:39:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.59,0:39:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.56,0:39:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.88,0:39:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,全部
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.41,0:39:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,都感觉有点违和
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.42,0:39:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧，之前是这样的吗？真的从一开始就？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.32,0:39:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,错位了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.64,0:39:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点违和……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.34,0:39:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，是这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.33,0:39:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,被看着
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.51,0:39:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙在看着我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.71,0:39:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为被看着才觉得违和吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.01,0:39:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,乍一看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.54,0:39:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「诶？」那样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.79,0:39:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉到了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.82,0:39:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但可能还是精准地错过了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.04,0:40:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不过总觉得有点违和感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.39,0:40:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,窗帘吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.91,0:40:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不对呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.37,0:40:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,已经报告了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.19,0:40:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…这个很令人在意啊，这到底是什么呢，放了什么东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.51,0:40:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像人的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.30,0:40:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,纸头…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.22,0:40:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.20,0:40:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，关掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.77,0:40:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,报时4点，还有1小时
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.23,0:40:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,说有多次报告了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.32,0:40:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.43,0:40:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.59,0:41:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，没了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.67,0:41:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没这回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.36,0:41:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.86,0:41:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异常吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.77,0:41:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,复数？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.84,0:41:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有了有了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.69,0:41:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，等等，上面也是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.39,0:41:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.07,0:41:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这种像血痕一样的，可能没有过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.87,0:41:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不知道，有这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.21,0:41:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点违和感，之前没这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.87,0:41:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不是异常
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.39,0:41:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这种好像有过又没有过的，大概不是异常吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.54,0:41:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.17,0:41:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,在已经破破烂烂的基础上……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.72,0:42:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,范围广的话就容易看见呢，果然说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.83,0:42:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊也是，刚才幽灵大概有两只左右
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.05,0:42:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才，看到黑影了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.24,0:42:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然说不是异常？！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.73,0:42:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那个不是异常才异常啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.12,0:42:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，刚才那个
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.81,0:42:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.99,0:42:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.17,0:42:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,黑色的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.72,0:42:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.02,0:42:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那个是BUG的家伙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.04,0:42:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对这边有什么黑色的影……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.59,0:42:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，手
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.75,0:42:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「没有黑色的影子啊」诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.62,0:42:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不，普通地
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.25,0:42:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，原来如此，因为我挡着看不见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.49,0:42:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.18,0:42:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我身后有黑影
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.90,0:42:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.79,0:42:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.52,0:43:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是不是有点奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.98,0:43:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.37,0:43:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,灯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.82,0:43:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我没看到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.77,0:43:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.18,0:43:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊眼珠
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.93,0:43:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果真的有的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.62,0:43:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很明显……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.51,0:43:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还有10分钟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.40,0:43:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是异常
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.52,0:43:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,却没有反应……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.38,0:43:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好在意
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.91,0:43:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.73,0:43:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,到底错过了多少呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.44,0:43:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,从小变化开始不太清楚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.38,0:43:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，还差一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.89,0:43:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还差一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.04,0:43:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐过去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.78,0:43:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.69,0:43:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好，做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.42,0:43:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,总算
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.13,0:43:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,业务成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.45,0:43:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.46,0:43:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然撑住了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.56,0:44:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,找到12个，漏了2个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.07,0:44:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,客房2有物体新增
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.69,0:44:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊有入侵者·幽灵……啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.79,0:44:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是最后，没能点完的那个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.35,0:44:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,「又被入侵了」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.21,0:44:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,会原谅入侵呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.54,0:44:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.45,0:44:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,首先第一件
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.26,0:44:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,攻略
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.17,0:44:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,「已经报告的异常：28/49」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.57,0:44:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.42,0:44:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.38,0:44:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,让我玩一下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.34,0:44:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「蓝色外墙的独栋」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.87,0:44:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「在一楼的走廊和盥洗室」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.52,0:44:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「有遗留痕」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.08,0:44:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,遗留痕是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.94,0:44:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,遗、遗留痕对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.32,0:44:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这、这怎么读啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.38,0:44:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉这里特别像是有名的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.72,0:44:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,各种人？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.28,0:45:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,比如去留宿之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.38,0:45:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,会这么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.26,0:45:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，停不下来啊，蓝色的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.06,0:45:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,乍一看像是普通的好房子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.74,0:45:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好，出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.29,0:45:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,遗留痕是指有人去世的痕迹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.86,0:45:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，好逼真啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.74,0:45:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.95,0:45:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.71,0:45:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.90,0:45:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有人住过的痕迹就这样留着…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.84,0:45:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.23,0:45:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.81,0:45:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,痕迹就这样留着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.61,0:45:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.52,0:46:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像是住过……与其说住过，睡过觉的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.74,0:46:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不要挠挠呀～
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.25,0:46:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,外观
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.93,0:46:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.40,0:46:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊深处太暗看不见呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.09,0:46:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.78,0:46:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,异常
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.38,0:46:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.52,0:46:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,窗帘原本是关着的？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.73,0:46:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好～
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.03,0:46:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.26,0:46:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不要挠挠呀～
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.11,0:46:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喵～呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.22,0:46:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喵喵叫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.09,0:46:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.62,0:46:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,稍稍
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.29,0:46:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.71,0:46:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.19,0:46:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得这里没关着
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.91,0:47:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，原本是关着的？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.15,0:47:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,原本挂着这种颜色的窗帘吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.19,0:47:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，最初用于记忆的时间……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.86,0:47:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这里拉门有关着吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.30,0:47:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.08,0:47:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，不知道最初的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.93,0:47:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这再怎么说不一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.56,0:47:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.48,0:47:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,要是冰箱里像这样留着很讨……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.78,0:47:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个棒子是什么？原本就有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.68,0:47:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.04,0:47:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,门开zh……
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.84,0:47:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～感觉……窗户没开着吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.87,0:47:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？等等
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.59,0:47:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,动不了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.47,0:48:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.49,0:48:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.22,0:48:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,大家明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.19,0:48:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,差点就略过了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.95,0:48:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能再来一份吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.93,0:48:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,生活感就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.26,0:48:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,残留着
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.26,0:48:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,花？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.16,0:48:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这很像血痕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.65,0:48:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好——
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.41,0:48:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好像会被说不能回答「好——」之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.15,0:48:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还有不能抢话之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.40,0:48:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.55,0:48:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,敲门声
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.21,0:48:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.40,0:48:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,「好害怕去回应」
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.23,0:49:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.50,0:49:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.83,0:49:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,会说不能做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.58,0:49:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.42,0:49:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.91,0:49:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.91,0:49:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.30,0:49:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.07,0:49:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.62,0:49:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好像看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.94,0:49:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喔唷
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.47,0:49:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,俊雄君
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.52,0:49:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得那样很不好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.01,0:49:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的事，不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.29,0:49:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.86,0:49:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说是异变
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,中途出现的感觉不好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.87,0:49:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,喵～呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.77,0:49:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.59,0:50:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么——
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.58,0:50:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.57,0:50:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,喵怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.54,0:50:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.83,0:50:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊这
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.90,0:50:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在取暖
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.52,0:50:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,到底过着怎样的生活啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.08,0:50:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，如果自己设身处地想想的话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.04,0:50:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对很讨厌呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.84,0:50:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得没变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.05,0:50:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.22,0:50:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是这种类型的对讲门铃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.35,0:50:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什么，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.43,0:51:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果自己设身处地想想的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.66,0:51:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在自己家里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.68,0:51:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有陌生人在这里过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.65,0:51:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.67,0:51:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,光是能被看到这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.03,0:51:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大概会非常讨厌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.94,0:51:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.02,0:51:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.23,0:51:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有这样的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.38,0:51:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,像黑色污渍一样的……血？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.63,0:51:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.47,0:51:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,生锈了——
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.56,0:52:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好真实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.93,0:52:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不是——能在这里过夜真的很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.19,0:52:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.79,0:52:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么房间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.81,0:52:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.42,0:52:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.61,0:52:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.13,0:52:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这里空着的来着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.52,0:52:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯那里看起来会有什么东西过来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.56,0:52:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯真讨厌呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.99,0:53:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.86,0:53:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得，这么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.29,0:53:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.29,0:53:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不，搞不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.17,0:53:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,完型崩坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.40,0:53:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.82,0:53:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟哟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.58,0:53:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,洗衣机
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.22,0:53:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,原本那里开着吗？开着的开着的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.19,0:53:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.91,0:53:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还有，自己家里不会贴这种贴纸
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.45,0:53:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.72,0:53:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.26,0:53:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.44,0:53:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,果然那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.64,0:53:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好真实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.42,0:53:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真的住过这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.77,0:53:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,直到最后一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.66,0:53:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.48,0:54:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好真实，好有真实感
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.20,0:54:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在看什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.77,0:54:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，一开始是这样的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.43,0:54:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,原本……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.35,0:54:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉看不见啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.54,0:54:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是异常
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.97,0:54:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,贴着什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.53,0:54:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.97,0:54:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉时间就那样停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.35,0:54:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了w
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.89,0:54:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯的感觉也是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.86,0:54:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.48,0:54:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个污渍好像血痕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.99,0:54:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色塑料布就那样……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.74,0:54:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,放在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.26,0:54:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.12,0:54:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,房间里发生过什么的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.47,0:55:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什……还以为是假面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.36,0:55:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,复数报告了？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.26,0:55:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么有垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.69,0:55:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,超容易看出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.16,0:55:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有点违和感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.34,0:55:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,原来这么宽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.61,0:55:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很多报告了？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.63,0:55:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.27,0:55:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.02,0:55:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.75,0:55:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,着
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.70,0:55:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.22,0:56:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙在看着我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.49,0:56:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.00,0:56:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,当你窥视时，那边也在看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.41,0:56:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,发现多处异常
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.23,0:56:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，总觉得不对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.34,0:56:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室和这个楼梯倒是没什么违和感
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.79,0:56:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.50,0:56:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这个刚才也有？难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.91,0:56:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.34,0:56:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这个房间是不是太没东西了？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.69,0:56:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,又有异常
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.34,0:56:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,被检出很多
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.99,0:56:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个房间，大概是什……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.98,0:56:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.69,0:56:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,说这什……就这么按下去有点那个
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.55,0:56:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉到违和感
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.02,0:57:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然说检测到大量异常
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.07,0:57:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，搞不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.98,0:57:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常危险」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.37,0:57:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「请立即避难」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.28,0:57:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.46,0:57:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～～～～～
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.85,0:57:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.24,0:57:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,盥洗间的摄像头故障？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.40,0:57:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.28,0:57:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，摄像头不是一直在拍吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.78,0:57:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.88,0:57:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H80&}寝室{\alpha&H00&}里物体的替换
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.81,0:57:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关有入侵者……怎么玄关被疯狂侵入啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.41,0:57:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,寝室里物体的替换
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.74,0:57:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——，完全没发现
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.63,0:57:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,开始业务，OK
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.61,0:58:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,以上相同
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.50,0:58:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是有呢，这种像面具一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.42,0:58:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是客厅吧，客厅里没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.08,0:58:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,说过盥洗间的摄像头故障呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.96,0:58:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.10,0:58:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.30,0:58:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后这里是楼梯……是玄关吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.37,0:58:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关玄关
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.88,0:58:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,和室
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.27,0:58:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的话和室不怎……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.52,0:58:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.25,0:58:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,入侵？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.81,0:58:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，但是没有蓝色塑料布
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.57,0:58:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我明明提了一堆蓝色塑料布的话题
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.19,0:58:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,原来原本能看到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.32,0:58:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是捕捉到了某种违和感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.58,0:58:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色塑料布确实进入了视线
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.77,0:58:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.76,0:58:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,以为一开始就有那个了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.27,0:59:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,原来没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.38,0:59:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说这里也有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.55,0:59:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有、有两个呢，幽灵入侵者和物体的替换来着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.43,0:59:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,污渍之类的原本有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.61,0:59:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，还是那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.91,0:59:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.58,0:59:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在往后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.11,0:59:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,会发生异变哦 这样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.17,0:59:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这是Toppo巧克力棒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.85,0:59:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.87,0:59:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.52,0:59:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关，没有异常
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.14,0:59:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊，没有异常
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.28,0:59:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.49,0:59:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.31,0:59:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.46,1:00:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道，客厅乱七八糟的，一直很难看清，盥洗间也是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.47,1:00:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.14,1:00:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯也
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.12,1:00:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题，这种，建成这样的很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.77,1:00:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,和室我也觉得可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.59,1:00:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,找房子的时候，和室呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.06,1:00:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我会优先找没有的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.22,1:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.73,1:00:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所和浴室分开……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.54,1:00:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不是整体浴室的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.48,1:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，好像没有和室的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.89,1:00:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,去找
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.84,1:00:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,和室的话
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.63,1:00:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.38,1:00:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.14,1:00:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.02,1:00:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而且壁橱什么的也有点讨厌
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.45,1:00:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.71,1:00:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么啊，果然还是，贞子什么的，咒怨什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.45,1:00:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,又是冰箱啊……不对，洗衣机
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.93,1:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是有那种印xi
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.40,1:01:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.20,1:01:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.40,1:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是感觉到了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.16,1:01:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还是只是想撒娇而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.10,1:01:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真是…这个房间的违和感察觉不到啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.20,1:01:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱……啊，关着了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.65,1:01:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛，很容易发现呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.74,1:01:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,「喵喵们也在监视着」
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.60,1:01:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有喵喵们的话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.26,1:01:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这种地方也是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.59,1:01:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然恐怖感会减半
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.26,1:01:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，搞不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.83,1:01:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是隐约能看到什么？原本就有？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.15,1:02:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,像脸一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.89,1:02:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,原本就有吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.36,1:02:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.47,1:02:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得哪里已经有异变了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.44,1:02:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉已经有了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.50,1:02:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关被入侵了呐
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.55,1:02:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么——
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在笑
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.20,1:02:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,明明很快就找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.67,1:02:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,容易找的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.22,1:02:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很感激
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.00,1:02:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但让人吓一跳的类型也……
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.50,1:02:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,很多啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.66,1:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，又来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.24,1:02:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,放着垃圾，这是垃圾吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.45,1:02:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,呼嗯……
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.19,1:03:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.23,1:03:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.44,1:03:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下，让我先选一下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.63,1:03:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～这里的违和感我完全搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.32,1:03:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，原来是这样子的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.10,1:03:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这样…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.74,1:03:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微脏了的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.72,1:03:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还是搞不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.30,1:03:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道是哪些
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.30,1:03:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.40,1:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,总之先这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.72,1:03:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,都选选也可以有吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.26,1:03:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,比较容易找到的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.08,1:03:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就像刚才那样
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.68,1:03:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要是能「咚」地一下就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.35,1:03:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这里之前有人字梯吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.17,1:03:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.23,1:03:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，我总觉得有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.46,1:03:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,窗户是…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.04,1:04:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对的吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.57,1:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.32,1:04:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,可疑的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.98,1:04:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在，凌晨
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.63,1:04:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在通知您大约2点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.57,1:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,电话那种的倒是很好发现，包括冰箱里冒出些什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.60,1:04:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,「我没疯」
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.12,1:04:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.67,1:04:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样的告示吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.24,1:04:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，这个…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.12,1:04:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,JSP的游戏啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.06,1:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是以真的实际发生过
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.62,1:04:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,的报告
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.57,1:04:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,为基础
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.78,1:04:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,制作的吧，我记得
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.89,1:04:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.94,1:04:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有什么奇怪的声音，但为什么什么现象都没有？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.10,1:04:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我漏看了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.34,1:04:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,「报告也是」
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.99,1:04:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「直播没有卡住」
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.63,1:04:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.71,1:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「只是这么自称的游戏」但是真的是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.33,1:05:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,报告之类，提交上来的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.06,1:05:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,作为基础制作的，这样的话好像在2里是这样写的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.67,1:05:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,写过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.07,1:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「是这样的设定」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.25,1:05:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.74,1:05:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.63,1:05:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是「这种的设定」啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.48,1:05:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是真的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.41,1:05:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,又传来咔当一声
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.00,1:05:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,声音这么响，果然……
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.89,1:05:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,相应的有那么……
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.14,1:05:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这棵树有这么长吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.92,1:05:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得有点违和吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.63,1:05:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.67,1:06:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,卷帘门关着的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.26,1:06:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.24,1:06:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,又关上了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.81,1:06:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.89,1:06:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点违和感，是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.54,1:06:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,杂草丛生？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.14,1:06:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.05,1:06:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.06,1:06:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉玄关有违和感啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.62,1:06:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.59,1:06:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有血痕什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.93,1:06:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.68,1:06:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，这个原本就有吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.19,1:06:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是染满了血吗，是我的错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.02,1:06:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好像听到上楼梯的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.33,1:06:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,明明像是楼梯，但楼梯上没有人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.88,1:06:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不，既然有声音，那肯定
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.64,1:06:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,应该来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.10,1:07:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还以为是什么呢，原来是箭头啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.07,1:07:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定错过了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.76,1:07:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.68,1:07:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，这个刚才也有
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.01,1:07:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,俊雄那家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.19,1:07:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,咒怨也很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.09,1:07:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,类似咒怨之类，贞子之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.31,1:07:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为那些
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.96,1:07:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我才会不适应日式恐怖和和室呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.36,1:07:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,在取暖
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.51,1:07:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,俊雄again
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.77,1:07:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都nothing
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.88,1:07:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,以上nothing
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.17,1:08:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这个好像，红外这东西
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.17,1:08:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,咔哒咔哒地
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.10,1:08:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就像切灯一样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.78,1:08:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.03,1:08:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,坟墓？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.46,1:08:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对没有吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.41,1:08:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说……但是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.25,1:08:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.81,1:08:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但总觉得「家前面不可能有坟墓吧」这种违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.11,1:08:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,果然记忆力这东西其实挺模糊的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.20,1:08:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你  在  看  吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.60,1:08:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙在看着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.24,1:08:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看着呢，眼珠
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.42,1:08:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,…对眼珠就用眼珠来回应
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.89,1:08:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不过实际上这种
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.96,1:08:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,地方之类的，总觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.30,1:09:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我觉得不会去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.79,1:09:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.77,1:09:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.57,1:09:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对没有这种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.08,1:09:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，找到了，不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.63,1:09:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉记忆力得很强才行呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.15,1:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.76,1:09:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不到违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.30,1:09:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「才不去啊太吓人了」
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.73,1:09:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.19,1:09:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是回声吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.20,1:09:36.85,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※风评被害金子美铃\N指路：BV1rq4y1d7mp\N或者油管：FKe2tFt7NuI
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.62,1:09:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不，谁都会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.39,1:09:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,万一发生什么要去的情况
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.42,1:09:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,会变得超亮的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.79,1:09:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然可能亮不起来就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.84,1:09:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，但那也有点死亡flag
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.63,1:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有这种海报吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.31,1:10:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉，可能因为我所以看不到吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.67,1:10:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.37,1:10:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到声音
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.56,1:10:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,时钟？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.76,1:10:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,脚步声
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.47,1:10:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,听着像是正在上来的声音啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.37,1:10:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.99,1:10:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.50,1:10:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.92,1:10:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,电话
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.66,1:10:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里关着的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.73,1:10:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，该关着的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.40,1:11:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，有相当的灵感的人什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.53,1:11:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,敏感的人之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.45,1:11:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.09,1:11:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,光是看着这些……
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.35,1:11:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,门把手好像在动
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.10,1:11:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,果然能感觉到之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.38,1:11:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,会头疼什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.96,1:11:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那种……
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.83,1:11:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,现象之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.63,1:11:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，蓝色塑料布！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.11,1:11:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,上次没注意到的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.69,1:11:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,会有吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.08,1:11:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.96,1:11:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,黄色窗帘，不过
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.70,1:11:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,很明亮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.77,1:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.69,1:11:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我在老家
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.76,1:11:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,和姐姐一起……
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.07,1:11:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,同一个房间
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.20,1:11:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,住在那的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.88,1:11:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好像看到什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.52,1:12:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我把家里的窗帘换成了红色的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.99,1:12:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然后阳光照进来的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.02,1:12:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.28,1:12:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,整个房间都变得通红
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.74,1:12:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.92,1:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.54,1:12:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,窗帘的颜色什么的，很重要呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.10,1:12:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,红彤彤的真的有点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.68,1:12:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不是有洗照片的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.83,1:12:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么站在折叠梯上呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.08,1:12:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.13,1:12:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.97,1:12:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这种违和感啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.74,1:12:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就像刚才那样
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.57,1:12:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果出现那种半透明的人影，倒是容易找
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.37,1:12:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但细微的变化就搞不懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.21,1:13:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「别找沃利」好怀念
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.22,1:13:01.22,AN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}※绘本《沃利在哪里》\N以此制作的恶作剧Flash动画\N在观众认真寻找画面中的沃利时会突然跳出鬼脸吓人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.15,1:13:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我对那种东西……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.81,1:13:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是相当不擅长的类型
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.62,1:13:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那种突然……啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.28,1:13:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是血痕
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.83,1:13:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,突然跳出来之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.81,1:13:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,正面威胁你的那种，我有点不擅长呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.92,1:13:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.00,1:13:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.76,1:13:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，原来就有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.97,1:13:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,电风扇的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.61,1:13:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，果然在偷看
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.38,1:13:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.12,1:13:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.68,1:13:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好——！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.23,1:13:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,「Jump Scare」
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.63,1:13:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对对
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.49,1:13:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,跳杀类型的很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.76,1:13:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,做到
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.77,1:13:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,力——！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.63,1:14:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？我又被入侵玄关了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.31,1:14:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但除此之外
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.31,1:14:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我都有好好汇报
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.25,1:14:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.57,1:14:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.59,1:14:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「Jump Scare系不行吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.23,1:14:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，我不太擅长
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.99,1:14:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是大的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.29,1:14:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,比如「咚」的一声，所以
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.40,1:14:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼屋什么的，在电影院看恐怖电影都不行
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.43,1:14:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.60,1:14:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在电影院里，就算不是恐怖片，只要声音很大
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.72,1:14:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就会被吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.79,1:14:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.52,1:14:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,会抖一下
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.46,1:14:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,连周围的人都吓到了，所以我不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.94,1:14:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,声音太大真的不行
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.87,1:14:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,声音NG
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.58,1:14:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「那反而挺羞耻的」
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.86,1:14:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,超级羞耻的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.95,1:14:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,明明不是恐怖片，只是声音大一点就吓到
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.24,1:14:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.28,1:14:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,「接下来是真正有名的地方」…啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.70,1:14:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.95,1:14:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,神奈川县的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.54,1:15:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,观音崎公园，是这样读吧，是观音菩萨的观音吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.72,1:15:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「明治时代建造的旧军用」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.55,1:15:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,「{\alpha&H80&}要{\alpha&H00&}塞遗迹」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.21,1:15:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,「无衬砌的」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.02,1:15:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这个怎么读？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.88,1:15:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,隐道？怎么读……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.01,1:15:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么道？不
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.03,1:15:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「战死」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.92,1:15:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,无……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.52,1:15:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,「无名尸骨」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.75,1:15:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「等零星分布」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.37,1:15:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我也可能是第一次，这个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.39,1:15:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可能没见过
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.55,1:15:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.64,1:15:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,「隧道是指隧道（Tunnel）吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.84,1:15:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.10,1:15:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好，去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.61,1:15:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.34,1:15:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不是凶宅啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.96,1:15:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,终于
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.98,1:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这……不算房屋业务吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.66,1:15:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道算什……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.07,1:15:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不过隧道啊…有些讨厌呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.12,1:16:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,祠堂？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.91,1:16:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得，深山里的祠堂这种地方果然
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.00,1:16:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不太
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.71,1:16:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,人类
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.02,1:16:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不能踏入的地方之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.79,1:16:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.20,1:16:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,写了什么……「隧道」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.23,1:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「因为有坍塌的危险，所以无关人员」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.13,1:16:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,「禁止通行」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.06,1:16:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,犬鸣隧道也很有名呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.20,1:16:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.99,1:16:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，不太清楚哪里是怎么连接的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.18,1:16:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.49,1:16:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还没开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.06,1:16:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道也
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.62,1:16:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不太想去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.46,1:16:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是墓地对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.33,1:17:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,「谁都可以自由使用」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.12,1:17:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话不想用啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.16,1:17:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.60,1:17:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,会发生异常
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.59,1:17:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,只是看的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.56,1:17:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.13,1:17:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是因为完全没有灵感吧，不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.53,1:17:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,也没那么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.06,1:17:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在哭
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.87,1:17:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,也没那么……
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.84,1:17:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,非常可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.15,1:17:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.60,1:17:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,倒也没那么强吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.41,1:17:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别人家可能更可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.61,1:17:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要排个一二三的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.53,1:17:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,个人来说这里并没有那么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.19,1:18:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,房子那边感觉更真实一些
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.85,1:18:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.47,1:18:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是有的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.01,1:18:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但按地点来说这边
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.71,1:18:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.62,1:18:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉更糟糕吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.76,1:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,按地点来说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.04,1:18:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然看不到什么血痕啊、生活气息之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.89,1:18:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,脚印
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.29,1:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,「核心部分在外面才可怕」
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.00,1:18:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.91,1:18:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，可能很难找到吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.10,1:18:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得……
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.92,1:18:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这里，原来是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.32,1:18:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.19,1:19:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,祠堂之类、坟墓之类的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.60,1:19:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,锥形筒应该没有倒
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.74,1:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,「毕竟隧道是连接异地的东西」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.76,1:19:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.80,1:19:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟原本不太
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.17,1:19:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是人走的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.44,1:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,山之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.13,1:19:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,说到山啊，果然
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.00,1:19:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,其中
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.18,1:19:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有守护神之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.45,1:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不太有人…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.68,1:19:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,像是不能踏入的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.49,1:19:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,也有那样的地方吧，所以那些地方
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.18,1:19:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,开凿或者建隧道之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.63,1:19:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的事
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.26,1:19:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.88,1:20:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,最近
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.63,1:20:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好～
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.08,1:20:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.03,1:20:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为也玩过《静谧田园》什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.87,1:20:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可能多少受到了影响
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.90,1:20:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,村庄之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.84,1:20:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有种违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.77,1:20:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～变成寂静岭样式了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.17,1:20:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「该不会是从里面敲门？」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.37,1:20:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,反过来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.76,1:20:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,总感觉有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.27,1:20:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.79,1:20:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.36,1:20:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,土地神大人？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.93,1:21:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小小的祠堂
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.55,1:21:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有点在意呢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.39,1:21:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,单纯地
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.69,1:21:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.16,1:21:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小祠堂之类的……
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.39,1:21:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那种事可能会在意吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.14,1:21:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.77,1:21:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪种
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.93,1:21:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,眼球吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.32,1:21:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.10,1:21:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,充血得很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.13,1:21:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真容易看到啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.07,1:21:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有不容易找的变化呢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.17,1:21:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,东西越少
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.23,1:21:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,越容易找吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.41,1:21:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,房间之类的，如果乱七八糟的话完全看不出来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.79,1:22:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.48,1:22:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.83,1:22:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.76,1:22:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟日本的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.16,1:22:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,历史什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.88,1:22:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,很长
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.36,1:22:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,各种各样的事
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.01,1:22:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,存在
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.24,1:22:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.77,1:22:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也能建起来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.73,1:22:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害呢，这个，虫子？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.37,1:22:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个隧道没什么特别的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.73,1:22:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，感觉小孩子什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.38,1:22:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.45,1:22:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.56,1:22:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就会去想呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.49,1:22:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,最重要的是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.40,1:22:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不要半开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.23,1:23:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,去这种地方
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.10,1:23:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很重要
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.76,1:23:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢恐怖，但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.43,1:23:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,实际的地方之类的呢…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.33,1:23:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.69,1:23:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,会看，但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.34,1:23:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在YouTube上这种地方
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.30,1:23:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,试着去看看了 这种的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.20,1:23:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但果然，实际去的话
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.45,1:23:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.22,1:23:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「不想去呢」是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.07,1:23:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得最好别去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.83,1:23:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我开始说要去的话
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.73,1:23:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,希望大家阻止我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.65,1:23:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得只能想到被「邀请」了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.29,1:23:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么……
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.88,1:23:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.59,1:23:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.90,1:24:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「要阻止吗？」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.08,1:24:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「现在紧急拍着视频呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.41,1:24:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不过实际上……
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.18,1:24:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,应该会
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.32,1:24:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不住去想
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.79,1:24:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,用那种感觉过去也
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.67,1:24:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉也不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.79,1:24:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.66,1:24:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,只是看的话
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.86,1:24:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看别人去那种地方，到没那么
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.19,1:24:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.55,1:24:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但自己去那个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.66,1:24:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不太能想象
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.57,1:24:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.16,1:24:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我错过了什么异常？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.28,1:24:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.54,1:24:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.76,1:24:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，等等，这个
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.91,1:24:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,应该贴在另一边的，这边
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.12,1:25:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.15,1:25:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…这里不是森林吗…？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.07,1:25:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,山
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.72,1:25:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.84,1:25:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好暗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.03,1:25:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，来得及吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.38,1:25:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,被漆黑包围
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.39,1:25:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,复数
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.72,1:25:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.07,1:25:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,水li…该、该叫什么，这种样子的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.52,1:25:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这里OK
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.74,1:25:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也感觉不太对劲吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.73,1:25:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样的招牌吗…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.19,1:25:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也感觉有点违和感…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.69,1:26:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种像眼珠一样的东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.60,1:26:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,果然没有呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.26,1:26:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.62,1:26:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「莲花吗？」是莲花呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.51,1:26:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.43,1:26:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这样搞不好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.39,1:26:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,像那种，在集中精神寻找异变的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.89,1:26:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,突然吓人一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.69,1:26:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得真的不好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.82,1:26:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.88,1:26:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「那种的不擅长呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.71,1:26:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那种确实不擅长呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.74,1:26:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢恐怖
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.65,1:26:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为真的感觉可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.84,1:26:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,因为真的会吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.90,1:26:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不难受吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.59,1:26:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.39,1:26:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,像忍者一样
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.54,1:27:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为很恐怖…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.40,1:27:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我会认真追求恐怖感，看恐怖片之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.60,1:27:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然也会看这种
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.54,1:27:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很认真的渲染恐怖的那种
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.33,1:27:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,偷看的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.96,1:27:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖，完全
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.30,1:27:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来不害怕的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.70,1:27:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然被这么看
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.97,1:27:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,其实好好的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.86,1:27:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖的东西就是恐怖
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.83,1:27:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然反应可能有些平淡
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.21,1:27:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「呀——」那样的尖叫不太
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.13,1:27:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有在追求认真的吓人方式
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.66,1:27:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.12,1:27:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是蝙蝠吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.97,1:27:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.96,1:27:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.99,1:28:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像有像诅咒录像一样的东西……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.21,1:28:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,放出来了一瞬间吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.71,1:28:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,「真的被吓到了吗」
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.30,1:28:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真的呢，相当被吓到了，真的很可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.62,1:28:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你看
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.22,1:28:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是，不是某个地方嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.25,1:28:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.34,1:28:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很可怕，而且总觉得不太
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.42,1:28:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.28,1:28:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.30,1:28:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不太
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.59,1:28:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，连看都不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.86,1:28:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会这么想，但不好说，只是看看可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.24,1:28:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只是看看没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.70,1:28:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，怎么增加了这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.39,1:28:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.99,1:28:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,应该只有这里的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.89,1:28:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得后面没这么多
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.54,1:29:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不过实际上呢，像这种有人去世的地方，是有的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.88,1:29:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不会随便的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.42,1:29:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,跑过去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.41,1:29:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,去看
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.38,1:29:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是因为虚构
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.90,1:29:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.49,1:29:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.79,1:29:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧，这种…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.97,1:29:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,弯曲着上去的树，原本有吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.61,1:29:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,像人的腿一样
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.43,1:29:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没有头
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.13,1:29:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有头
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.25,1:29:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然注意到了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.99,1:29:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这黑斑是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.02,1:29:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.80,1:30:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,「来这里」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.84,1:30:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.22,1:30:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.60,1:30:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看这边！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.77,1:30:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,枯萎穿心攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.47,1:30:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那种吓人一跳的类型呢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.81,1:30:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不行哦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.19,1:30:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不过刚才那个不算吓人一跳的类型吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.19,1:30:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.88,1:30:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过折腾来折腾去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.71,1:30:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,再差一会儿业务本身
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.10,1:30:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就要结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.31,1:30:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,异变本身也许很容易看到
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.99,1:31:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有漏看的呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.25,1:31:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉乍一看没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.77,1:31:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,乍一看是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.47,1:31:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道里有入侵者？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.68,1:31:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.66,1:31:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,又，我又放过入侵者了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.09,1:31:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,「未知的房子已开放」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.23,1:31:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果做好心理准备」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.16,1:31:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,「请进行监视」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.07,1:31:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,已解放
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.58,1:32:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,「又被入侵了……」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.68,1:32:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.58,1:32:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.17,1:32:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,宅邸
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.56,1:32:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,「{\alpha&H80&}建龄{\alpha&H00&}已经超过160年的」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.47,1:32:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,「古民宅」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.22,1:32:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哦怎么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.15,1:32:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地照到了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.41,1:32:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「院子里的防空洞内，有邪教的痕迹」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.29,1:32:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,邪教系吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.32,1:32:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.31,1:32:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.99,1:32:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,业务
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.59,1:32:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.89,1:32:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.25,1:32:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，相对干净…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.45,1:32:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,…的感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.79,1:33:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这种的也有点太真实了吧，果然
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.62,1:33:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有人住过的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.52,1:33:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不过，整理得挺干净的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.06,1:33:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.93,1:33:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,人偶之类的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.14,1:33:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,人偶之类的很可怕吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.37,1:33:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微有点开着让人在意
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.31,1:33:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,会在意呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.37,1:33:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,状态相当不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.42,1:33:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,盘子也没碎
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.46,1:33:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会有蓝色塑料布…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.86,1:33:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,现在应该还没发生异变吧，因为是用来记忆的时间嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.18,1:33:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.58,1:33:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好像
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.32,1:33:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么神社的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.12,1:33:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,符咒之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.39,1:33:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有贴着
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.72,1:33:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,符咒，一般不会贴的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.19,1:33:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么有马赛克雕像啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.76,1:33:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.17,1:33:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,剥皮……
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.25,1:33:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.78,1:33:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,确实有点好像
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.51,1:34:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有点感觉到了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.42,1:34:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,井
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.73,1:34:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,「从现在开始是异常现象报告增多的时段」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.21,1:34:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,「如果确认到变化请报告」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.02,1:34:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都看到了吗？不，没全看到
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.85,1:34:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，这真的是
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.91,1:34:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那种感觉的……
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.23,1:34:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,家
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.18,1:34:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好像
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.30,1:34:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，应该没有吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.74,1:34:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,原本就有的？这种缝隙
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.94,1:34:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.03,1:34:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.30,1:34:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉看起来像人的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.22,1:34:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.74,1:34:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.47,1:34:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果说是「不想住的家」
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.08,1:34:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是普通人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.78,1:34:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，这里应该是这个家里我最不喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.73,1:35:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这种的，这是地下室吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.14,1:35:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不太
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.84,1:35:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,脸？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.06,1:35:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.00,1:35:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「只是个可疑人员」入侵者呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.13,1:35:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,总之，那种事也！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.67,1:35:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的吓人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.00,1:35:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,人最可怕说
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.83,1:35:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.45,1:35:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说这里面变成那样了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.52,1:35:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.35,1:35:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳的微波炉
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.12,1:35:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别突然用啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.99,1:35:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,还在想电波怎么过来的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.42,1:35:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这里，也就是说和这里联通，刚才的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.05,1:35:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,水井
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.82,1:35:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那边的入口
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.34,1:35:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.39,1:35:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,前面是那个？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.41,1:35:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.26,1:36:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吧？绝对是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.36,1:36:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.93,1:36:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.25,1:36:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，人偶在这种地方……
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.22,1:36:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不该是在上面吗
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.35,1:36:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为人偶可怕，我一直在检查
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.77,1:36:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.96,1:36:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然意外地会漏看这些
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.84,1:36:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,马赛克那家伙那边到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.85,1:36:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.23,1:36:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，原来有人偶
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.84,1:36:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,人偶
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.62,1:36:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.27,1:36:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.44,1:36:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.11,1:36:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,点可怕的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.50,1:36:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,地方呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.33,1:36:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.51,1:37:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.76,1:37:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「祭坛是倒十字所以……」确实，大概
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.39,1:37:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,总之，有点穿透了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.42,1:37:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,马赛克的那个
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.08,1:37:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.59,1:37:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.89,1:37:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,各种各样的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.77,1:37:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,会去想呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.34,1:37:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,一般这种地方……
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.86,1:37:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的祭拜场所
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.47,1:37:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不会建的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.09,1:37:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.94,1:37:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,相当……咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.14,1:37:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色塑料布……
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.44,1:37:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,变得
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.75,1:37:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是历史悠久的古民居
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.93,1:37:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,以前可能也有过那种东西吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.60,1:37:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,各自在家里
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.42,1:37:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那种
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.93,1:37:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,像设个神龛一样，但也不是神龛什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.67,1:38:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在也
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.75,1:38:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还留着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.08,1:38:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，吓我一跳，我觉得这种不太好哦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.72,1:38:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.68,1:38:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那个，不太好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.92,1:38:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.31,1:38:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,会吓人一跳的那种
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.03,1:38:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在集中精力找错的时候做这种事，真的是
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.51,1:38:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,和「不要找沃利」一样
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.46,1:38:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,「不好呢！」不好w
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.61,1:38:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,「我觉得不太好」对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.01,1:38:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那个不好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.78,1:38:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，实际上……
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.77,1:38:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,搞得太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.82,1:38:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这么搞不好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.88,1:39:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得我的……
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.21,1:39:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,按我的理论，人……
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.42,1:39:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,人类全都……
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.57,1:39:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H80&}住过的{\alpha&H00&}我认为都是凶宅
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.38,1:39:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.94,1:39:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,会以不好的形式留下来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.56,1:39:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,无论什么地方，都住着各种各样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.46,1:39:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有着各种各样的历史，所以无论什么地方
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.13,1:39:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,各种
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.97,1:39:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得都会有的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.36,1:39:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上，我觉得人类全都是凶宅
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.18,1:39:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是话又说回来
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.94,1:39:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是近期的，或者就这样保留原样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.47,1:39:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.15,1:39:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还是会觉得不舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.35,1:39:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.42,1:39:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,人头
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.57,1:39:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,「正因为历史的分量所以才」是的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.41,1:39:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,各种
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.87,1:40:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.18,1:40:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是走过的街道
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.52,1:40:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还是房子
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.07,1:40:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果追溯数百年甚至更久的历史
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.64,1:40:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那地方曾经是什么样的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.26,1:40:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因为不知道就住着
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.63,1:40:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大概也会有一些能住的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.27,1:40:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.57,1:40:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样，砰地一下出现在前面的话，果然
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.05,1:40:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这里要是也被填埋了的话，总觉得有什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.47,1:40:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道里面有什么，比如井啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.55,1:40:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在虽然几乎没有井了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.04,1:40:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,把这里填了然后在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.14,1:40:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,建个大的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.36,1:40:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,豪宅
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.35,1:40:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果建起来的话
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.09,1:40:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个住的人
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.19,1:40:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好好地
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.12,1:40:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,查一下可能会知道
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.43,1:40:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.88,1:40:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.92,1:41:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就算在这种地方上面建了建筑
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.52,1:41:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好像变了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.50,1:41:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.10,1:41:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道反而更好的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.08,1:41:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,应该挺多的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.51,1:41:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但知道了就会觉得不舒服呢
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.53,1:41:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,灵感强的人
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.69,1:41:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会感觉到什么吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.41,1:41:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我算是比较迟钝的那种
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.07,1:41:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,所以感觉不到
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.41,1:41:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌，手印……本来就有？这个，没有吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.65,1:41:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「眼不见心不烦嘛」是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.29,1:41:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不太
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.27,1:42:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,自己住的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.10,1:42:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,还是别查太多
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.76,1:42:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.55,1:42:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,八音盒？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.25,1:42:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,《致爱丽丝》
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.65,1:42:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,经常会说有呢，在这种地方…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.81,1:42:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,明明没通电的电视却开了，或者八音盒响了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.00,1:42:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,或者电话响了之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.47,1:42:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,像是通过电波传过来一样
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.51,1:42:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,经常听说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.09,1:42:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.86,1:42:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感突然消失了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.51,1:42:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还有水井之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.82,1:42:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,缺损的历史
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.51,1:42:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,会在意吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.86,1:42:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.41,1:42:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.26,1:42:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么在上面
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.22,1:42:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有拉门啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.67,1:43:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,上面平时不太会注意，但果然还是有变化的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.71,1:43:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会在这里铺蓝布呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.01,1:43:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,正在
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.98,1:43:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,顶礼膜拜
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.87,1:43:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.97,1:43:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,事情
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.72,1:43:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会这样破开口呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.83,1:43:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,还是会好奇的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.32,1:43:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这里会放着人偶呢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.05,1:43:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,还有书什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.12,1:43:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过实际上很少有人进去过吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.34,1:43:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样保留着
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.47,1:43:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.60,1:43:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室也是
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.26,1:44:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,以前的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.96,1:44:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还留着那种感觉呢
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.70,1:44:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶家以前就是那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.40,1:44:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是现在，这种房子还是……
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.86,1:44:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不为人知的房子应该还留着很多吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.79,1:44:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,到了现代成为凶宅
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.30,1:44:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,变得能住了之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.72,1:44:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的拍摄许可…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.20,1:44:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不是有个人影，原本就有？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.92,1:44:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，也是呢，毕竟
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.17,1:44:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，意外地看不到
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.69,1:44:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那个超自然地融入进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.46,1:44:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,从什么地方
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.09,1:44:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,买来的这东西
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.00,1:45:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是就是说历史超长的对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.06,1:45:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不知不觉已经4点了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.85,1:45:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，意外地顺利…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.73,1:45:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,进行下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.90,1:45:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.00,1:45:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,说了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.39,1:45:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.10,1:45:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.82,1:45:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在竟然
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.23,1:45:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过房间本身不脏乱，是个好房间呢
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.33,1:45:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但是呢，我反而觉得这种不脏乱挺
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.55,1:45:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得不妙
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.45,1:45:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大体上废屋之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.62,1:45:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真的会乱得很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.30,1:45:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,砰的一下，碰碎什么东西之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.41,1:45:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,应该会散乱一地的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.03,1:46:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有呢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.97,1:46:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样整齐摆放的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.55,1:46:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.84,1:46:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会感到违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.24,1:46:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.24,1:46:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像漏掉了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.06,1:46:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.10,1:46:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「还残留着生活气息不错呢」
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.03,1:46:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.34,1:46:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,生活气息…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.84,1:46:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,被破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.76,1:46:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.61,1:46:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没有被破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.55,1:46:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真正危险的地方是反而没被破坏，应该这么说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.63,1:46:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,比如有涂鸦之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.59,1:46:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.22,1:46:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,被破坏的地方这种
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.82,1:46:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有人进进出出
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.17,1:46:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,正因如此
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.67,1:46:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不一样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.77,1:46:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还算
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.36,1:46:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是没事的那种
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.50,1:46:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.32,1:46:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道也是
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.95,1:46:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,真正吓人的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.33,1:46:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，怎么了——
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.99,1:47:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真正吓人的地方是
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.28,1:47:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有人的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.82,1:47:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这样
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.66,1:47:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但感觉除了住户以外，没什么人进出
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.84,1:47:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,反而更吓人
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.49,1:47:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大概很长时间都不让人靠近
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.19,1:47:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，这里
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.14,1:47:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,普通地
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.19,1:47:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.10,1:47:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喵～
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.14,1:47:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶她
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.44,1:47:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.13,1:47:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶她们也是，如果能正常来
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.57,1:47:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说来……出现的话，倒没那么吓人
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.90,1:47:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,突然冲过来，我
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.59,1:47:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,会吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.01,1:47:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果丝滑的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.59,1:47:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,出现的话
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.42,1:47:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.55,1:47:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,意外的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.96,1:48:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，头…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.88,1:48:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,黑色长发的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.78,1:48:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,女性之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.11,1:48:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.56,1:48:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,井变少了，果然都被填上了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.98,1:48:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这边能看出是照片，但这个到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.95,1:48:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.82,1:48:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,藏在背后的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.51,1:48:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,又被入侵了浴室
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.01,1:48:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,过啦——
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.81,1:48:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,过啦——！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.26,1:48:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好诶——
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.17,1:48:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实做成了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.05,1:48:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,做成了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.18,1:48:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,「恭喜」
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.78,1:48:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「您现在已完成所有被赋予的凶宅常规监视任务」
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.33,1:48:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,「确认一下还有没有未报告的异常现象吧」
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.95,1:48:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好诶
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.37,1:48:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.86,1:49:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「超快通关w」
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.50,1:49:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我做到了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.57,1:49:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「比2更顺畅了？」
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.73,1:49:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，可能是因为2把特别津贴也全做了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.33,1:49:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也要试试吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.19,1:49:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.56,1:49:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好像还有没看过的异变
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.20,1:49:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就保持特别津贴版本
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.07,1:49:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,继续吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.63,1:49:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这种情况下会变成什么规格呢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.01,1:49:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,确实，错误
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.08,1:49:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,三个
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.96,1:49:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不能有三个错
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.70,1:49:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,「这次应该挺难的w」啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.02,1:49:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此，错三次就出局
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.82,1:49:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,变成这样
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.28,1:49:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后，异常增加
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.37,1:49:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好，试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.74,1:49:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我去领特别津贴
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.67,1:49:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我已经压倒性地
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.78,1:50:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这次做的里面最后一个
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.95,1:50:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.88,1:50:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有点讨厌
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.49,1:50:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,…这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.23,1:50:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,果然因人而异吧，哪里最
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.80,1:50:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,让大家最
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.13,1:50:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.71,1:50:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,乍一看……
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.50,1:50:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,全
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.31,1:50:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在这之中
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.89,1:50:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,全
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.89,1:50:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,全部
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.49,1:50:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然觉得可怕
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.43,1:50:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果被告知「有一处可以不去哦」的话
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.12,1:50:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说可以去一个地方，而是可以选择不去的话，你们不去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.30,1:50:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不，可能是隧道吧。不，不知道。不，但是
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.53,1:50:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的家还是隧道
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.42,1:50:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.07,1:50:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不对，这里没什么奇怪的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.51,1:50:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还没，还不是异变吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.61,1:50:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,从30秒开始
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.43,1:50:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,30，嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.88,1:50:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,从0030开始吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.42,1:51:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,「隧道很讨厌啊」隧道的话……
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.67,1:51:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，讨厌啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.00,1:51:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道我也不想去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.38,1:51:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,其实全都不想去呢
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.54,1:51:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，不好说啊，不过
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.10,1:51:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不，还是隧道吧，确实
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.67,1:51:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.14,1:51:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.50,1:51:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.44,1:51:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，地点是……
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.36,1:51:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不想qu
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.53,1:51:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常危险」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.99,1:51:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「请立即避难」
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.89,1:51:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,呃，那个
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.58,1:51:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,呃那个，不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.06,1:51:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，可能超难
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.22,1:51:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关都被疯狂入侵了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.71,1:52:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.70,1:52:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.69,1:52:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,大家注意到了吗？我完全没发现
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.80,1:52:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可能连统统都没搞明白
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.61,1:52:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,明明以为看得很仔细的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.75,1:52:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有声音
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.58,1:52:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有声音的话
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.23,1:52:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就意味着有异常吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.26,1:52:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,找
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.76,1:52:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.00,1:52:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好像还有20个左右的新的异常
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.56,1:52:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「果然难度提高了呢」嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.10,1:52:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也有点奇怪吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.20,1:52:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.28,1:52:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊，看起来隐隐约约像人的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.23,1:53:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.45,1:53:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.63,1:53:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,变得像《驱魔人》里的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.24,1:53:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.11,1:53:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.33,1:53:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是原本就有的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.91,1:53:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉又听到了奇怪的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.61,1:53:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.74,1:53:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,既然有声音，我想应该是有什么东西来了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.91,1:53:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好像找不到
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.65,1:53:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.47,1:53:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.96,1:53:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,男汤，汤
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.49,1:53:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对没有
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.95,1:53:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对没有
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.23,1:54:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,佛间也不太有呢
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.91,1:54:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,乒乓球桌没有违和感吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.65,1:54:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,窗户玻璃也没事，电视也没事
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.18,1:54:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,像佛龛的东西也没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.47,1:54:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关也是……吊灯！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.82,1:54:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.00,1:54:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么违和感吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.88,1:54:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.85,1:54:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就这些吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.40,1:54:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.91,1:54:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.07,1:55:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了——
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.93,1:55:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.30,1:55:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这个原本就有吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.60,1:55:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.29,1:55:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.68,1:55:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到很多异常
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.34,1:55:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.84,1:55:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.77,1:55:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.96,1:55:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.12,1:55:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.88,1:55:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喵——呢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.79,1:55:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,春天，梦
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.69,1:55:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，料理
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.13,1:55:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,料理料理
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.03,1:55:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个容易看出来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.21,1:55:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.66,1:55:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.33,1:56:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.37,1:56:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.76,1:56:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.21,1:56:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,脚
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.12,1:56:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.76,1:56:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,容易找到的地方倒是容易
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.47,1:56:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,细节的地方就不好找了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.98,1:56:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.59,1:56:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.66,1:56:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.78,1:56:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没有检测到
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.46,1:56:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.87,1:56:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.49,1:56:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.92,1:57:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不，明明有吊灯，却在同一个地方
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.34,1:57:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉位置变了？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.32,1:57:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,多个……
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.33,1:57:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.93,1:57:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.04,1:57:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.03,1:57:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.34,1:57:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.83,1:57:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在——
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.31,1:57:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪位
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.17,1:57:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,诶在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.18,1:57:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.18,1:57:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.18,1:57:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，玄关的物体……
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.36,1:57:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,消失
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.83,1:57:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大榻榻米间的入侵者？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.79,1:57:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,幽灵
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.67,1:57:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在客房1、2物体追加？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.68,1:57:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.17,1:57:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下，可以等我一下下吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.41,1:57:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拿点饮料
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.59,1:57:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍等
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.64,2:00:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我回力
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.79,2:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻，让您久等了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.71,2:00:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好，等一下，特别津贴
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.11,2:00:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是变难了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.29,2:00:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下，喝口水
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.61,2:00:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.20,2:00:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,春天，梦
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.25,2:00:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,花瓶
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.68,2:00:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯，吊灯
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.62,2:00:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,被褥
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.17,2:00:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拉门、报纸
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.82,2:00:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,电灯电灯
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.49,2:00:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,毛皮
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.82,2:00:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这个搞不太清是什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.51,2:01:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,柱子……这是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.99,2:01:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,原本就有的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.62,2:01:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还没开始呢吧
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.32,2:01:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,开着的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.57,2:01:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,电视和什…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.68,2:01:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,窗帘开着
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.03,2:01:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,脚
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.90,2:01:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,灯
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.34,2:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得玄关也老是被入侵呢我
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.42,2:01:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,乍一看
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.41,2:01:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.32,2:01:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，关了，太明显了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.33,2:01:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,话说，是因为看到了关掉的瞬间吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.55,2:01:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这里也相当……
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.36,2:01:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么来着，物体的替换？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.80,2:01:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是在客房1、2吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.86,2:01:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,客房、佛间
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.61,2:02:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.02,2:02:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.31,2:02:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，这把椅子是倒的吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.84,2:02:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.41,2:02:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.92,2:02:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.98,2:02:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没有倒下啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.69,2:02:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有「哐」的一声……
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.33,2:02:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.15,2:02:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪来
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.67,2:02:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.57,2:02:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在呢
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.65,2:02:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对来了吧。有没有有响声却不来的情况呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.96,2:02:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.87,2:02:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像趴着的人影，勉强能看出来
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.86,2:02:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,……虽然没什么违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.39,2:03:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，这种地方怎么会有椅子……
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.96,2:03:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.79,2:03:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,异常检测…奈落之底
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.67,2:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,像陷阱一样
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.51,2:03:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去很讨厌的浴室
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.56,2:03:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,写着异常很多对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.59,2:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,变宽了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.79,2:03:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这个一目了然
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.91,2:03:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，您真悠闲
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.17,2:03:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事呢，是P到上面的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.16,2:03:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,图像和
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.11,2:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,梦
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.92,2:04:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有驱魔人
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.63,2:04:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.40,2:04:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.49,2:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关倒是很容易错过
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.66,2:04:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好像
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.64,2:04:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么违和感…眼珠
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.41,2:04:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.99,2:04:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,直到目前都很不错的找到了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.42,2:04:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,出现类似异常多发的情况
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.74,2:04:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大概三个左右
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.20,2:04:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.39,2:04:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.54,2:04:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.38,2:04:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.13,2:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,失手了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.33,2:04:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有什么气息
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.52,2:04:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这扇门是不是有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.53,2:04:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，失手两次了，再来一次就
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.84,2:05:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.57,2:05:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微明显一点，拜托了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.30,2:05:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再错了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.32,2:05:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？绝对
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.02,2:05:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,相信是
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.00,2:05:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这不对劲
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.12,2:05:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,脸
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.05,2:05:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.90,2:05:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好好，报告完毕
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.57,2:05:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,天花板也没什么奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.27,2:05:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,桶也有
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.07,2:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,拉门
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.13,2:05:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,开着所以没事
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.09,2:05:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,电视也正常
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.96,2:05:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,冰箱关着了！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.87,2:05:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.26,2:05:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没看到人
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.73,2:05:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,梦与春
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.36,2:05:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.85,2:05:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，总觉得……
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.88,2:06:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里好像没有吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.45,2:06:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.22,2:06:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这又失手了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.33,2:06:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,明明看了不少
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.80,2:06:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,果然全都看起来有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.13,2:06:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,外观看起来也没什么问题
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.90,2:06:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,变成现实了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.48,2:06:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让我做个梦吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.08,2:06:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯的位置也没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.00,2:06:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,治安不好
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.67,2:06:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.60,2:07:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,也没人偷看，也没变成水晶吊灯
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.97,2:07:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.57,2:07:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是这个时候已经漏掉了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.19,2:07:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.58,2:07:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.66,2:07:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,变成雪的季节了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.44,2:07:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？虽然没什么违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.51,2:07:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好像已经漏掉了什么
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.98,2:07:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,既然出现了那个警告，说明漏掉了两个
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.77,2:07:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.68,2:07:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,来了个简单的
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.15,2:07:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.09,2:08:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那个那样很黑的东西也是
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.33,2:08:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,点了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.97,2:08:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉颜色比平时稍微有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.84,2:08:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.12,2:08:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,可以错两个的嘛
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.12,2:08:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.19,2:08:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,像是「是这样吗」的感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.00,2:08:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不到
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.09,2:08:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就报告了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.33,2:08:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但是
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.98,2:08:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,像是「是这样吗」的感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.98,2:08:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好像没有
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.55,2:08:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.05,2:08:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这里之类的又怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.86,2:08:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.46,2:08:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,异常增加了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.27,2:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.05,2:08:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，找到了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.72,2:09:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好，希望能赶上
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.92,2:09:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多快到3点
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.49,2:09:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,的时间了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.85,2:09:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,人腿
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.62,2:09:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好，感觉不错感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.79,2:09:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这种程度的变化我还是能看出来的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.85,2:09:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异常
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.63,2:09:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个……
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.74,2:09:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不对……
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.51,2:09:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.19,2:09:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉脸一直在变
Dialogue: 0,2:09:31.75,2:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,啪嚓地一下，啪嚓地
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.18,2:09:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，搞错了两个
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.69,2:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很明显，我都看得出来
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.98,2:09:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,皮，皮毛应该是摊开的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.26,2:09:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会觉得违和，也可能不会
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.97,2:09:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有时能感觉到，有时感觉不到
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.41,2:10:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不，大概哪里看漏了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:10:16.23,2:10:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,整体这样，远远地看……
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.75,2:10:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这样整体捕捉变化比较好
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.40,2:10:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,集中一处的话
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.47,2:10:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,察觉不到违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.40,2:10:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.05,2:10:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在增加？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.97,2:10:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不，不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.30,2:10:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,窗帘闭上了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.17,2:10:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,异常检出OK
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.82,2:10:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.48,2:10:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.21,2:10:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么奇怪的
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.95,2:11:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.13,2:11:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.06,2:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.89,2:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.41,2:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.75,2:11:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这个非常容易理解，帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.01,2:11:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果全都是这样的话
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.04,2:11:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是很容易懂
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.99,2:11:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说还有其他的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.83,2:11:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.60,2:11:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有这样的
Dialogue: 0,2:11:24.79,2:11:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有像窗帘一样的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.74,2:11:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，可能失误了两次
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.71,2:11:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.42,2:11:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.17,2:11:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道完全
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.45,2:11:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.61,2:11:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来个容易懂的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.16,2:11:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.64,2:11:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～看到了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.62,2:11:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能看到
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.43,2:11:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.25,2:11:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,咦嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.13,2:11:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,咦嘻嘻嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.42,2:11:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.69,2:12:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,春天，梦
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.82,2:12:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,梦，春天
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.47,2:12:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.94,2:12:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.21,2:12:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.83,2:12:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.04,2:12:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这里什么都…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:18.96,2:12:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么——？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.47,2:12:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真吵闹啊
Dialogue: 0,2:12:28.82,2:12:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉一直
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.62,2:12:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没注意到啊
Dialogue: 0,2:12:39.28,2:12:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.29,2:12:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,2:12:45.66,2:12:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，上面，上面上面
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.13,2:12:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,上面
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.26,2:12:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,上面有个洞
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.62,2:12:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,呼～
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.10,2:12:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好像听到歌声
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.47,2:13:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在在在在……拉门拉门
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.27,2:13:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,像驱魔人一样的家伙发现
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.31,2:13:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好，有紧张感了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:11.14,2:13:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关有没有入侵者或鬼怪？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.17,2:13:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好像没有
Dialogue: 0,2:13:17.80,2:13:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得大概还是漏掉了，大概
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.24,2:13:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,2:13:27.91,2:13:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,又变得吵闹了
Dialogue: 0,2:13:30.38,2:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,您是这么说的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.54,2:13:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,电灯，电灯
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.02,2:13:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…动不了，这个是异变
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.12,2:13:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像是在勉强维持生命
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.15,2:13:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,明明还差一点
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.00,2:13:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,又说
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.74,2:14:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,异常很多
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.15,2:14:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,2:14:12.90,2:14:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊没有没有
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.62,2:14:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的地方什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.41,2:14:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕糟糕
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.21,2:14:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕糟糕
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.50,2:14:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——！
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.73,2:14:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，完全搞不懂……什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:32.76,2:14:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,又有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.09,2:14:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,客房1内……
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.56,2:14:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，大家注意到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.33,2:14:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,娱乐室有物体追加，客房2有物体……
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.59,2:14:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关的灯异常？！
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.66,2:14:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关有灯吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.79,2:14:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,「一辈子都察觉不到的脸君Don't mind」
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.56,2:14:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.48,2:14:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次，再来一次
Dialogue: 0,2:14:59.74,2:15:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看录像之类的能看出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.76,2:15:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为我找到挺多的呢
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.37,2:15:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全没注意到物体的替换啊
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.35,2:15:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关的灯是什么？这个？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.20,2:15:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.91,2:15:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好像开着
Dialogue: 0,2:15:31.55,2:15:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是看不到啊
Dialogue: 0,2:15:35.03,2:15:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，眼珠！
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.47,2:15:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠有了
Dialogue: 0,2:15:40.82,2:15:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这种容易发现的
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.24,2:15:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我就能注意到呢
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.42,2:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的，如果融入的很自然的话，还真是察觉不到
Dialogue: 0,2:15:52.22,2:15:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不自然的吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.71,2:16:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,无异常
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.10,2:16:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有异常
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.34,2:16:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.33,2:16:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠类的很多呢
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.92,2:16:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,今天
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.37,2:16:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,无
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.55,2:16:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关可能真的从来没有试着注意过
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.21,2:16:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.44,2:16:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,娱乐室
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.62,2:16:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,娱乐室刚才那个，那个什么来着，物体的替换？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.57,2:16:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有什么呢，没注意到的
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.81,2:16:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，变成现实了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:43.06,2:16:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,让我做个梦吧
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.18,2:16:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有什么啪哩的一声
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.13,2:16:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啪哩地响了，啪哩地
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.51,2:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.99,2:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不喵
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.33,2:17:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.67,2:17:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不过有啪哩一声
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.57,2:17:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种椅子吗
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.31,2:17:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,找到，好
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.92,2:17:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK，动不了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.41,2:17:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不对，按钮按下去了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:33.64,2:17:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……被封锁了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:47.95,2:17:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有问题
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.79,2:17:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.44,2:17:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.11,2:17:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个时间段应该不会活跃的发生异变吧
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.87,2:18:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，饭
Dialogue: 0,2:18:07.63,2:18:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呢
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.54,2:18:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,算是比较容易发现的异变呢
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.23,2:18:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大概都找到三次了
Dialogue: 0,2:18:18.81,2:18:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.60,2:18:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.30,2:18:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶嘿嘿嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.44,2:18:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,诶嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.35,2:18:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诶嘿嘿嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.56,2:18:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对了，之前听说过，但那个笑的东西很不妙
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.83,2:18:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,灵异照片之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.84,2:18:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,比起痛苦的样子、可怕的表情
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.70,2:18:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好像笑着的脸反而不太好
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.27,2:18:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看到那种的话
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.34,2:18:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.43,2:18:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.67,2:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看到脸了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.74,2:19:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.32,2:19:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,像是没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.93,2:19:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,的感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.71,2:19:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,难道异变已经开始了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.35,2:19:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个！这样的……腿！
Dialogue: 0,2:19:40.37,2:19:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,找到！
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.06,2:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,像佛龛间那样的地方，没什么异变呢
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.50,2:19:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得有点奇怪吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:19:57.19,2:19:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.04,2:20:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有像绳子一样的东西垂下来吗…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.17,2:20:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.44,2:20:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不是异变啊
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.98,2:20:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:20:18.76,2:20:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也许已经开始完型崩坏了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.33,2:20:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有人入侵了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.78,2:20:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,咔当的一声
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.67,2:20:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.39,2:20:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,到哪了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.50,2:20:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.52,2:20:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定来了，肯定
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.43,2:20:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪在哪在哪在哪
Dialogue: 0,2:20:41.20,2:20:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对找到你
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.98,2:20:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，汤！
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.98,2:20:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:20:53.38,2:20:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.64,2:20:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这像海带一样的东西是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.73,2:20:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吧
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.21,2:21:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，有吗？不是吧
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.83,2:21:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.26,2:21:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,箭头
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.63,2:21:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,2:21:09.80,2:21:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,希望只有容易找的来，只有容易找的
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.42,2:21:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,枕头的位置
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.94,2:21:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不是
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.74,2:21:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，桌子变多了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:25.69,2:21:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是2个的
Dialogue: 0,2:21:32.56,2:21:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,天花板是不是开了洞，不
Dialogue: 0,2:21:34.39,2:21:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这个应该没有吧，椅子
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.52,2:21:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，刚才也犯了同样的错误
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.82,2:21:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,偷看的脸没有
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.90,2:21:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系，也没有脚
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.61,2:21:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有头
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.55,2:21:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.27,2:21:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.60,2:21:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.24,2:22:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这样挺好的，我觉得这种非常好
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.98,2:22:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:22:06.64,2:22:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.16,2:22:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.21,2:22:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感无
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.68,2:22:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没——有
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.64,2:22:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,无
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.93,2:22:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没有
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.21,2:22:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大概…没有
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.57,2:22:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，又变多了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:29.93,2:22:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是这两个吧
Dialogue: 0,2:22:32.00,2:22:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,2:22:33.45,2:22:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.27,2:22:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,2:22:43.81,2:22:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,头…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.58,2:22:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.57,2:22:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有人在偷看
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.79,2:23:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,无
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.04,2:23:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得没有
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.67,2:23:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:23:11.65,2:23:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在看
Dialogue: 0,2:23:13.00,2:23:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙在看吧
Dialogue: 0,2:23:16.62,2:23:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.04,2:23:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吧
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.45,2:23:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,木有捏
Dialogue: 0,2:23:32.45,2:23:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,无
Dialogue: 0,2:23:36.30,2:23:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，刚才好像…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:37.78,2:23:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有横穿过的
Dialogue: 0,2:23:41.39,2:23:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么东西从我面前…
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.08,2:23:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好像横穿过去了
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.90,2:23:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.26,2:24:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一个一个仔细的看吧
Dialogue: 0,2:24:09.30,2:24:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,2:24:10.35,2:24:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉没有了
Dialogue: 0,2:24:14.15,2:24:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,天花板也不太有
Dialogue: 0,2:24:17.56,2:24:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室已经
Dialogue: 0,2:24:19.01,2:24:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:24:21.60,2:24:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,电视！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.69,2:24:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:24:31.98,2:24:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,2:24:34.64,2:24:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,变成暗屋了！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.90,2:24:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,旅馆
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.80,2:24:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不是杉屋，变成暗屋了
Dialogue: 0,2:24:52.37,2:24:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.19,2:24:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,2:24:58.06,2:24:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没——有
Dialogue: 0,2:25:00.80,2:25:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没——有
Dialogue: 0,2:25:03.60,2:25:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没——有
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.19,2:25:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.73,2:25:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很可能
Dialogue: 0,2:25:10.18,2:25:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没——有
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.19,2:25:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,诶  呀？
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.75,2:25:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.09,2:25:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在，通知大家
Dialogue: 0,2:25:23.74,2:25:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,大约上午3点左右
Dialogue: 0,2:25:26.86,2:25:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很顺利吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.44,2:25:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,目前也没有发现很多之类的报告
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.31,2:25:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没——有
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.30,2:25:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.75,2:25:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关经常
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.41,2:25:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然容易忽略
Dialogue: 0,2:26:04.39,2:26:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不，总觉得，太少了反而有点不安
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.82,2:26:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是漏掉了什么，已经
Dialogue: 0,2:26:11.58,2:26:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,头发一样的，之前有这东西吗
Dialogue: 0,2:26:15.21,2:26:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没有检出异常
Dialogue: 0,2:26:21.50,2:26:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「滚回去」为什么说那么过分的话
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.71,2:26:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:26:29.66,2:26:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,电灯也噼里啪啦的
Dialogue: 0,2:26:31.56,2:26:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是灯的异常吗
Dialogue: 0,2:26:35.19,2:26:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一直停留在原地的话
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.54,2:26:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地容易看出来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.53,2:26:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:26:40.15,2:26:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才可能切得太快了
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.21,2:26:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可以看得更慢一点
Dialogue: 0,2:26:47.85,2:26:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,像这个节奏
Dialogue: 0,2:26:51.26,2:26:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,2:26:56.05,2:26:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.97,2:27:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是不是也有像眼珠的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:27:01.80,2:27:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.20,2:27:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,2:27:06.60,2:27:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啪嚓一声
Dialogue: 0,2:27:08.87,2:27:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,2:27:10.97,2:27:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谁打碎的
Dialogue: 0,2:27:14.19,2:27:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,2:27:17.07,2:27:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁打碎的
Dialogue: 0,2:27:20.34,2:27:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,玻璃
Dialogue: 0,2:27:23.82,2:27:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,玻璃
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.43,2:27:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，瓶子好像变多了好多
Dialogue: 0,2:27:30.17,2:27:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第一次看到的异常呢
Dialogue: 0,2:27:40.18,2:27:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点违和，也许可能是我的错觉
Dialogue: 0,2:27:48.09,2:27:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好像能听到点声音哦
Dialogue: 0,2:27:51.41,2:27:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:27:53.89,2:27:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在哭吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:27:57.02,2:27:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.67,2:27:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在看吗
Dialogue: 0,2:28:00.02,2:28:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有了
Dialogue: 0,2:28:01.77,2:28:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在壁橱里哭的是
Dialogue: 0,2:28:04.84,2:28:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对伽椰子小姐的印象很深啊，在壁橱里
Dialogue: 0,2:28:08.46,2:28:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还有就是《零》的緒方先生吧
Dialogue: 0,2:28:15.68,2:28:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,冰室宅邸
Dialogue: 0,2:28:17.18,2:28:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是以前的，像宅邸一样的豪宅
Dialogue: 0,2:28:23.08,2:28:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,很可怕吧
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.49,2:28:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,旅馆之类的也是
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.74,2:28:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在地下室之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.40,2:28:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,2:28:37.08,2:28:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得很可怕
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.07,2:28:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然被问怕什么很难回答
Dialogue: 0,2:28:46.42,2:28:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,壁橱之类的，明明只是
Dialogue: 0,2:28:49.16,2:28:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,收纳东西的
Dialogue: 0,2:28:51.89,2:28:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,地方
Dialogue: 0,2:28:54.34,2:28:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:28:55.40,2:28:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,却觉得可怕，衣柜倒没那么可怕
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.73,2:29:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但一说到壁橱就有点可怕
Dialogue: 0,2:29:06.00,2:29:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,2:29:09.96,2:29:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哇好气派
Dialogue: 0,2:29:16.26,2:29:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,「懂你，壁橱可怕」
Dialogue: 0,2:29:17.80,2:29:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,「哆啦A梦吗」
Dialogue: 0,2:29:19.12,2:29:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦喜欢
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.56,2:29:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哆啦酱最喜欢
Dialogue: 0,2:29:22.58,2:29:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不过在小时候会想
Dialogue: 0,2:29:24.58,2:29:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,在壁橱里睡觉不害怕吗
Dialogue: 0,2:29:29.20,2:29:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,捉迷藏也是，小时候在奶奶家玩的时候
Dialogue: 0,2:29:33.28,2:29:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,果然很害怕啊
Dialogue: 0,2:29:34.39,2:29:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪里的，哪里的浴室啊
Dialogue: 0,2:29:38.06,2:29:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，不过这个浴室好像见过
Dialogue: 0,2:29:45.21,2:29:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，那个也是
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.48,2:29:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,2:29:49.80,2:29:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,上次
Dialogue: 0,2:29:51.08,2:29:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,的那个吧…
Dialogue: 0,2:29:51.91,2:29:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.36,2:29:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好像见过，是上次那个地方
Dialogue: 0,2:29:58.23,2:29:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大概
Dialogue: 0,2:30:06.27,2:30:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,出现在1里的
Dialogue: 0,2:30:10.85,2:30:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那个吗
Dialogue: 0,2:30:22.46,2:30:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感…啊
Dialogue: 0,2:30:24.69,2:30:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还差一点
Dialogue: 0,2:30:26.37,2:30:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像有东西
Dialogue: 0,2:30:28.22,2:30:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在又有黑影
Dialogue: 0,2:30:30.44,2:30:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,朝这边
Dialogue: 0,2:30:32.96,2:30:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,大家可能没看到
Dialogue: 0,2:30:35.55,2:30:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对有什么在画面边缘
Dialogue: 0,2:30:37.85,2:30:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,过来了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:39.65,2:30:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:30:40.10,2:30:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.11,2:30:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:43.64,2:30:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在等一小下业务就
Dialogue: 0,2:30:45.87,2:30:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,特别津贴
Dialogue: 0,2:30:48.22,2:30:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,能拿到了
Dialogue: 0,2:30:56.73,2:30:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有漏看的地方？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:00.39,2:31:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:31:01.81,2:31:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,报告了27个异常
Dialogue: 0,2:31:04.57,2:31:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太多了——
Dialogue: 0,2:31:07.56,2:31:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,错过了2个异常
Dialogue: 0,2:31:10.04,2:31:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,客房1有物体追加
Dialogue: 0,2:31:12.65,2:31:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,大榻榻米间有物体追加
Dialogue: 0,2:31:15.03,2:31:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么，有人知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:20.90,2:31:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,两个
Dialogue: 0,2:31:22.38,2:31:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对
Dialogue: 0,2:31:25.04,2:31:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,2:31:26.84,2:31:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,2:31:28.25,2:31:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,坐落于
Dialogue: 0,2:31:29.43,2:31:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,埼玉县
Dialogue: 0,2:31:30.76,2:31:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,某有名的
Dialogue: 0,2:31:32.46,2:31:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,房间
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.96,2:31:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,2:31:37.04,2:31:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,基本都找到了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.19,2:31:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:31:43.13,2:31:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,开始业务
Dialogue: 0,2:31:48.39,2:31:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色的房子
Dialogue: 0,2:31:50.84,2:31:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,很难找呢
Dialogue: 0,2:32:03.24,2:32:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,外观
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.19,2:32:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:32:07.52,2:32:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,2:32:10.19,2:32:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,无异常
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.70,2:32:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,「乱糟糟的很难认」确实是这样
Dialogue: 0,2:32:16.31,2:32:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,东西都散落着，所以什么不见了或者什么
Dialogue: 0,2:32:20.60,2:32:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,变了之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:32:22.71,2:32:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,相当……
Dialogue: 0,2:32:23.68,2:32:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,很难看出来
Dialogue: 0,2:32:36.50,2:32:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.77,2:32:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:32:43.90,2:32:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,充电
Dialogue: 0,2:32:49.29,2:32:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,2:32:51.86,2:32:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,「比起{\alpha&H80&}幽灵{\alpha&H00&}房间，蟑螂更可怕
Dialogue: 0,2:32:54.82,2:32:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛，虫子之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:32:56.32,2:33:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对对，这种时候，经常会有奇怪的声音之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:33:01.32,2:33:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的虫子啊老鼠什么的
Dialogue: 0,2:33:05.90,2:33:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还挺……
Dialogue: 0,2:33:07.11,2:33:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是有的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:33:10.90,2:33:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,2:33:11.83,2:33:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,和灵异的东西的区别
Dialogue: 0,2:33:13.70,2:33:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:16.39,2:33:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,异变进一步
Dialogue: 0,2:33:18.17,2:33:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,异变了的意思？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:22.09,2:33:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？哪里变了……
Dialogue: 0,2:33:28.02,2:33:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好脏
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.62,2:33:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:33:34.02,2:33:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「※是普通模式※」
Dialogue: 0,2:33:35.17,2:33:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等等等，搞错了搞错了
Dialogue: 0,2:33:42.05,2:33:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,以特别津贴版本来玩
Dialogue: 0,2:33:45.58,2:33:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没加上津贴
Dialogue: 0,2:33:50.04,2:33:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我完全没注意到违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:33:58.40,2:34:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不，很难看出来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:34:01.34,2:34:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,最高的
Dialogue: 0,2:34:02.35,2:34:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,难度是不是太高了
Dialogue: 0,2:34:05.54,2:34:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我也不太确定
Dialogue: 0,2:34:13.58,2:34:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,2:34:14.33,2:34:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,2:34:15.16,2:34:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,2:34:15.99,2:34:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,2:34:16.71,2:34:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,花了大概4秒……
Dialogue: 0,2:34:18.11,2:34:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，又搞脏了
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.21,2:34:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:34:37.82,2:34:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.43,2:34:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.77,2:34:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露——
Dialogue: 0,2:34:49.33,2:34:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我今天直播的开场一样
Dialogue: 0,2:34:53.13,2:34:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,悄无声息地
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.30,2:34:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有人进来了
Dialogue: 0,2:35:07.11,2:35:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这种的……
Dialogue: 0,2:35:14.84,2:35:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,会一直留下来吗
Dialogue: 0,2:35:18.71,2:35:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是能听到上楼梯的声音？
Dialogue: 0,2:35:22.67,2:35:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯是有什么来着
Dialogue: 0,2:35:25.45,2:35:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,2:35:28.34,2:35:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,2:35:31.72,2:35:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,正好看到了打碎的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,2:35:33.99,2:35:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有楼梯呢
Dialogue: 0,2:35:37.05,2:35:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯之家就是这栋房子吗
Dialogue: 0,2:35:49.97,2:35:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:35:51.50,2:35:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,2:35:52.20,2:35:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,2:36:00.34,2:36:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,破掉了
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.45,2:36:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是猫猫们吗
Dialogue: 0,2:36:05.38,2:36:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有猫猫们
Dialogue: 0,2:36:07.29,2:36:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:18.66,2:36:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这房子我记不住啊
Dialogue: 0,2:36:22.81,2:36:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,「我没疯我没疯我没疯」
Dialogue: 0,2:36:26.84,2:36:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也有贴纸对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:36:29.34,2:36:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么讯息？
Dialogue: 0,2:36:32.43,2:36:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，门上好像也贴着纸
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.85,2:36:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪个房间来着
Dialogue: 0,2:36:40.98,2:36:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,手
Dialogue: 0,2:36:43.19,2:36:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand
Dialogue: 0,2:36:47.67,2:36:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,2:36:49.68,2:36:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,有贴纸
Dialogue: 0,2:36:53.97,2:36:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啪嚓一下
Dialogue: 0,2:36:56.53,2:36:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:01.04,2:37:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不卖哦
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.38,2:37:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还有窗户玻璃碎掉的声音
Dialogue: 0,2:37:08.92,2:37:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…能听到声音
Dialogue: 0,2:37:12.68,2:37:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:15.65,2:37:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里？
Dialogue: 0,2:37:18.39,2:37:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,现在绝对有大约两个人
Dialogue: 0,2:37:21.46,2:37:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，看，被入侵了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:24.45,2:37:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,第一个人
Dialogue: 0,2:37:26.45,2:37:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:49.84,2:37:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但没什么违和感啊
Dialogue: 0,2:37:54.72,2:37:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,2:37:57.10,2:37:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,生锈了，生锈了
Dialogue: 0,2:37:58.42,2:38:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是血痕吧，硬要说的话
Dialogue: 0,2:38:04.13,2:38:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:07.56,2:38:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,2:38:11.92,2:38:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:38:18.70,2:38:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,门
Dialogue: 0,2:38:19.93,2:38:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,开着吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:21.64,2:38:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,2:38:23.15,2:38:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,搞错两个了
Dialogue: 0,2:38:24.42,2:38:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好好，来了个简单的
Dialogue: 0,2:38:33.85,2:38:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,又在尝试爬楼梯了
Dialogue: 0,2:38:45.26,2:38:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对有一个人入侵了
Dialogue: 0,2:38:48.54,2:38:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的是一个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:38:59.93,2:39:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，绝对
Dialogue: 0,2:39:02.49,2:39:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:39:10.13,2:39:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——没什么违和感啊……
Dialogue: 0,2:39:14.02,2:39:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真的进来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:39:20.07,2:39:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在吗～
Dialogue: 0,2:39:25.33,2:39:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对，大家不要在没人的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:39:28.70,2:39:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,对着空气搭话哦
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.77,2:39:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,2:39:40.42,2:39:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，异常检出
Dialogue: 0,2:39:42.54,2:39:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,2:39:43.89,2:39:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,其实那是电线杆吗
Dialogue: 0,2:39:52.42,2:39:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,2:39:57.31,2:39:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是异常吗
Dialogue: 0,2:40:05.85,2:40:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀，头发什么的，好像各种各样的
Dialogue: 0,2:40:13.72,2:40:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:40:18.67,2:40:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哦——楼梯不见了
Dialogue: 0,2:40:26.74,2:40:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,很好发现
Dialogue: 0,2:40:38.86,2:40:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:40:50.43,2:40:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，好
Dialogue: 0,2:40:53.30,2:40:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,取暖
Dialogue: 0,2:40:54.42,2:40:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一家人取暖的样子
Dialogue: 0,2:40:57.91,2:40:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真易懂
Dialogue: 0,2:41:07.81,2:41:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:41:12.53,2:41:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才
Dialogue: 0,2:41:15.07,2:41:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,2:41:16.17,2:41:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大家，刚才
Dialogue: 0,2:41:18.59,2:41:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,灰尘精灵
Dialogue: 0,2:41:23.62,2:41:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,明明出现了
Dialogue: 0,2:41:26.85,2:41:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:41:34.83,2:41:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这难道是某种面具吗…不
Dialogue: 0,2:41:37.74,2:41:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只是影子看起来那样吗
Dialogue: 0,2:41:43.96,2:41:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,「有的吧，雾气」对吧
Dialogue: 0,2:41:46.25,2:41:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,「只有铃原看到了」
Dialogue: 0,2:41:50.62,2:41:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,2:41:51.99,2:41:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,2:41:58.42,2:42:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？没赶上——
Dialogue: 0,2:42:02.63,2:42:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧，刚才没赶上吗
Dialogue: 0,2:42:15.82,2:42:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次再来一次
Dialogue: 0,2:42:22.69,2:42:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:42:24.55,2:42:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:42:26.25,2:42:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,2:42:37.73,2:42:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,脚印啊，必须在它靠近的瞬间察觉到才行吧
Dialogue: 0,2:42:51.16,2:42:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,又脏了
Dialogue: 0,2:42:53.28,2:42:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,连续三次弄脏了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:42:59.62,2:43:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说，真的只有我能看见
Dialogue: 0,2:43:02.90,2:43:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,黑色的雾气存在吗
Dialogue: 0,2:43:05.78,2:43:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不过有时会说呢，能看到黑色的雾气
Dialogue: 0,2:43:19.42,2:43:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,话说在哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:43:20.91,2:43:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有了，这个也容易找
Dialogue: 0,2:43:33.05,2:43:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:43:35.05,2:43:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有可口可乐样子的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,2:43:38.02,2:43:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在边缘
Dialogue: 0,2:43:41.21,2:43:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人偷看，也没有坟墓
Dialogue: 0,2:43:49.49,2:43:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,电话也……
Dialogue: 0,2:43:50.18,2:43:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好像又看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,2:43:53.67,2:43:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,2:43:56.04,2:43:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对那种事情会吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,2:43:59.44,2:44:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,「玄关的违和感是什么呢」
Dialogue: 0,2:44:01.47,2:44:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关的违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:44:06.10,2:44:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,又有什么
Dialogue: 0,2:44:11.09,2:44:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有人入侵了
Dialogue: 0,2:44:17.72,2:44:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有人入侵了
Dialogue: 0,2:44:22.30,2:44:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快去找出来
Dialogue: 0,2:44:27.70,2:44:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,应该有人来了才对
Dialogue: 0,2:44:53.97,2:44:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不……搞
Dialogue: 0,2:44:55.42,2:44:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不懂，总感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:44:57.39,2:44:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:45:00.85,2:45:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，果然摄像头有点…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:03.30,2:45:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,画角变了
Dialogue: 0,2:45:08.07,2:45:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:45:09.18,2:45:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,「我没疯」
Dialogue: 0,2:45:10.65,2:45:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「我没疯我没疯我没疯」
Dialogue: 0,2:45:19.11,2:45:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有错啊
Dialogue: 0,2:45:22.76,2:45:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可能感觉到了有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:45:28.03,2:45:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不对吗
Dialogue: 0,2:45:32.03,2:45:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，手…
Dialogue: 0,2:45:33.65,2:45:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,请您拿出
Dialogue: 0,2:45:40.03,2:45:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:45:40.93,2:45:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,啪嚓地响了一声哦
Dialogue: 0,2:45:44.52,2:45:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像能看到什么呢，这里
Dialogue: 0,2:45:47.06,2:45:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道这并不是异常
Dialogue: 0,2:45:52.41,2:45:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,2:45:52.98,2:45:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，是刚才输掉的家伙
Dialogue: 0,2:45:54.69,2:45:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不会输了
Dialogue: 0,2:45:57.73,2:45:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,2:46:00.47,2:46:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这次赶上了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:46:03.87,2:46:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:46:12.51,2:46:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不会输哦
Dialogue: 0,2:46:23.11,2:46:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:46:25.72,2:46:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,「我没疯」
Dialogue: 0,2:46:28.72,2:46:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,确实地
Dialogue: 0,2:46:30.01,2:46:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,收到了
Dialogue: 0,2:46:36.92,2:46:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这个房间搞不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,2:46:44.82,2:46:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没人偷看，也没有坟墓，这根柱子也正常
Dialogue: 0,2:46:54.77,2:46:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有违和感呢
Dialogue: 0,2:47:03.93,2:47:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,2:47:06.84,2:47:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不，绝
Dialogue: 0,2:47:08.03,2:47:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对漏过
Dialogue: 0,2:47:08.80,2:47:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:47:13.69,2:47:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,人偶？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:14.84,2:47:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,日本人偶很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,2:47:21.16,2:47:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜贝儿……
Dialogue: 0,2:47:22.09,2:47:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯在——
Dialogue: 0,2:47:26.15,2:47:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,通过门铃之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:47:28.66,2:47:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得比较好
Dialogue: 0,2:47:31.60,2:47:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不过门铃也很讨厌吧
Dialogue: 0,2:47:33.81,2:47:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,门铃的声音也很可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,2:47:40.72,2:47:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才哐当响了一声呢
Dialogue: 0,2:47:44.34,2:47:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:48.74,2:47:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:47:55.21,2:47:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:48:01.98,2:48:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不在哦，不在哦
Dialogue: 0,2:48:11.44,2:48:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:48:14.61,2:48:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:48:15.79,2:48:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么变化了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:48:19.71,2:48:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等我三分钟
Dialogue: 0,2:48:26.31,2:48:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不懂——
Dialogue: 0,2:48:29.41,2:48:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉没什么奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:48:32.52,2:48:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,异常很多……啊，不过感觉有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,2:48:35.04,2:48:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不是枕头吗
Dialogue: 0,2:48:37.74,2:48:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:48:41.00,2:48:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色防水布不一样了
Dialogue: 0,2:48:42.57,2:48:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这个简单
Dialogue: 0,2:49:00.77,2:49:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:49:01.35,2:49:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:49:05.36,2:49:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来全都一样
Dialogue: 0,2:49:18.69,2:49:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,2:49:24.95,2:49:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异常啊
Dialogue: 0,2:49:37.96,2:49:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,2:49:40.23,2:49:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「窗帘是黄色的？」黄色黄色
Dialogue: 0,2:49:44.38,2:49:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,黄色窗帘的……
Dialogue: 0,2:49:45.91,2:49:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,话题我记得
Dialogue: 0,2:49:48.78,2:49:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「和室里物体消失」有什么不见了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:49:52.49,2:49:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「走廊有物体被替换」
Dialogue: 0,2:49:55.34,2:49:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,「寝室里有入侵者」…
Dialogue: 0,2:49:58.02,2:50:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「玄关有物体被替换」…诶，玄关？
Dialogue: 0,2:50:01.77,2:50:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看过了对吧，玄关
Dialogue: 0,2:50:04.41,2:50:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西被替换了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:50:08.35,2:50:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——假的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:50:15.52,2:50:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:50:20.18,2:50:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不在客厅吗
Dialogue: 0,2:50:24.20,2:50:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,走廊
Dialogue: 0,2:50:30.69,2:50:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,寝室里有入侵？
Dialogue: 0,2:50:38.01,2:50:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,和室
Dialogue: 0,2:50:41.85,2:50:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,物体的替换……
Dialogue: 0,2:50:44.79,2:50:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我明明觉得看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,2:51:01.49,2:51:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哇啊……
Dialogue: 0,2:51:03.93,2:51:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,脏了
Dialogue: 0,2:51:05.83,2:51:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第一次呢
Dialogue: 0,2:51:15.14,2:51:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,人字梯之类的
Dialogue: 0,2:51:18.28,2:51:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:51:26.31,2:51:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:51:33.44,2:51:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢的扎实的看……吗
Dialogue: 0,2:51:42.90,2:51:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,2:51:45.87,2:51:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别吓我
Dialogue: 0,2:51:47.95,2:51:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才看得超认真的
Dialogue: 0,2:51:56.36,2:52:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,能注意到画角变了，我觉得还挺厉害的
Dialogue: 0,2:52:05.86,2:52:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:52:12.18,2:52:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,2:52:15.69,2:52:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,2:52:18.46,2:52:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然看起来像是在偷看，但也不是
Dialogue: 0,2:52:21.94,2:52:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,变了
Dialogue: 0,2:52:22.60,2:52:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,……的感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,2:52:27.03,2:52:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,DOG
Dialogue: 0,2:52:30.45,2:52:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:52:30.98,2:52:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,桌上的东西被干净的收拾掉了
Dialogue: 0,2:52:34.30,2:52:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,因为之前乱糟糟的，所以看得出来
Dialogue: 0,2:52:47.49,2:52:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,「我没疯」
Dialogue: 0,2:52:51.69,2:52:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没有疯
Dialogue: 0,2:53:04.64,2:53:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:53:07.18,2:53:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:53:11.20,2:53:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,洗手间也很脏
Dialogue: 0,2:53:13.32,2:53:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,2:53:16.09,2:53:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:53:20.23,2:53:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,2:53:23.92,2:53:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哇——搞的乱七八糟
Dialogue: 0,2:53:29.12,2:53:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像听到了什么声音
Dialogue: 0,2:53:35.27,2:53:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是游戏里的声音？
Dialogue: 0,2:53:38.81,2:53:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还是现实中听到的声音？
Dialogue: 0,2:53:41.07,2:53:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,2:53:47.12,2:53:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，话说大家刚才都听到了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:53:54.20,2:53:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,「现实的也太不妙了」
Dialogue: 0,2:53:55.73,2:53:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,现实中我确实听到过奇怪的声音
Dialogue: 0,2:54:00.63,2:54:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,2:54:01.60,2:54:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,在直播的时候
Dialogue: 0,2:54:04.30,2:54:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在引退之前
Dialogue: 0,2:54:06.84,2:54:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好几次有奇怪的声音混进来
Dialogue: 0,2:54:10.02,2:54:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,确实有过呢
Dialogue: 0,2:54:12.46,2:54:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还以为是游戏的声音
Dialogue: 0,2:54:13.56,2:54:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,2:54:18.09,2:54:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那种情况超多的
Dialogue: 0,2:54:20.94,2:54:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,线缆有这么长吗
Dialogue: 0,2:54:34.55,2:54:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,2:54:39.13,2:54:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「是喵喵的声音哦」
Dialogue: 0,2:54:41.30,2:54:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:54:42.23,2:54:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,自从把喵喵们接回家之后
Dialogue: 0,2:54:47.16,2:54:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那种事情
Dialogue: 0,2:54:48.78,2:54:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎
Dialogue: 0,2:54:49.64,2:54:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊好脏
Dialogue: 0,2:54:51.32,2:54:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了
Dialogue: 0,2:54:53.22,2:54:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在接喵喵们之前，还挺多的
Dialogue: 0,2:55:02.31,2:55:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,2:55:05.38,2:55:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,2:55:12.82,2:55:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉会有点违和感，是不是中了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:55:17.75,2:55:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还是完全没猜中呢
Dialogue: 0,2:55:24.27,2:55:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,「喵喵们把它们赶走了」
Dialogue: 0,2:55:26.30,2:55:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不过说真的
Dialogue: 0,2:55:28.09,2:55:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，冰箱的颜色…
Dialogue: 0,2:55:29.96,2:55:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不是白色的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:55:33.05,2:55:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,2:55:35.31,2:55:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,2:55:36.52,2:55:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然后现在呢
Dialogue: 0,2:55:38.08,2:55:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,像爬楼梯的声音
Dialogue: 0,2:55:41.68,2:55:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,到是听到了
Dialogue: 0,2:55:52.71,2:55:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有，怎么感觉有点发毛呢
Dialogue: 0,2:55:56.95,2:55:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什、什么违和感呢
Dialogue: 0,2:55:58.98,2:55:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,2:56:00.93,2:56:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,2:56:01.68,2:56:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个被割过了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:56:05.54,2:56:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我也变得能察觉到违和感了
Dialogue: 0,2:56:40.19,2:56:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么变了
Dialogue: 0,2:56:42.20,2:56:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这，这应该是个面具一样的东西呢 
Dialogue: 0,2:56:47.68,2:56:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:56:49.96,2:56:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,找
Dialogue: 0,2:56:50.60,2:56:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,2:56:56.74,2:56:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,2:56:57.26,2:56:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有手
Dialogue: 0,2:56:59.92,2:57:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,手放在电源按钮上
Dialogue: 0,2:57:10.09,2:57:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感啊，其他的
Dialogue: 0,2:57:16.45,2:57:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地还挺顺利的找到了？
Dialogue: 0,2:57:24.95,2:57:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,2:57:26.32,2:57:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,手臂
Dialogue: 0,2:57:31.76,2:57:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来挺顺利的嘛？
Dialogue: 0,2:57:39.63,2:57:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,2:57:44.44,2:57:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啪嗒啪嗒的
Dialogue: 0,2:57:46.91,2:57:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,2:57:57.10,2:57:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没变
Dialogue: 0,2:58:03.06,2:58:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没变
Dialogue: 0,2:58:08.53,2:58:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大概没变
Dialogue: 0,2:58:14.91,2:58:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,2:58:15.84,2:58:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,变
Dialogue: 0,2:58:18.10,2:58:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,2:58:22.01,2:58:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,2:58:27.24,2:58:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是声音确实在响呢
Dialogue: 0,2:58:30.84,2:58:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,存在没有声音的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,2:58:40.92,2:58:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在看呢
Dialogue: 0,2:58:42.15,2:58:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,2:58:47.76,2:58:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了找到了
Dialogue: 0,2:58:53.56,2:58:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,找到！
Dialogue: 0,2:58:54.23,2:58:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是回声吗？不，谁都会这样
Dialogue: 0,2:58:58.37,2:58:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,回声空露露
Dialogue: 0,2:59:04.14,2:59:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,2:59:06.53,2:59:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好像顺利找到了
Dialogue: 0,2:59:10.59,2:59:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,2:59:14.25,2:59:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关啊……
Dialogue: 0,2:59:30.22,2:59:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,2:59:33.07,2:59:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有涌上来的东西
Dialogue: 0,2:59:43.80,2:59:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,2:59:46.49,2:59:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,3点了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:59:48.21,2:59:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,丑三时…啊
Dialogue: 0,2:59:49.55,2:59:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,电话
Dialogue: 0,2:59:52.82,2:59:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,电话找～
Dialogue: 0,2:59:53.88,2:59:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,2:59:57.74,2:59:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个污渍有点在意啊
Dialogue: 0,3:00:07.61,3:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:00:08.90,3:00:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嘎吱嘎吱的
Dialogue: 0,3:00:09.84,3:00:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好像能听到
Dialogue: 0,3:00:11.90,3:00:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,又好像听不到
Dialogue: 0,3:00:18.39,3:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，坟墓
Dialogue: 0,3:00:20.83,3:00:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是不是那个，玄关的
Dialogue: 0,3:00:23.09,3:00:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,替换吗
Dialogue: 0,3:00:29.10,3:00:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有这么个黑的东西吗，DOG下面
Dialogue: 0,3:00:35.51,3:00:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,「坟墓看不到」抱歉，因为我挡着看不见
Dialogue: 0,3:00:41.65,3:00:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，玄关有个坟墓
Dialogue: 0,3:00:45.27,3:00:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然想换下我的位置，但换了的话那边也可能出现异变
Dialogue: 0,3:00:49.48,3:00:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也有可能看得见吧
Dialogue: 0,3:00:53.19,3:00:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,或者，也可以不全屏显示
Dialogue: 0,3:00:56.96,3:00:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个更好呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:01:00.83,3:01:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果全屏的话，总会有地方被我遮住
Dialogue: 0,3:01:05.29,3:01:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就会产生死角
Dialogue: 0,3:01:07.33,3:01:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说啊
Dialogue: 0,3:01:10.23,3:01:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有扎古一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,3:01:15.84,3:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,「变成迷你原桑？」
Dialogue: 0,3:01:17.05,3:01:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再小一点也行
Dialogue: 0,3:01:20.79,3:01:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这个大小怎么样
Dialogue: 0,3:01:25.96,3:01:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你看
Dialogue: 0,3:01:26.91,3:01:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我想可能会有人觉得害怕
Dialogue: 0,3:01:29.31,3:01:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的人看看我
Dialogue: 0,3:01:31.37,3:01:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就好了
Dialogue: 0,3:01:32.29,3:01:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,3:01:35.04,3:01:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,3:01:36.30,3:01:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然一直是变成巨大原的
Dialogue: 0,3:01:40.11,3:01:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,即使变迷你了
Dialogue: 0,3:01:43.27,3:01:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,存在感是压倒性的存在感吧
Dialogue: 0,3:01:54.20,3:01:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在灵异地点之类的，果然
Dialogue: 0,3:01:57.48,3:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,开朗的人之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:01:59.79,3:02:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会不擅长吧，阳角一类的
Dialogue: 0,3:02:07.24,3:02:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，在偷看
Dialogue: 0,3:02:09.46,3:02:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,找到！
Dialogue: 0,3:02:16.59,3:02:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,带着阴暗的心情
Dialogue: 0,3:02:20.40,3:02:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,去那边的话感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:02:22.11,3:02:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会被附身之类的啊？
Dialogue: 0,3:02:27.92,3:02:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉门开得特别大，是我的错觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:02:31.20,3:02:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吗
Dialogue: 0,3:02:34.30,3:02:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,「偷看的人是不是有点多？」确实
Dialogue: 0,3:02:36.45,3:02:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这次感觉被偷看得很厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:02:39.23,3:02:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太热闹了吧
Dialogue: 0,3:02:42.68,3:02:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,「反过来，越阳光越容易被吸引这样？」诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:02:45.92,3:02:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,反过来？
Dialogue: 0,3:02:49.22,3:02:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不过总觉得，阴暗潮湿的地方
Dialogue: 0,3:02:53.52,3:02:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得它们会喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:00.06,3:03:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好像又听到了奇怪的声音是也
Dialogue: 0,3:03:09.23,3:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,沙沙声那样的
Dialogue: 0,3:03:15.95,3:03:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,去～哪了
Dialogue: 0,3:03:18.30,3:03:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪
Dialogue: 0,3:03:19.18,3:03:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,了？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:21.83,3:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,3:03:24.74,3:03:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里啊～
Dialogue: 0,3:03:28.77,3:03:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,3:03:32.93,3:03:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,3:03:35.69,3:03:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有确凿的证据
Dialogue: 0,3:03:41.22,3:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,拉门！
Dialogue: 0,3:03:52.71,3:03:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没有确凿证据的说
Dialogue: 0,3:03:55.20,3:03:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉又有不一样的了
Dialogue: 0,3:03:57.66,3:04:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,黑色迷雾又跑过去了一次的说
Dialogue: 0,3:04:00.74,3:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,3:04:06.84,3:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跑过去了吧
Dialogue: 0,3:04:07.83,3:04:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不过已经4点24分了
Dialogue: 0,3:04:13.19,3:04:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地
Dialogue: 0,3:04:15.94,3:04:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有显示检测到很多异常之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:04:20.66,3:04:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,3:04:22.31,3:04:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,3:04:25.30,3:04:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:04:26.19,3:04:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,刚这么想
Dialogue: 0,3:04:28.66,3:04:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,刚这么想
Dialogue: 0,3:04:31.99,3:04:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,刚这么想，啊
Dialogue: 0,3:04:34.96,3:04:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不对劲
Dialogue: 0,3:05:06.91,3:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思，稍微那个
Dialogue: 0,3:05:08.64,3:05:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,咳出来了
Dialogue: 0,3:05:14.44,3:05:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,呛到了
Dialogue: 0,3:05:17.12,3:05:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微静音了一下
Dialogue: 0,3:05:18.59,3:05:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一下没赶上
Dialogue: 0,3:05:27.02,3:05:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，来了
Dialogue: 0,3:05:30.52,3:05:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,「咳原小姐出现了吗」
Dialogue: 0,3:05:35.97,3:05:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:05:44.86,3:05:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,3:05:49.05,3:05:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:05:50.48,3:05:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，又来了
Dialogue: 0,3:05:54.40,3:05:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,「没事，喝点水吧」
Dialogue: 0,3:05:55.99,3:05:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对刚才去喝了……因为空了
Dialogue: 0,3:05:58.98,3:06:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微去拿一下
Dialogue: 0,3:06:00.40,3:06:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,新的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,3:06:04.05,3:06:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说也该
Dialogue: 0,3:06:05.83,3:06:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,通gu
Dialogue: 0,3:06:06.56,3:06:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好！搞定了！
Dialogue: 0,3:06:08.20,3:06:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,3:06:09.92,3:06:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然觉得应该没事，我去拿一下饮料
Dialogue: 0,3:06:13.04,3:06:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还请稍等
Dialogue: 0,3:08:34.80,3:08:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我回力，久等了～
Dialogue: 0,3:08:38.76,3:08:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好，我去拿了点新饮料来
Dialogue: 0,3:08:51.44,3:08:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,3:08:53.34,3:08:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,衫屋旅馆和
Dialogue: 0,3:08:55.13,3:08:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色房子的特别津贴已经拿到了
Dialogue: 0,3:08:58.89,3:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,3:09:01.63,3:09:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,果然都看了不少
Dialogue: 0,3:09:03.74,3:09:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然还有没看过的
Dialogue: 0,3:09:06.70,3:09:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,3:09:08.32,3:09:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，这边的
Dialogue: 0,3:09:10.12,3:09:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,观音崎公园那边
Dialogue: 0,3:09:13.17,3:09:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看一下
Dialogue: 0,3:09:17.33,3:09:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:09:20.52,3:09:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,按刚才的感觉的话，还挺容易发现异变的
Dialogue: 0,3:09:26.21,3:09:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这么想
Dialogue: 0,3:09:32.26,3:09:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:09:47.85,3:09:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉听到声音了
Dialogue: 0,3:09:51.82,3:09:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,3:10:00.96,3:10:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,3:10:03.02,3:10:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,找
Dialogue: 0,3:10:03.56,3:10:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,3:10:07.50,3:10:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,「不杂乱的话很容易找呢」
Dialogue: 0,3:10:10.29,3:10:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,3:10:11.59,3:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的感觉是……
Dialogue: 0,3:10:13.93,3:10:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的
Dialogue: 0,3:10:15.57,3:10:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然容易发现
Dialogue: 0,3:10:21.85,3:10:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,3:10:23.20,3:10:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,特别津贴的话异变数量也会增加很多
Dialogue: 0,3:10:26.89,3:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,发现！
Dialogue: 0,3:10:30.17,3:10:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,3:10:31.86,3:10:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,变难了的
Dialogue: 0,3:10:33.10,3:10:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:10:44.32,3:10:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,3:10:45.24,3:10:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,动不了～
Dialogue: 0,3:10:47.93,3:10:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是漏水
Dialogue: 0,3:10:51.48,3:10:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,OK——
Dialogue: 0,3:10:52.79,3:10:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,出来的是不是水呢～
Dialogue: 0,3:11:01.37,3:11:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,招牌啊，从左边变成右边了之类的有过呢
Dialogue: 0,3:11:10.03,3:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还有从对面开始变暗之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:11:14.39,3:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,又听到什么声音了
Dialogue: 0,3:11:17.13,3:11:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,坟墓增加了，或者头不见了之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:11:20.69,3:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,锥形筒倒下了之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:11:24.27,3:11:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那些异变
Dialogue: 0,3:11:27.68,3:11:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有
Dialogue: 0,3:11:30.64,3:11:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,祠堂
Dialogue: 0,3:11:33.47,3:11:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在增加
Dialogue: 0,3:11:34.75,3:11:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说曹操曹操到
Dialogue: 0,3:11:36.25,3:11:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,确实，再稍微……
Dialogue: 0,3:11:37.99,3:11:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:11:42.76,3:11:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,3:11:51.22,3:11:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,3:11:53.69,3:11:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那个不会的，是真的
Dialogue: 0,3:11:56.27,3:11:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不会诶偶偶
Dialogue: 0,3:12:04.24,3:12:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是我错觉吗
Dialogue: 0,3:12:05.90,3:12:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是错觉
Dialogue: 0,3:12:12.21,3:12:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,3:12:13.68,3:12:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有这么多吗
Dialogue: 0,3:12:16.67,3:12:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，捕兽夹？
Dialogue: 0,3:12:19.79,3:12:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么有这么多陷阱…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:23.01,3:12:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《恶灵附身》来着吗
Dialogue: 0,3:12:25.86,3:12:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，那种程度
Dialogue: 0,3:12:27.87,3:12:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好像被设了陷阱…
Dialogue: 0,3:12:39.22,3:12:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？能进去
Dialogue: 0,3:12:48.32,3:12:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,异常检出
Dialogue: 0,3:12:50.74,3:12:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,3:12:57.70,3:12:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,其实呢
Dialogue: 0,3:12:59.28,3:13:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那里不能进去呢
Dialogue: 0,3:13:05.98,3:13:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,写着禁止入内嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:13:12.53,3:13:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才也说了，但如果是现实的话果然
Dialogue: 0,3:13:17.43,3:13:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可能是最讨厌的
Dialogue: 0,3:13:19.02,3:13:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不，也不太确定
Dialogue: 0,3:13:20.18,3:13:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,最后那个也可能讨厌
Dialogue: 0,3:13:23.11,3:13:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但话说回来…
Dialogue: 0,3:13:24.34,3:13:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,其实全都不想去啊
Dialogue: 0,3:13:32.57,3:13:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,异常检出
Dialogue: 0,3:13:39.53,3:13:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔
Dialogue: 0,3:13:40.70,3:13:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，灯塔也经常在恐怖电影里
Dialogue: 0,3:13:44.28,3:13:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,出现呢
Dialogue: 0,3:13:46.62,3:13:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,3:13:58.46,3:14:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,制作这种游戏的时候啊
Dialogue: 0,3:14:02.49,3:14:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:14:05.55,3:14:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不会发生什么奇怪的现象吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:14:10.15,3:14:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会听说啦
Dialogue: 0,3:14:12.42,3:14:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖游戏，制作中的
Dialogue: 0,3:14:17.33,3:14:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,3:14:18.78,3:14:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙的故事之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:14:20.15,3:14:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:14:22.53,3:14:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说是发现了大量异常？
Dialogue: 0,3:14:31.14,3:14:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,3:14:32.27,3:14:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，雷打的好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:14:35.25,3:14:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,闪电
Dialogue: 0,3:14:55.17,3:14:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,3:14:57.28,3:14:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然说「今天可以通行」
Dialogue: 0,3:15:00.97,3:15:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是阻止通行吧
Dialogue: 0,3:15:03.10,3:15:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是禁止通行吧
Dialogue: 0,3:15:11.83,3:15:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,乍一看没什么违和感啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:15:18.96,3:15:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面有网之类的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,3:15:22.62,3:15:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,原来有啊
Dialogue: 0,3:15:32.04,3:15:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,检测出很多异常……
Dialogue: 0,3:15:40.67,3:15:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像这样
Dialogue: 0,3:15:44.27,3:15:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,3:15:45.29,3:15:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,搞错了两个
Dialogue: 0,3:15:54.13,3:15:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，失误了
Dialogue: 0,3:15:57.05,3:15:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，到底在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,3:16:02.87,3:16:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,公共厕所的入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:16:06.13,3:16:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,无名尸骨的入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:16:09.01,3:16:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,物体
Dialogue: 0,3:16:09.65,3:16:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,无名尸骨……
Dialogue: 0,3:16:12.05,3:16:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:16:15.80,3:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,3:16:20.42,3:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这里？
Dialogue: 0,3:16:23.67,3:16:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,入侵者和物体？
Dialogue: 0,3:16:27.91,3:16:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,诶有吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:16:31.35,3:16:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没搞懂
Dialogue: 0,3:16:46.69,3:16:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好像听到了什么声音
Dialogue: 0,3:16:51.53,3:16:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,原来这个叫3分钟隧道？
Dialogue: 0,3:16:55.35,3:16:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是说这隧道大概要走3分钟？
Dialogue: 0,3:16:59.48,3:17:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,3分钟还算挺长的
Dialogue: 0,3:17:02.87,3:17:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,3:17:04.08,3:17:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,深吧
Dialogue: 0,3:17:15.72,3:17:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不完全没看明白啊
Dialogue: 0,3:17:18.91,3:17:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「都能泡好一杯杯面了」
Dialogue: 0,3:17:20.68,3:17:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等你3分钟
Dialogue: 0,3:17:26.24,3:17:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那3分钟的地方，好像没被检测出异常吧
Dialogue: 0,3:17:50.10,3:17:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,3:17:53.86,3:17:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地难啊
Dialogue: 0,3:17:57.26,3:18:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来以为不杂乱的话会简单一点
Dialogue: 0,3:18:01.55,3:18:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但也没那么简单
Dialogue: 0,3:18:03.80,3:18:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,吗
Dialogue: 0,3:18:06.07,3:18:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,3:18:17.10,3:18:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到很多异常
Dialogue: 0,3:18:31.13,3:18:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,3:18:32.97,3:18:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这边，应该在右边
Dialogue: 0,3:18:53.50,3:18:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在看
Dialogue: 0,3:18:54.74,3:18:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是会吓到人嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:18:57.61,3:19:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别突然跳出来啊
Dialogue: 0,3:19:06.55,3:19:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,其他呢
Dialogue: 0,3:19:20.67,3:19:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这里原来是这样的吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:19:24.17,3:19:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么变多了
Dialogue: 0,3:19:28.57,3:19:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一个隧道
Dialogue: 0,3:19:35.68,3:19:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,3:19:36.70,3:19:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,变
Dialogue: 0,3:19:48.14,3:19:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好像能听到猫头鹰的叫声
Dialogue: 0,3:19:59.57,3:20:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,3:20:01.40,3:20:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,做成像游戏的那个
Dialogue: 0,3:20:08.18,3:20:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:20:13.00,3:20:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,3分钟隧道
Dialogue: 0,3:20:23.25,3:20:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这里好像也没什么异常
Dialogue: 0,3:20:41.88,3:20:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:20:42.31,3:20:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,3:20:46.00,3:20:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,声音和现象是联动的吗
Dialogue: 0,3:20:49.89,3:20:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有声音
Dialogue: 0,3:20:50.86,3:20:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,3:20:54.03,3:20:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,果然和声音一起
Dialogue: 0,3:20:57.82,3:20:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有异变来了的感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:21:10.77,3:21:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是大变化的话，我倒能明白
Dialogue: 0,3:21:30.62,3:21:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:21:35.72,3:21:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，不会吧
Dialogue: 0,3:21:41.69,3:21:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现象在增加的样子
Dialogue: 0,3:21:46.07,3:21:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,3:21:49.29,3:21:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,赶上啊！
Dialogue: 0,3:21:53.45,3:21:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,3:21:54.22,3:21:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说还有别的
Dialogue: 0,3:22:03.74,3:22:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,诶……？
Dialogue: 0,3:22:07.01,3:22:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:22:18.02,3:22:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:22:18.94,3:22:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,3:22:19.79,3:22:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不对
Dialogue: 0,3:22:22.10,3:22:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:22:25.47,3:22:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是栅栏不见了
Dialogue: 0,3:22:54.49,3:22:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,捕兽夹
Dialogue: 0,3:22:57.37,3:23:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不，总觉得我大概是看漏了什么
Dialogue: 0,3:23:14.23,3:23:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:20.99,3:23:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才好像有什么出现了
Dialogue: 0,3:23:29.03,3:23:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在～
Dialogue: 0,3:23:32.11,3:23:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪位
Dialogue: 0,3:23:35.70,3:23:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,光临了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:23:38.91,3:23:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了
Dialogue: 0,3:23:44.96,3:23:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，没有吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:50.38,3:23:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,人脸？
Dialogue: 0,3:23:51.39,3:23:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,3:23:55.56,3:23:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，不是吧！
Dialogue: 0,3:24:00.11,3:24:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:01.60,3:24:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道里有入侵者，被疯狂入侵了
Dialogue: 0,3:24:05.65,3:24:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,物体的替换
Dialogue: 0,3:24:07.52,3:24:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所里有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:24:08.73,3:24:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,又有人进厕所了
Dialogue: 0,3:24:12.11,3:24:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,假的吧，有吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:15.23,3:24:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不，可能很难看出来
Dialogue: 0,3:24:22.41,3:24:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都看出来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:24.17,3:24:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:24:29.86,3:24:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,3:24:31.03,3:24:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:34.05,3:24:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，完全没搞懂
Dialogue: 0,3:24:41.60,3:24:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是这里吧，脸在这里？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:45.01,3:24:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,3:24:52.73,3:24:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还以为我看的挺多的了
Dialogue: 0,3:25:00.35,3:25:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,物体的替换啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:25:04.63,3:25:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉难度果然提高了
Dialogue: 0,3:25:08.87,3:25:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在哭吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:25:12.81,3:25:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哭的那位呢
Dialogue: 0,3:25:14.33,3:25:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,3:25:21.25,3:25:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,和声音一同出现的家伙可能比较好发现
Dialogue: 0,3:25:26.66,3:25:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,最开始找这里的时候还挺
Dialogue: 0,3:25:31.12,3:25:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,容易看出来的
Dialogue: 0,3:25:36.45,3:25:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才这里提示物体的替换
Dialogue: 0,3:25:39.91,3:25:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,说到底根本没什么物体
Dialogue: 0,3:25:50.58,3:25:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,到底
Dialogue: 0,3:25:51.54,3:25:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看错了什么
Dialogue: 0,3:25:54.87,3:25:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,会觉得这像脸呢
Dialogue: 0,3:26:08.26,3:26:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,沉着地
Dialogue: 0,3:26:09.08,3:26:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,观察吧
Dialogue: 0,3:26:10.25,3:26:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,还有，厕所里有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:26:16.70,3:26:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没有呢
Dialogue: 0,3:26:20.85,3:26:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,入侵者什么的
Dialogue: 0,3:26:24.93,3:26:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是要跟我说变多了呢
Dialogue: 0,3:26:46.52,3:26:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,3:26:47.39,3:26:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪，没有栅栏
Dialogue: 0,3:26:56.16,3:26:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得没有吧
Dialogue: 0,3:27:07.11,3:27:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然换个角度看，也不是完全不像脸
Dialogue: 0,3:27:12.39,3:27:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,以前有这么难分bi
Dialogue: 0,3:27:13.69,3:27:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,3:27:17.27,3:27:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,以前没有这么难的吧
Dialogue: 0,3:27:23.54,3:27:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:27:25.56,3:27:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很活跃呢
Dialogue: 0,3:27:29.65,3:27:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼——怪
Dialogue: 0,3:27:34.64,3:27:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,3:27:38.97,3:27:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,3:27:39.78,3:27:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,呢
Dialogue: 0,3:27:40.86,3:27:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,摄像头是不是有点歪
Dialogue: 0,3:27:46.57,3:27:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那回事
Dialogue: 0,3:27:55.00,3:27:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么方块
Dialogue: 0,3:28:05.83,3:28:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,, 没这么荒凉吧
Dialogue: 0,3:28:10.34,3:28:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不是异常
Dialogue: 0,3:28:16.22,3:28:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那到底什么是异常呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:28:20.84,3:28:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是异常
Dialogue: 0,3:28:27.07,3:28:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,3:28:27.92,3:28:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一目了然
Dialogue: 0,3:28:39.24,3:28:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,3:28:43.51,3:28:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉原本就是这样
Dialogue: 0,3:28:49.45,3:28:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,又感觉好像不是那样
Dialogue: 0,3:28:55.00,3:28:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:28:59.68,3:29:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所什么的经常错过呢
Dialogue: 0,3:29:09.02,3:29:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉这里挺干净的
Dialogue: 0,3:29:15.28,3:29:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异常才是异常
Dialogue: 0,3:29:19.22,3:29:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异常才是异常
Dialogue: 0,3:29:22.75,3:29:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:29:25.33,3:29:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,找到！
Dialogue: 0,3:29:32.05,3:29:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,报告完成
Dialogue: 0,3:29:36.79,3:29:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得有点……红不
Dialogue: 0,3:29:39.50,3:29:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是呢
Dialogue: 0,3:29:42.84,3:29:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,3:30:01.36,3:30:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,动不了
Dialogue: 0,3:30:04.03,3:30:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所的异常
Dialogue: 0,3:30:05.73,3:30:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所的花子小姐
Dialogue: 0,3:30:19.54,3:30:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:30:23.37,3:30:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感啊
Dialogue: 0,3:30:34.71,3:30:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,无名尸骨
Dialogue: 0,3:30:45.32,3:30:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说超级难
Dialogue: 0,3:30:49.08,3:30:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方
Dialogue: 0,3:30:58.71,3:30:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,2点
Dialogue: 0,3:31:00.63,3:31:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来就会开始活跃呢
Dialogue: 0,3:31:05.68,3:31:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有头
Dialogue: 0,3:31:07.33,3:31:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没有头的话马上
Dialogue: 0,3:31:09.69,3:31:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就能发现呢
Dialogue: 0,3:31:19.81,3:31:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,请叫我头部的铃原
Dialogue: 0,3:31:31.43,3:31:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,敲了敲吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:31:35.53,3:31:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，寂静岭场景的厕所
Dialogue: 0,3:31:38.04,3:31:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很容易发现呢
Dialogue: 0,3:31:45.66,3:31:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止入内
Dialogue: 0,3:31:49.76,3:31:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:31:56.41,3:31:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，感觉
Dialogue: 0,3:31:59.56,3:32:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到对面
Dialogue: 0,3:32:01.28,3:32:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话倒没那么可怕
Dialogue: 0,3:32:04.63,3:32:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的是对面一片漆黑啊
Dialogue: 0,3:32:11.92,3:32:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不这么觉得吗
Dialogue: 0,3:32:20.13,3:32:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不在呢
Dialogue: 0,3:32:25.88,3:32:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,话说这个，是不是在一会儿这边一会儿那边的跑啊？
Dialogue: 0,3:32:32.84,3:32:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,3:32:35.15,3:32:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,错
Dialogue: 0,3:32:36.04,3:32:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,觉
Dialogue: 0,3:32:37.31,3:32:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的错觉
Dialogue: 0,3:32:53.94,3:32:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没有任何变化——
Dialogue: 0,3:32:58.01,3:32:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,名叫这个的变化
Dialogue: 0,3:32:59.74,3:33:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:33:00.29,3:33:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在看
Dialogue: 0,3:33:03.15,3:33:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,被看着
Dialogue: 0,3:33:04.24,3:33:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这个难道是厕所的
Dialogue: 0,3:33:06.50,3:33:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,幽灵
Dialogue: 0,3:33:09.70,3:33:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,总是被她入侵的我…
Dialogue: 0,3:33:23.64,3:33:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:33:25.29,3:33:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,3:33:39.96,3:33:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有声音
Dialogue: 0,3:33:41.49,3:33:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到
Dialogue: 0,3:33:48.31,3:33:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,物体的替换那个
Dialogue: 0,3:33:55.45,3:33:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还是没搞明白啊
Dialogue: 0,3:34:01.32,3:34:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是哪个呢？
Dialogue: 0,3:34:04.52,3:34:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,3:34:04.96,3:34:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定已经有好几个了
Dialogue: 0,3:34:09.12,3:34:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这个……有这样的线吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:34:12.68,3:34:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这样不是很明显吗
Dialogue: 0,3:34:16.56,3:34:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:34:17.01,3:34:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,3:34:22.76,3:34:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,「今日可通行」
Dialogue: 0,3:34:24.51,3:34:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可不能通行啊
Dialogue: 0,3:34:30.61,3:34:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不行哦～
Dialogue: 0,3:34:33.85,3:34:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,俗话说灯塔下一片黑呢
Dialogue: 0,3:34:53.98,3:34:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,诶……？
Dialogue: 0,3:35:07.66,3:35:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一辈子都注意不到
Dialogue: 0,3:35:19.82,3:35:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点不一样
Dialogue: 0,3:35:24.22,3:35:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,坟墓数量增加了
Dialogue: 0,3:35:28.89,3:35:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好像看到电灯了
Dialogue: 0,3:35:32.95,3:35:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,3:35:35.55,3:35:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——？
Dialogue: 0,3:35:39.05,3:35:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,无名尸骨有入侵者？
Dialogue: 0,3:35:43.04,3:35:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,3分钟隧道的摄像头故障
Dialogue: 0,3:35:48.45,3:35:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——？
Dialogue: 0,3:35:51.44,3:35:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道和
Dialogue: 0,3:35:53.80,3:35:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,3:35:54.21,3:35:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,无名尸骨的入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:35:56.93,3:35:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉被入侵得好厉害
Dialogue: 0,3:35:59.83,3:36:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「绝对没有入侵者！」就是啊
Dialogue: 0,3:36:03.34,3:36:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道里有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:36:05.20,3:36:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,假的吧
Dialogue: 0,3:36:08.91,3:36:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对没有我可好好看了哦
Dialogue: 0,3:36:15.48,3:36:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,说是无名尸骨那边也有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:36:18.12,3:36:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是挺……没按到该按的地方
Dialogue: 0,3:36:25.80,3:36:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那假的是真的？
Dialogue: 0,3:36:32.21,3:36:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我没找到啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:36:36.94,3:36:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者
Dialogue: 0,3:36:46.44,3:36:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要贴上去呢
Dialogue: 0,3:37:05.99,3:37:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是——
Dialogue: 0,3:37:08.29,3:37:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是没变嘛
Dialogue: 0,3:37:22.06,3:37:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,3:37:24.91,3:37:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不
Dialogue: 0,3:37:25.91,3:37:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,红色的字
Dialogue: 0,3:37:28.26,3:37:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只是消失又出现而已吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,3:37:39.88,3:37:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,天气
Dialogue: 0,3:37:47.41,3:37:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,天气很简单啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:37:56.10,3:37:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:38:09.74,3:38:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，坟墓？
Dialogue: 0,3:38:12.46,3:38:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有吧
Dialogue: 0,3:38:24.65,3:38:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:38:29.53,3:38:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能有无论如何都不擅长的
Dialogue: 0,3:38:33.61,3:38:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有吧
Dialogue: 0,3:38:35.27,3:38:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这看起来不像li……
Dialogue: 0,3:38:37.76,3:38:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,脸吗
Dialogue: 0,3:38:43.15,3:38:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没有检出的哟
Dialogue: 0,3:38:47.78,3:38:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了
Dialogue: 0,3:38:55.50,3:38:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,呼嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:38:59.55,3:39:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,明明这么简陋
Dialogue: 0,3:39:02.37,3:39:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有变化的话一眼就能看出来吧
Dialogue: 0,3:39:05.52,3:39:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔
Dialogue: 0,3:39:06.97,3:39:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,啊奇怪
Dialogue: 0,3:39:08.47,3:39:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话很简单
Dialogue: 0,3:39:11.05,3:39:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说
Dialogue: 0,3:39:19.01,3:39:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,3:39:19.70,3:39:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,3:39:22.41,3:39:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有……看起来似乎是这样！
Dialogue: 0,3:39:24.76,3:39:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但
Dialogue: 0,3:39:25.60,3:39:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,3:39:28.75,3:39:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的
Dialogue: 0,3:39:30.08,3:39:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,3分钟隧道摄像头的故障
Dialogue: 0,3:39:50.15,3:39:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔……
Dialogue: 0,3:39:59.29,3:40:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有吧
Dialogue: 0,3:40:06.73,3:40:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,已经搞不懂了，这个一直看着像脸
Dialogue: 0,3:40:10.76,3:40:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，看到了
Dialogue: 0,3:40:13.79,3:40:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,3:40:24.03,3:40:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,纹样什么的
Dialogue: 0,3:40:34.80,3:40:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道啊……
Dialogue: 0,3:40:42.64,3:40:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谁～？
Dialogue: 0,3:40:46.60,3:40:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,声音
Dialogue: 0,3:40:58.96,3:41:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,现在绝对有人过来了
Dialogue: 0,3:41:03.37,3:41:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,到哪了？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:10.72,3:41:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,3:41:18.14,3:41:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,3:41:23.32,3:41:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,3:41:24.21,3:41:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可能能看到像血迹一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,3:41:27.53,3:41:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,错觉啊
Dialogue: 0,3:41:29.97,3:41:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,血痕
Dialogue: 0,3:41:32.42,3:41:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,进水
Dialogue: 0,3:41:37.06,3:41:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,进水
Dialogue: 0,3:41:41.12,3:41:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,3:41:46.17,3:41:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,3:41:54.77,3:41:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:41:58.54,3:42:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这里好像…歪了！
Dialogue: 0,3:42:01.82,3:42:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,坟墓
Dialogue: 0,3:42:04.72,3:42:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想有没有倒呢
Dialogue: 0,3:42:09.39,3:42:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，这个反了，是这边
Dialogue: 0,3:42:13.28,3:42:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但是都是些见过的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,3:42:20.87,3:42:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,3:42:24.41,3:42:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，然后这边之类的
Dialogue: 0,3:42:28.92,3:42:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:42:32.31,3:42:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不……对
Dialogue: 0,3:42:39.33,3:42:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:42:45.07,3:42:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，失误了，糟糕糟糕
Dialogue: 0,3:42:49.03,3:42:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在看
Dialogue: 0,3:42:51.00,3:42:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,赶上啊，赶上啊，赶上啊
Dialogue: 0,3:42:53.85,3:42:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要赶上啊
Dialogue: 0,3:42:56.81,3:42:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这个也之前找到过一次了
Dialogue: 0,3:43:02.08,3:43:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，我失误这么多吗
Dialogue: 0,3:43:05.39,3:43:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,异常多
Dialogue: 0,3:43:12.20,3:43:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,实
Dialogue: 0,3:43:13.16,3:43:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,3:43:13.87,3:43:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,3:43:14.78,3:43:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,太
Dialogue: 0,3:43:18.10,3:43:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,3:43:24.95,3:43:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，有点奇怪，落叶
Dialogue: 0,3:43:29.67,3:43:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,3:43:35.28,3:43:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,入侵…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:37.67,3:43:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧，无名尸骨的入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:43:41.52,3:43:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,又
Dialogue: 0,3:43:42.37,3:43:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道被入侵了
Dialogue: 0,3:43:45.62,3:43:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我让隧道被两个人入侵了？
Dialogue: 0,3:43:48.65,3:43:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:43:50.05,3:43:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,诶，等等，隧道让我先…
Dialogue: 0,3:43:53.34,3:43:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让我贴着看吗
Dialogue: 0,3:43:54.07,3:43:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可以成为隧道的地缚灵吗
Dialogue: 0,3:43:59.42,3:44:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,绝
Dialogue: 0,3:44:01.07,3:44:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,3:44:03.70,3:44:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什、什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:44:04.92,3:44:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,3:44:05.52,3:44:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,3:44:08.40,3:44:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大家，注意到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:44:10.90,3:44:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是那样的话
Dialogue: 0,3:44:12.10,3:44:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,大家，糟了
Dialogue: 0,3:44:13.52,3:44:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,被附身了
Dialogue: 0,3:44:14.97,3:44:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没看到
Dialogue: 0,3:44:19.44,3:44:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都被附身了啊
Dialogue: 0,3:44:31.04,3:44:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,变得漆黑……
Dialogue: 0,3:44:32.78,3:44:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看不到这里……
Dialogue: 0,3:44:35.10,3:44:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉隐约的有点像人脸
Dialogue: 0,3:44:38.14,3:44:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那种微不足道的东西
Dialogue: 0,3:44:42.24,3:44:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不过就算贴上去也不一定会来吧
Dialogue: 0,3:44:45.46,3:44:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但是和之前没变化哦
Dialogue: 0,3:44:50.45,3:44:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「是{\alpha&H80&}我{\alpha&H00&}你被附身了」
Dialogue: 0,3:44:52.10,3:44:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:44:58.28,3:44:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止贴上去吧
Dialogue: 0,3:45:10.17,3:45:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,3:45:20.02,3:45:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,话说，无名尸骨也很
Dialogue: 0,3:45:23.18,3:45:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,3:45:26.57,3:45:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,漏看了啊
Dialogue: 0,3:45:36.00,3:45:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不在呢
Dialogue: 0,3:45:39.04,3:45:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,天气
Dialogue: 0,3:45:41.61,3:45:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像脸
Dialogue: 0,3:45:43.60,3:45:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,已经搞不清了，别的地方也看起来像脸
Dialogue: 0,3:46:09.69,3:46:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,3:46:12.60,3:46:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,目前真的没有异常吗
Dialogue: 0,3:46:14.46,3:46:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等等有了有了
Dialogue: 0,3:46:19.53,3:46:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有这么多异常了？
Dialogue: 0,3:46:36.62,3:46:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没有头
Dialogue: 0,3:46:41.67,3:46:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,猎头喵（物理）
Dialogue: 0,3:46:52.18,3:46:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要
Dialogue: 0,3:46:53.31,3:46:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,找出
Dialogue: 0,3:46:54.37,3:46:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,异变来
Dialogue: 0,3:47:02.89,3:47:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……莲花
Dialogue: 0,3:47:05.62,3:47:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,易懂的
Dialogue: 0,3:47:17.02,3:47:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,呼嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:47:33.98,3:47:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不……我觉得现在还没有
Dialogue: 0,3:47:41.15,3:47:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的
Dialogue: 0,3:47:44.24,3:47:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是该快速的
Dialogue: 0,3:47:46.57,3:47:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,切换切换比较好呢
Dialogue: 0,3:47:51.38,3:47:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,刷刷刷刷的
Dialogue: 0,3:47:59.44,3:48:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,3:48:00.20,3:48:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛，因为
Dialogue: 0,3:48:01.78,3:48:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经找到好几次了
Dialogue: 0,3:48:20.33,3:48:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这个看起来像脸
Dialogue: 0,3:48:24.18,3:48:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，我觉得大概不是
Dialogue: 0,3:48:33.92,3:48:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,又听到声音了啊
Dialogue: 0,3:48:41.08,3:48:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,3:49:01.90,3:49:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,异常很多吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:49:19.14,3:49:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真容易懂
Dialogue: 0,3:49:25.75,3:49:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,异常检出
Dialogue: 0,3:49:52.45,3:49:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:00.26,3:50:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,3:50:03.21,3:50:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,文字变了
Dialogue: 0,3:50:12.22,3:50:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:15.48,3:50:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,已经那么多了？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:21.95,3:50:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,3:50:23.50,3:50:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呢
Dialogue: 0,3:50:24.92,3:50:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,之前也发现过一次
Dialogue: 0,3:50:32.68,3:50:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所吗
Dialogue: 0,3:50:33.62,3:50:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了「哐」的一声
Dialogue: 0,3:50:45.37,3:50:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,3:50:56.71,3:50:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,捕兽夹
Dialogue: 0,3:51:19.17,3:51:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠
Dialogue: 0,3:51:55.26,3:51:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:05.60,3:52:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:11.60,3:52:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不在吧
Dialogue: 0,3:52:16.66,3:52:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,找到！
Dialogue: 0,3:52:20.22,3:52:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,找到找到
Dialogue: 0,3:52:34.26,3:52:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——
Dialogue: 0,3:52:42.41,3:52:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,直到现在从来没有这么难的东西
Dialogue: 0,3:52:46.06,3:52:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有过吗
Dialogue: 0,3:52:48.32,3:52:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,3:52:49.71,3:52:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:52:53.69,3:52:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,3:52:54.29,3:52:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,3:52:55.30,3:52:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有张脸在偷看
Dialogue: 0,3:53:00.29,3:53:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很难看清
Dialogue: 0,3:53:03.57,3:53:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了找到了
Dialogue: 0,3:53:08.21,3:53:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,横过来看的
Dialogue: 0,3:53:11.51,3:53:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，是从什么时候开始在那的？
Dialogue: 0,3:53:14.12,3:53:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,一直有吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:53:16.96,3:53:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,3:53:26.37,3:53:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,血痕
Dialogue: 0,3:53:30.73,3:53:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,3:53:32.25,3:53:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,「非常早就在了」
Dialogue: 0,3:53:34.13,3:53:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧，大家！
Dialogue: 0,3:53:37.26,3:53:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道的吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:53:40.28,3:53:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是那个下饭担当吗
Dialogue: 0,3:53:44.24,3:53:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说的话，这附近是不是也还有啊？
Dialogue: 0,3:53:52.38,3:53:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不完全……搞不清楚……
Dialogue: 0,3:54:01.58,3:54:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,融入的太彻底了
Dialogue: 0,3:54:19.61,3:54:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,枯萎了
Dialogue: 0,3:54:21.50,3:54:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～～～
Dialogue: 0,3:54:24.08,3:54:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哈啊～～～～
Dialogue: 0,3:54:27.57,3:54:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,「1、2如果不从远处看的话，很难看清楚」
Dialogue: 0,3:54:31.29,3:54:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,居然有的，真的有
Dialogue: 0,3:54:35.58,3:54:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道里有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,3:54:37.64,3:54:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,替换？
Dialogue: 0,3:54:40.09,3:54:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,无名尸骨那边，可是看了好久呢
Dialogue: 0,3:54:47.17,3:54:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，不是
Dialogue: 0,3:54:47.87,3:54:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个无名尸骨那边物体替换没赶上的吗
Dialogue: 0,3:54:53.67,3:54:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道真不妙
Dialogue: 0,3:54:59.92,3:55:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微拉远一点看吧
Dialogue: 0,3:55:05.94,3:55:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道？
Dialogue: 0,3:55:10.19,3:55:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,果然什么违和感都没感觉到，难道说
Dialogue: 0,3:55:25.91,3:55:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧……
Dialogue: 0,3:55:34.70,3:55:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没搞懂
Dialogue: 0,3:55:44.55,3:55:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道……
Dialogue: 0,3:55:47.36,3:55:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一边从远处看
Dialogue: 0,3:56:00.79,3:56:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——？
Dialogue: 0,3:56:13.16,3:56:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,变暗的那种，我倒是能看出来
Dialogue: 0,3:56:24.25,3:56:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是类似视错觉艺术的感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,3:56:42.92,3:56:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天气
Dialogue: 0,3:56:44.34,3:56:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这种的
Dialogue: 0,3:56:45.94,3:56:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,明明很容易找
Dialogue: 0,3:56:50.07,3:56:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,物体的替换这种
Dialogue: 0,3:56:53.19,3:56:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,入侵吧
Dialogue: 0,3:56:55.15,3:56:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,被遭中的很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,3:56:57.92,3:56:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,相当
Dialogue: 0,3:56:59.30,3:57:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在隧道里
Dialogue: 0,3:57:06.53,3:57:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，在！
Dialogue: 0,3:57:07.51,3:57:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,3:57:09.07,3:57:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,3:57:24.60,3:57:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,入侵那么多次……
Dialogue: 0,3:57:27.19,3:57:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,太亮！
Dialogue: 0,3:57:29.23,3:57:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第一次吧
Dialogue: 0,3:57:39.13,3:57:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,呼嗯……
Dialogue: 0,3:57:43.18,3:57:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,眯着眼睛看
Dialogue: 0,3:57:45.36,3:57:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 0,3:57:46.40,3:57:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么擅自
Dialogue: 0,3:57:56.57,3:57:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在看
Dialogue: 0,3:57:57.73,3:57:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙在看吗
Dialogue: 0,3:58:01.16,3:58:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不，还以为空调擅自停了，其实是我碾到它了
Dialogue: 0,3:58:04.38,3:58:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉，完全不是那个
Dialogue: 0,3:58:06.00,3:58:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,请放心
Dialogue: 0,3:58:26.26,3:58:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,因为太专注了
Dialogue: 0,3:58:32.23,3:58:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,从远处看的话……
Dialogue: 0,3:58:36.04,3:58:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像眼珠
Dialogue: 0,3:58:40.03,3:58:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不对呢……
Dialogue: 0,3:58:49.34,3:58:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,捕兽夹
Dialogue: 0,3:58:55.05,3:58:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,捕兽夹
Dialogue: 0,3:59:01.11,3:59:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,3:59:08.91,3:59:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在上面之类的吗
Dialogue: 0,3:59:10.91,3:59:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感～异变～
Dialogue: 0,3:59:16.86,3:59:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不，这样的话无论如何都要查明
Dialogue: 0,3:59:21.14,3:59:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,把异变
Dialogue: 0,3:59:23.57,3:59:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何
Dialogue: 0,3:59:26.10,3:59:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要查明哦
Dialogue: 0,3:59:29.10,3:59:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,要查明哦！
Dialogue: 0,3:59:37.51,3:59:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,3:59:38.32,3:59:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,3:59:39.71,3:59:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是应该看整体呢…
Dialogue: 0,3:59:44.28,3:59:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我觉得应该没有吧
Dialogue: 0,4:00:00.68,4:00:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,找到，这个很容易看到
Dialogue: 0,4:00:04.70,4:00:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哈——总感觉稍微……这个
Dialogue: 0,4:00:08.99,4:00:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不觉得像人影吗
Dialogue: 0,4:00:13.37,4:00:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,4:00:14.31,4:00:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,4:00:16.53,4:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,并非不是不像人影
Dialogue: 0,4:00:19.15,4:00:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这种程度
Dialogue: 0,4:00:24.44,4:00:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这种程度的这种程度？
Dialogue: 0,4:00:32.94,4:00:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了，我
Dialogue: 0,4:00:35.06,4:00:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不可懈怠业务
Dialogue: 0,4:00:38.31,4:00:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句，再错一次的话
Dialogue: 0,4:00:41.12,4:00:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就Game Over了哦
Dialogue: 0,4:00:47.61,4:00:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Game～Opera～
Dialogue: 0,4:00:52.07,4:00:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候～
Dialogue: 0,4:01:06.74,4:01:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这个像是
Dialogue: 0,4:01:09.87,4:01:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在不能失误，所以等一下，确定的东西
Dialogue: 0,4:01:13.94,4:01:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,直到出现为止
Dialogue: 0,4:01:15.28,4:01:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是不是有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,4:01:22.29,4:01:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好，找到
Dialogue: 0,4:01:30.61,4:01:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这里，原本是阶梯状的吗
Dialogue: 0,4:01:32.97,4:01:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是阶梯状的
Dialogue: 0,4:01:34.66,4:01:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没有栅栏
Dialogue: 0,4:01:42.86,4:01:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔有这么长？不
Dialogue: 0,4:01:45.58,4:01:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,更低的才对
Dialogue: 0,4:01:56.84,4:01:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,变成竖长的了
Dialogue: 0,4:02:03.37,4:02:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,4:02:04.63,4:02:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,变成呢——
Dialogue: 0,4:02:10.05,4:02:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人脸
Dialogue: 0,4:02:13.34,4:02:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,头也没掉
Dialogue: 0,4:02:18.23,4:02:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,再失误一次的话
Dialogue: 0,4:02:21.41,4:02:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,变暗了！OKOK
Dialogue: 0,4:02:28.76,4:02:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,4:02:31.15,4:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,又
Dialogue: 0,4:02:32.79,4:02:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好像变多了
Dialogue: 0,4:02:35.71,4:02:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,现象
Dialogue: 0,4:02:38.75,4:02:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,4:02:39.46,4:02:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,叶子不一样
Dialogue: 0,4:02:57.19,4:02:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,4:03:01.68,4:03:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这个可以试试吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:03:06.20,4:03:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不对啊
Dialogue: 0,4:03:11.55,4:03:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,明明感觉很像是的
Dialogue: 0,4:03:17.36,4:03:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好，手臂
Dialogue: 0,4:03:20.86,4:03:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好，从叶子下来的
Dialogue: 0,4:03:22.70,4:03:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,空露露
Dialogue: 0,4:03:34.73,4:03:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔
Dialogue: 0,4:03:38.39,4:03:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是脸吗
Dialogue: 0,4:03:42.66,4:03:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,话说整体是不是变亮了？
Dialogue: 0,4:03:45.00,4:03:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有这么亮吗
Dialogue: 0,4:03:47.86,4:03:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:03:54.26,4:03:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得全部…
Dialogue: 0,4:03:57.22,4:03:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,4:04:04.73,4:04:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,请别学蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 0,4:04:14.53,4:04:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像脸
Dialogue: 0,4:04:17.35,4:04:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道，全都像脸
Dialogue: 0,4:04:21.44,4:04:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,祠堂以前有这么长吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:04:24.73,4:04:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对有点ch、长
Dialogue: 0,4:04:26.45,4:04:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,并没有
Dialogue: 0,4:04:32.71,4:04:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,花还没枯萎
Dialogue: 0,4:04:38.82,4:04:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是在这边吗
Dialogue: 0,4:04:43.27,4:04:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有头
Dialogue: 0,4:04:53.72,4:04:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:04:54.40,4:04:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,又说异常现象很多
Dialogue: 0,4:04:57.26,4:04:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,岂有此理
Dialogue: 0,4:05:04.43,4:05:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有点多吧？花
Dialogue: 0,4:05:20.28,4:05:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要是再搞错一个
Dialogue: 0,4:05:21.79,4:05:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，链…那
Dialogue: 0,4:05:26.32,4:05:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,诶诶———
Dialogue: 0,4:05:30.47,4:05:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,呕诶呃呃呃
Dialogue: 0,4:05:34.01,4:05:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:05:36.20,4:05:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道里怎么又有入侵者了
Dialogue: 0,4:05:47.46,4:05:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道里
Dialogue: 0,4:05:50.04,4:05:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我又让入侵者进来了
Dialogue: 0,4:05:53.69,4:05:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一直是同一个家伙
Dialogue: 0,4:06:00.41,4:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所里有物体移动？
Dialogue: 0,4:06:04.11,4:06:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,果然把手还是那个吗？反方向吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:06:07.79,4:06:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,第一条一直在呢
Dialogue: 0,4:06:10.92,4:06:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,第一条好像一直在……
Dialogue: 0,4:06:14.88,4:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就算知道它在，也搞不清楚啊
Dialogue: 0,4:06:18.46,4:06:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,明明我相当拉远去看了啊
Dialogue: 0,4:06:48.59,4:06:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,呼嗯——
Dialogue: 0,4:06:53.96,4:06:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这个声音就是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,4:06:56.14,4:06:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,听声音就知道了
Dialogue: 0,4:07:03.44,4:07:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:07:07.35,4:07:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,够困难呢
Dialogue: 0,4:07:12.74,4:07:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,又能听到声音了
Dialogue: 0,4:07:19.84,4:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,4:07:22.66,4:07:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,4:07:24.66,4:07:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我要变成地缚灵了
Dialogue: 0,4:07:31.32,4:07:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉要出不去了
Dialogue: 0,4:07:38.53,4:07:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在……
Dialogue: 0,4:07:39.89,4:07:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哪……
Dialogue: 0,4:07:41.06,4:07:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,里……
Dialogue: 0,4:07:41.48,4:07:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在这边呢，把手
Dialogue: 0,4:07:51.53,4:07:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,天气
Dialogue: 0,4:07:56.21,4:07:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:08:02.52,4:08:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,唔嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:08:06.65,4:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要说像脸也不能说不像……
Dialogue: 0,4:08:09.94,4:08:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,更加
Dialogue: 0,4:08:12.36,4:08:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,更加决定性的
Dialogue: 0,4:08:15.63,4:08:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,4:08:17.31,4:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看漏了
Dialogue: 0,4:08:25.28,4:08:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,锥形筒倒了
Dialogue: 0,4:08:40.69,4:08:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,灯……塔……
Dialogue: 0,4:08:49.46,4:08:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,4:08:55.35,4:08:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,从厕所来的空露露
Dialogue: 0,4:08:58.18,4:08:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面
Dialogue: 0,4:09:00.93,4:09:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所里的异变还挺多的呢
Dialogue: 0,4:09:04.05,4:09:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没搞懂物体的替换是什么
Dialogue: 0,4:09:07.79,4:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，在吗
Dialogue: 0,4:09:14.76,4:09:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在吗，不在
Dialogue: 0,4:09:16.83,4:09:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,吗
Dialogue: 0,4:09:17.86,4:09:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪边～呢
Dialogue: 0,4:09:21.13,4:09:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还没来吗
Dialogue: 0,4:09:27.84,4:09:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,4:09:28.99,4:09:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,又
Dialogue: 0,4:09:30.42,4:09:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,咔当一声
Dialogue: 0,4:09:33.44,4:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然响了
Dialogue: 0,4:09:38.23,4:09:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,4:09:39.20,4:09:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很明显
Dialogue: 0,4:09:41.97,4:09:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说怎么说怎么说
Dialogue: 0,4:09:58.37,4:10:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,脑袋还在
Dialogue: 0,4:10:03.46,4:10:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的摄像头
Dialogue: 0,4:10:11.62,4:10:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,异变的数量也超级多啊
Dialogue: 0,4:10:15.22,4:10:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,其中几个…
Dialogue: 0,4:10:17.06,4:10:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大概完全没注意到吧
Dialogue: 0,4:10:29.95,4:10:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道总是被搞呢
Dialogue: 0,4:10:37.35,4:10:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,脸…？
Dialogue: 0,4:10:39.80,4:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,脸
Dialogue: 0,4:10:43.36,4:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不……再怎么说也不会是的感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:10:50.72,4:10:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,4:10:55.26,4:10:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,4:10:56.07,4:10:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,搞快点
Dialogue: 0,4:11:00.61,4:11:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快进快进
Dialogue: 0,4:11:03.22,4:11:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快进着找
Dialogue: 0,4:11:10.67,4:11:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠！
Dialogue: 0,4:11:12.21,4:11:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个？
Dialogue: 0,4:11:13.81,4:11:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但是这种……
Dialogue: 0,4:11:16.84,4:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这么简单的东西我居然没找到
Dialogue: 0,4:11:21.22,4:11:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才这里明明有好多眼珠
Dialogue: 0,4:11:23.81,4:11:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是这个啊
Dialogue: 0,4:11:27.00,4:11:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,4:11:27.53,4:11:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧？这个一直都在？
Dialogue: 0,4:11:31.77,4:11:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也太简单了吧
Dialogue: 0,4:11:38.83,4:11:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我居然被那种…
Dialogue: 0,4:11:40.31,4:11:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,4:11:47.77,4:11:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的？
Dialogue: 0,4:12:01.50,4:12:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠真的
Dialogue: 0,4:12:02.96,4:12:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,超容易找到呢
Dialogue: 0,4:12:07.16,4:12:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他的吗
Dialogue: 0,4:12:09.72,4:12:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因为被入侵了两只左右嘛
Dialogue: 0,4:12:14.80,4:12:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能的话
Dialogue: 0,4:12:17.19,4:12:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能吧
Dialogue: 0,4:12:19.00,4:12:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,脑袋没了
Dialogue: 0,4:12:37.63,4:12:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,呼嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:12:40.91,4:12:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,2点了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:12:44.12,4:12:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在看
Dialogue: 0,4:12:46.81,4:12:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在看这里
Dialogue: 0,4:12:52.84,4:12:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,4:13:04.01,4:13:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不在
Dialogue: 0,4:13:18.50,4:13:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不在
Dialogue: 0,4:13:20.00,4:13:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,的吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:13:25.67,4:13:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这个？
Dialogue: 0,4:13:28.76,4:13:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是——异常
Dialogue: 0,4:13:32.34,4:13:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不正常啊
Dialogue: 0,4:13:33.69,4:13:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那……
Dialogue: 0,4:13:36.27,4:13:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是异常才异常啊
Dialogue: 0,4:13:40.71,4:13:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,明明那么的异常
Dialogue: 0,4:13:48.73,4:13:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这种感觉绝对有
Dialogue: 0,4:13:51.27,4:13:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,已经
Dialogue: 0,4:13:55.06,4:13:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,4:13:57.26,4:13:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就是没找到
Dialogue: 0,4:13:59.56,4:14:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,找到！
Dialogue: 0,4:14:05.93,4:14:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,想靠快进露露找到
Dialogue: 0,4:14:09.49,4:14:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,快进起来快进起来
Dialogue: 0,4:14:14.19,4:14:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没有……有……不是吗
Dialogue: 0,4:14:24.36,4:14:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是啊，这种时候一般都会有的吧，隧道的1号
Dialogue: 0,4:14:40.70,4:14:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大体上会有的
Dialogue: 0,4:14:42.09,4:14:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,大体上
Dialogue: 0,4:14:44.07,4:14:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,4:15:03.69,4:15:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然不在？！
Dialogue: 0,4:15:06.78,4:15:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然没有三个
Dialogue: 0,4:15:09.31,4:15:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——？
Dialogue: 0,4:15:12.13,4:15:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉眼珠很容……
Dialogue: 0,4:15:13.65,4:15:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧，有
Dialogue: 0,4:15:15.72,4:15:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:15:16.20,4:15:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有两个？
Dialogue: 0,4:15:19.22,4:15:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙啊，隧道
Dialogue: 0,4:15:21.97,4:15:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道……
Dialogue: 0,4:15:28.18,4:15:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,明明找到眼珠还那么高兴的
Dialogue: 0,4:15:31.14,4:15:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道
Dialogue: 0,4:15:32.98,4:15:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不对吧，没有的
Dialogue: 0,4:15:35.87,4:15:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没有的吧
Dialogue: 0,4:15:41.17,4:15:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,到底有什么
Dialogue: 0,4:15:43.60,4:15:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不如说
Dialogue: 0,4:15:52.55,4:15:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道……
Dialogue: 0,4:15:54.10,4:15:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，不能放大吧
Dialogue: 0,4:15:57.80,4:16:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在直播画面那边看更好
Dialogue: 0,4:16:00.92,4:16:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,更能看清吧
Dialogue: 0,4:16:07.11,4:16:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,直播画面
Dialogue: 0,4:16:10.62,4:16:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那边更…
Dialogue: 0,4:16:13.16,4:16:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看得清楚说成立吗
Dialogue: 0,4:16:19.02,4:16:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,透过OBS那边
Dialogue: 0,4:16:21.94,4:16:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看得更清楚什么的
Dialogue: 0,4:16:25.10,4:16:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:16:26.59,4:16:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,4:16:27.20,4:16:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不对，我点到OBS那边了
Dialogue: 0,4:16:37.54,4:16:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,4:16:41.08,4:16:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是看OBS画面，出现在左侧边缘就会被我挡着啊
Dialogue: 0,4:16:48.84,4:16:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,算了先试试吧
Dialogue: 0,4:16:50.74,4:16:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到什么的世界线存在吗
Dialogue: 0,4:16:53.66,4:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠原本在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,4:16:58.11,4:16:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说……
Dialogue: 0,4:16:59.22,4:17:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不对吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:17:10.49,4:17:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,透过画面能看到的世界线有吗
Dialogue: 0,4:17:13.89,4:17:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没有吗
Dialogue: 0,4:17:21.61,4:17:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好像听到猫头鹰的叫声
Dialogue: 0,4:17:26.91,4:17:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我觉得，还没
Dialogue: 0,4:17:30.58,4:17:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:17:36.31,4:17:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我快成地缚灵了
Dialogue: 0,4:17:38.41,4:17:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,4:17:43.20,4:17:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,JSP这游戏也不是什么要玩到早上的吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:17:47.59,4:17:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,4:17:48.92,4:17:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是「你能活到早上吗」那种
Dialogue: 0,4:17:51.45,4:17:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那种，耐久……
Dialogue: 0,4:17:53.38,4:17:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是说要搞耐久直播
Dialogue: 0,4:17:56.50,4:17:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就是普通地
Dialogue: 0,4:17:57.54,4:17:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,4:17:58.31,4:17:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,JSP的
Dialogue: 0,4:18:00.51,4:18:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,设置
Dialogue: 0,4:18:02.97,4:18:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,到5点为止
Dialogue: 0,4:18:04.12,4:18:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看守监控摄像头这样的工作
Dialogue: 0,4:18:07.25,4:18:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说是普通的官方宣传语
Dialogue: 0,4:18:09.94,4:18:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,反正有
Dialogue: 0,4:18:11.17,4:18:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这么写着
Dialogue: 0,4:18:12.22,4:18:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，真的只是我...
Dialogue: 0,4:18:14.99,4:18:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,到早上
Dialogue: 0,4:18:17.01,4:18:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在播JSP
Dialogue: 0,4:18:19.55,4:18:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而已
Dialogue: 0,4:18:22.97,4:18:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「现实里也要5点了啊！！」真的是啊
Dialogue: 0,4:18:26.20,4:18:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，我也绝对会在5点前
Dialogue: 0,4:18:29.84,4:18:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不管多晚都一定会找到的
Dialogue: 0,4:18:34.47,4:18:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这个？！
Dialogue: 0,4:18:37.61,4:18:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，不是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:18:40.39,4:18:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,来了！
Dialogue: 0,4:18:41.23,4:18:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,来了来了来了！超——
Dialogue: 0,4:18:42.77,4:18:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,难懂！
Dialogue: 0,4:18:45.19,4:18:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,4:18:45.89,4:18:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,通过OBS看
Dialogue: 0,4:18:48.41,4:18:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可能稍微容易看出来一点
Dialogue: 0,4:18:51.69,4:18:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是那东西吗
Dialogue: 0,4:18:53.36,4:18:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是它
Dialogue: 0,4:18:55.07,4:18:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就是它呢
Dialogue: 0,4:18:56.05,4:18:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好亮，好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,4:19:08.67,4:19:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,通关的流向来力
Dialogue: 0,4:19:14.73,4:19:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,想赢
Dialogue: 0,4:19:16.77,4:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,想赢
Dialogue: 0,4:19:18.55,4:19:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我想赢
Dialogue: 0,4:19:22.28,4:19:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,摄像头的异常
Dialogue: 0,4:19:28.05,4:19:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,异常
Dialogue: 0,4:19:30.67,4:19:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,OKOK
Dialogue: 0,4:19:48.57,4:19:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得是……
Dialogue: 0,4:19:59.16,4:20:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在哭，找到了
Dialogue: 0,4:20:01.20,4:20:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不用再哭了哦
Dialogue: 0,4:20:02.90,4:20:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我会找到你的
Dialogue: 0,4:20:05.07,4:20:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,4:20:06.29,4:20:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好像脸？看不到呢
Dialogue: 0,4:20:24.46,4:20:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,4:20:25.09,4:20:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这不奇怪吗
Dialogue: 0,4:20:28.35,4:20:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着菜刀
Dialogue: 0,4:20:30.67,4:20:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,4:20:31.92,4:20:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好，其实是拐杖吗
Dialogue: 0,4:20:37.10,4:20:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,脸
Dialogue: 0,4:20:39.33,4:20:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有了有了
Dialogue: 0,4:20:50.63,4:20:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没变化吧
Dialogue: 0,4:20:53.24,4:20:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像脸
Dialogue: 0,4:20:55.58,4:20:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉
Dialogue: 0,4:20:56.72,4:20:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,各种东西看起来都像脸
Dialogue: 0,4:21:09.39,4:21:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人
Dialogue: 0,4:21:11.97,4:21:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像脸
Dialogue: 0,4:21:13.83,4:21:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得全部看起来都像脸了
Dialogue: 0,4:21:19.52,4:21:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,4:21:28.28,4:21:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,正想着厕所异常多，结果异常来了
Dialogue: 0,4:21:32.21,4:21:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,异常啊
Dialogue: 0,4:21:34.81,4:21:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所的异常很异常
Dialogue: 0,4:21:36.62,4:21:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,异常地异常着这件事很异常
Dialogue: 0,4:21:39.42,4:21:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,异常以上的
Dialogue: 0,4:21:40.92,4:21:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也非常异常
Dialogue: 0,4:21:45.94,4:21:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，出来吧
Dialogue: 0,4:21:48.65,4:21:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,4:21:52.07,4:21:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,通行——可
Dialogue: 0,4:21:54.62,4:21:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，不行
Dialogue: 0,4:21:56.96,4:21:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要可通行
Dialogue: 0,4:22:00.72,4:22:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「任何人都可自由使用」
Dialogue: 0,4:22:10.43,4:22:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,状态不错哦
Dialogue: 0,4:22:11.99,4:22:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,状态不错
Dialogue: 0,4:22:13.48,4:22:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,直到现在
Dialogue: 0,4:22:17.94,4:22:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,4:22:20.57,4:22:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,气息在散发着气息
Dialogue: 0,4:22:27.77,4:22:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,4:22:31.21,4:22:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪里冒出气息的
Dialogue: 0,4:22:34.01,4:22:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,4:22:37.62,4:22:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,4:22:38.72,4:22:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,4:22:40.94,4:22:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,4:22:44.45,4:22:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,枪声？
Dialogue: 0,4:22:54.21,4:22:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,到底在哪里
Dialogue: 0,4:23:00.62,4:23:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔
Dialogue: 0,4:23:08.44,4:23:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,寂静岭的门
Dialogue: 0,4:23:10.32,4:23:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易找
Dialogue: 0,4:23:27.87,4:23:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔没有
Dialogue: 0,4:23:31.37,4:23:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,4:23:41.96,4:23:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,找到！
Dialogue: 0,4:23:48.35,4:23:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,出现过的就一样
Dialogue: 0,4:23:51.70,4:23:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,会出现异变吧
Dialogue: 0,4:23:54.12,4:23:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不会出现吧，大概
Dialogue: 0,4:23:57.01,4:23:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「任何人都能自由的……」
Dialogue: 0,4:24:14.09,4:24:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,禁止进入
Dialogue: 0,4:24:20.67,4:24:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，找不到了
Dialogue: 0,4:24:22.72,4:24:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一定在某个地方
Dialogue: 0,4:24:25.60,4:24:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,已经
Dialogue: 0,4:24:27.28,4:24:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,异变发生了
Dialogue: 0,4:24:29.00,4:24:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定
Dialogue: 0,4:24:31.88,4:24:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,某个地方有声音在响
Dialogue: 0,4:24:44.74,4:24:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有声音响了
Dialogue: 0,4:24:46.36,4:24:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有
Dialogue: 0,4:24:52.76,4:24:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:24:53.67,4:24:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到
Dialogue: 0,4:24:54.79,4:24:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,4:24:56.17,4:24:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,4:25:08.06,4:25:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,铃原在凌晨3点左右通知您
Dialogue: 0,4:25:12.57,4:25:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,直到，任务
Dialogue: 0,4:25:13.86,4:25:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有2小时
Dialogue: 0,4:25:16.02,4:25:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对已经漏掉了什么地方
Dialogue: 0,4:25:22.23,4:25:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,4:25:26.15,4:25:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会找到的
Dialogue: 0,4:25:27.64,4:25:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定
Dialogue: 0,4:25:29.28,4:25:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会找到的
Dialogue: 0,4:25:31.86,4:25:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,4:25:39.82,4:25:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,4:25:41.46,4:25:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始异常
Dialogue: 0,4:25:43.17,4:25:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,应该变得容易增加
Dialogue: 0,4:25:49.78,4:25:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不对吧
Dialogue: 0,4:25:51.42,4:25:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉也不是不能看成另一张脸
Dialogue: 0,4:26:02.66,4:26:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,呼嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:26:12.18,4:26:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,相反
Dialogue: 0,4:26:14.93,4:26:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这边这边
Dialogue: 0,4:26:18.10,4:26:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,联系起来吧，把生命
Dialogue: 0,4:26:32.71,4:26:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,莲花！
Dialogue: 0,4:26:37.14,4:26:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很容易发现
Dialogue: 0,4:26:43.89,4:26:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哈——！
Dialogue: 0,4:26:46.78,4:26:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,4:26:49.88,4:26:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,4:26:52.00,4:26:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,脸
Dialogue: 0,4:26:56.38,4:26:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那个吗，难道就是
Dialogue: 0,4:26:58.69,4:26:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,4:27:00.35,4:27:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,终于
Dialogue: 0,4:27:01.83,4:27:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,终于做到
Dialogue: 0,4:27:05.56,4:27:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,终于做到了
Dialogue: 0,4:27:12.52,4:27:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,4:27:13.47,4:27:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，把生命联系起来
Dialogue: 0,4:27:20.87,4:27:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,4:27:24.89,4:27:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,隧道里的入侵者太多了
Dialogue: 0,4:27:45.60,4:27:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 0,4:27:53.34,4:27:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠很好找
Dialogue: 0,4:27:58.99,4:28:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,厕所里没发现异常
Dialogue: 0,4:28:02.25,4:28:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不，但是，物体替换什么的……
Dialogue: 0,4:28:04.03,4:28:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，但是，那就是那个吗，刚才的
Dialogue: 0,4:28:06.73,4:28:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,变成了像杀人鬼一样的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,4:28:15.28,4:28:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,4:28:18.24,4:28:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,把手之类的
Dialogue: 0,4:28:28.80,4:28:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,4点吗
Dialogue: 0,4:28:32.32,4:28:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,锥形筒——
Dialogue: 0,4:28:54.55,4:28:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:29:00.31,4:29:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太亮！
Dialogue: 0,4:29:03.97,4:29:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,太亮太亮
Dialogue: 0,4:29:25.38,4:29:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,4点20分
Dialogue: 0,4:29:38.23,4:29:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么异变都没发现
Dialogue: 0,4:29:41.41,4:29:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,4:29:43.09,4:29:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,灯塔的
Dialogue: 0,4:29:44.14,4:29:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦！
Dialogue: 0,4:29:46.39,4:29:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现在终于找到了
Dialogue: 0,4:29:49.02,4:29:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,4:29:49.98,4:29:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定是天才
Dialogue: 0,4:29:52.19,4:29:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？检出了好几个？
Dialogue: 0,4:29:57.85,4:29:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好好，不错
Dialogue: 0,4:30:00.02,4:30:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,状态不错状态不错
Dialogue: 0,4:30:08.57,4:30:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,赢给你看
Dialogue: 0,4:30:32.04,4:30:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,4:30:34.82,4:30:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我第一次见到
Dialogue: 0,4:30:48.68,4:30:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还有10分钟
Dialogue: 0,4:30:51.19,4:30:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能撑得住吗
Dialogue: 0,4:30:54.66,4:30:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,捕兽夹
Dialogue: 0,4:30:56.14,4:30:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个简单
Dialogue: 0,4:30:58.84,4:31:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,「第一次的异变啊」是啊
Dialogue: 0,4:31:01.60,4:31:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉像彻底看遍了
Dialogue: 0,4:31:08.01,4:31:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉到某种违和感
Dialogue: 0,4:31:09.89,4:31:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不知道
Dialogue: 0,4:31:16.68,4:31:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得，透过OBS看的话
Dialogue: 0,4:31:20.31,4:31:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: 0,4:31:22.13,4:31:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可能更容易发现异常
Dialogue: 0,4:31:28.07,4:31:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,也许缩小点看会更好，说不定
Dialogue: 0,4:31:32.14,4:31:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得大的…
Dialogue: 0,4:31:33.61,4:31:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,做到力——！
Dialogue: 0,4:31:35.39,4:31:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,通关了——
Dialogue: 0,4:31:38.76,4:31:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,4:31:41.15,4:31:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,做到了——
Dialogue: 0,4:31:42.72,4:31:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,4:31:45.66,4:31:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:31:46.10,4:31:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,被幽灵入侵了2次
Dialogue: 0,4:31:48.06,4:31:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么，在哪里
Dialogue: 0,4:31:49.64,4:31:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,4:31:50.89,4:31:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然现在就想倒回去看
Dialogue: 0,4:31:58.52,4:32:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,想直播看
Dialogue: 0,4:32:00.61,4:32:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,直播同时观看
Dialogue: 0,4:32:02.77,4:32:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,「稍微拉开视角的话，能从远处看得更广吗？」嗯
Dialogue: 0,4:32:06.72,4:32:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里我所在的地方…
Dialogue: 0,4:32:08.70,4:32:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会看不到，时钟的地方
Dialogue: 0,4:32:13.35,4:32:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,呀——难度上升了
Dialogue: 0,4:32:17.83,4:32:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,最后了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:32:20.91,4:32:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这个居然有71个
Dialogue: 0,4:32:23.91,4:32:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,40个以上找到……没找到
Dialogue: 0,4:32:27.85,4:32:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是难易度相当高呢
Dialogue: 0,4:32:32.14,4:32:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不，先不从OBS看，就从这里，然后
Dialogue: 0,4:32:36.29,4:32:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,然后如果真的找不到的话
Dialogue: 0,4:32:39.70,4:32:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就透过OBS
Dialogue: 0,4:32:41.72,4:32:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,来找吧
Dialogue: 0,4:32:44.77,4:32:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我的
Dialogue: 0,4:32:47.07,4:32:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大约第一第二名的
Dialogue: 0,4:32:50.13,4:32:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不想去的地方
Dialogue: 0,4:32:52.00,4:32:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,4:32:53.67,4:32:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,房子
Dialogue: 0,4:33:01.60,4:33:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是镜子吗
Dialogue: 0,4:33:03.69,4:33:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,御神镜？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:09.96,4:33:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,咦，这个之前不是倒了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:33:12.29,4:33:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,错觉？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:17.93,4:33:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没
Dialogue: 0,4:33:20.05,4:33:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，出现了
Dialogue: 0,4:33:20.99,4:33:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是之前找到的那个
Dialogue: 0,4:33:27.00,4:33:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然只是感觉，但这里是不是比刚才的地方更难
Dialogue: 0,4:33:32.52,4:33:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有点违和感
Dialogue: 0,4:33:34.33,4:33:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,4:33:35.09,4:33:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,入口有这么宽吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:33:38.48,4:33:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,4:33:39.48,4:33:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,当我没说
Dialogue: 0,4:33:57.29,4:33:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,4:33:58.91,4:34:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有水出来了
Dialogue: 0,4:34:07.71,4:34:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,4:34:10.17,4:34:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,4:34:13.47,4:34:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有啪嚓的声音
Dialogue: 0,4:34:16.82,4:34:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有声音的话，就会觉得必须快点找到，有点着急呢
Dialogue: 0,4:34:22.93,4:34:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，肯定来了的
Dialogue: 0,4:34:30.57,4:34:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,4:34:37.73,4:34:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,诶不是吧
Dialogue: 0,4:34:49.15,4:34:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真容易发现
Dialogue: 0,4:34:51.95,4:34:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真容易发现真容易发现
Dialogue: 0,4:34:59.62,4:35:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好像能看到什么？
Dialogue: 0,4:35:03.15,4:35:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶～说是错觉
Dialogue: 0,4:35:09.32,4:35:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，是不是太快了
Dialogue: 0,4:35:13.75,4:35:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这倒下的吗
Dialogue: 0,4:35:17.33,4:35:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,4:35:23.55,4:35:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可能不知道
Dialogue: 0,4:35:33.92,4:35:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——！
Dialogue: 0,4:35:37.87,4:35:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，首先
Dialogue: 0,4:35:40.16,4:35:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,祭坛房间有入侵者幽灵
Dialogue: 0,4:35:44.24,4:35:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关有物体移动，洞窟内有物体消失
Dialogue: 0,4:35:49.35,4:35:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,客厅有入侵者
Dialogue: 0,4:35:52.35,4:35:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,客厅和祭坛有幽灵
Dialogue: 0,4:35:54.99,4:35:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,洞窟和玄关有物体移动或消失
Dialogue: 0,4:36:01.38,4:36:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,玄关的东西消失了？
Dialogue: 0,4:36:12.03,4:36:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,客厅
Dialogue: 0,4:36:13.38,4:36:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,厨房
Dialogue: 0,4:36:15.55,4:36:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,浴场
Dialogue: 0,4:36:16.98,4:36:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,祭坛房间？
Dialogue: 0,4:36:19.97,4:36:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,4:36:20.86,4:36:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,写的什么来着，祭坛房间有入侵者吗
Dialogue: 0,4:36:27.26,4:36:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,洞窟内……
Dialogue: 0,4:36:35.13,4:36:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,完全
Dialogue: 0,4:36:37.58,4:36:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,完全完全
Dialogue: 0,4:36:38.90,4:36:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,4:36:53.90,4:36:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,目前完全没有违和感
Dialogue: 0,4:36:58.24,4:37:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没有违和感这件事本身就是违和感
Dialogue: 0,4:37:06.27,4:37:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,4:37:10.24,4:37:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有这种东西吗
Dialogue: 0,4:37:13.19,4:37:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有？
Dialogue: 0,4:37:17.35,4:37:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像人影
Dialogue: 0,4:37:21.47,4:37:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！果然！
Dialogue: 0,4:37:23.91,4:37:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，微妙地
Dialogue: 0,4:37:26.64,4:37:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,4:37:27.99,4:37:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是眼珠吗
Dialogue: 0,4:37:30.63,4:37:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这能意识到，也许想让人说是天才
Dialogue: 0,4:37:35.90,4:37:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,4:37:37.09,4:37:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,难找的
Dialogue: 0,4:37:54.52,4:37:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的
Dialogue: 0,4:37:59.02,4:37:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好——
Dialogue: 0,4:38:00.37,4:38:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,4:38:03.00,4:38:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是铃原露露
Dialogue: 0,4:38:06.79,4:38:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,2434所属的
Dialogue: 0,4:38:10.00,4:38:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,虚拟
Dialogue: 0,4:38:12.77,4:38:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Youtuber
Dialogue: 0,4:38:16.98,4:38:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不太对
Dialogue: 0,4:38:25.25,4:38:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,出道
Dialogue: 0,4:38:26.48,4:38:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,半年
Dialogue: 0,4:38:28.59,4:38:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,新人主播
Dialogue: 0,4:38:33.46,4:38:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,名为
Dialogue: 0,4:38:34.95,4:38:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,铃原露露
Dialogue: 0,4:38:43.56,4:38:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,致爱丽丝
Dialogue: 0,4:38:52.11,4:38:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,4:38:55.49,4:38:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,全是奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,4:38:58.91,4:38:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,4:39:08.37,4:39:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得……
Dialogue: 0,4:39:10.68,4:39:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:39:12.72,4:39:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不，就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,4:39:15.26,4:39:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我居然注意到了
Dialogue: 0,4:39:19.67,4:39:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,正在活性化呢
Dialogue: 0,4:39:23.12,4:39:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,脑浆
Dialogue: 0,4:39:25.47,4:39:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对异变的
Dialogue: 0,4:39:26.74,4:39:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好像看到了张脸
Dialogue: 0,4:39:29.56,4:39:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这也是的话，那就厉害了
Dialogue: 0,4:39:31.60,4:39:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好像不是
Dialogue: 0,4:39:40.86,4:39:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,找到异变的话
Dialogue: 0,4:39:50.59,4:39:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,佛祖
Dialogue: 0,4:39:52.74,4:39:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,4:39:55.32,4:39:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,4:40:00.79,4:40:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的人类
Dialogue: 0,4:40:14.06,4:40:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉画变了
Dialogue: 0,4:40:18.36,4:40:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没变啊
Dialogue: 0,4:40:30.37,4:40:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不能钻进被炉里睡觉
Dialogue: 0,4:40:33.54,4:40:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,会感冒的
Dialogue: 0,4:40:42.34,4:40:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:40:47.84,4:40:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:40:50.51,4:40:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像能看到轮廓
Dialogue: 0,4:40:53.90,4:40:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,又感觉像是错觉
Dialogue: 0,4:40:57.14,4:40:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,4:40:58.54,4:40:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且
Dialogue: 0,4:41:02.04,4:41:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,摸一下也行
Dialogue: 0,4:41:08.49,4:41:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西有挂着吗
Dialogue: 0,4:41:12.16,4:41:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这种东西
Dialogue: 0,4:41:14.19,4:41:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不是异常是异常啊
Dialogue: 0,4:41:18.07,4:41:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，再错一个就结束了
Dialogue: 0,4:41:23.61,4:41:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可以确定的
Dialogue: 0,4:41:25.20,4:41:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要那种「这是异变」的家伙
Dialogue: 0,4:41:28.38,4:41:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,4:41:30.93,4:41:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,微波炉
Dialogue: 0,4:41:34.96,4:41:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就算没通电也能用微波炉的话
Dialogue: 0,4:41:38.51,4:41:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那可就太方便了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:41:47.74,4:41:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:41:49.35,4:41:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉花好像变长了
Dialogue: 0,4:41:53.03,4:41:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,又感觉好像没有这回事
Dialogue: 0,4:42:05.12,4:42:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,眼珠
Dialogue: 0,4:42:07.26,4:42:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这个还挺明显吧
Dialogue: 0,4:42:15.92,4:42:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看，普通地有人
Dialogue: 0,4:42:20.22,4:42:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不过异变的数量是不是太多了？
Dialogue: 0,4:42:23.18,4:42:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然找得还挺快的
Dialogue: 0,4:42:26.92,4:42:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微有点多啊
Dialogue: 0,4:42:36.59,4:42:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,太多了
Dialogue: 0,4:42:38.68,4:42:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我觉得这里之前没这么脏
Dialogue: 0,4:42:41.70,4:42:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没自信
Dialogue: 0,4:42:46.29,4:42:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,用有自信的
Dialogue: 0,4:42:49.24,4:42:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,来进攻
Dialogue: 0,4:42:51.91,4:42:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,OK OK
Dialogue: 0,4:42:55.35,4:42:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到掉落的瞬间太好了
Dialogue: 0,4:42:59.86,4:43:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这里原本有坐垫吗
Dialogue: 0,4:43:13.71,4:43:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，脸什么的感觉也会变吧？
Dialogue: 0,4:43:18.79,4:43:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,人偶之类的
Dialogue: 0,4:43:24.28,4:43:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,上面，不对劲
Dialogue: 0,4:43:25.98,4:43:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,变拉门了
Dialogue: 0,4:43:29.01,4:43:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,目前感觉不错
Dialogue: 0,4:43:40.35,4:43:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办？试着攻一下？
Dialogue: 0,4:43:46.48,4:43:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什么——事？
Dialogue: 0,4:43:53.92,4:43:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,什么——事？
Dialogue: 0,4:44:05.71,4:44:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,4:44:22.27,4:44:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,越来越找不到了
Dialogue: 0,4:44:35.31,4:44:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不，感觉好像放跑了什么
Dialogue: 0,4:44:37.16,4:44:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这种灰尘精灵一样的东西有过吗
Dialogue: 0,4:44:41.54,4:44:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,居然有啊
Dialogue: 0,4:44:46.36,4:44:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,4:44:46.98,4:44:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说这么长时间没有异变
Dialogue: 0,4:44:50.61,4:44:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不可能
Dialogue: 0,4:44:57.31,4:44:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定漏掉了什么
Dialogue: 0,4:44:59.25,4:45:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对
Dialogue: 0,4:45:04.43,4:45:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有什么在里面，这是什么
Dialogue: 0,4:45:07.07,4:45:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,冷冻库
Dialogue: 0,4:45:11.82,4:45:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，脸
Dialogue: 0,4:45:13.26,4:45:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,4:45:14.55,4:45:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这张脸是经常见的脸
Dialogue: 0,4:45:30.17,4:45:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 0,4:45:34.73,4:45:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这种地方也会变化吧
Dialogue: 0,4:45:37.11,4:45:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好像什么东西啪嚓一下碎了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:45:44.09,4:45:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有什么碎了
Dialogue: 0,4:45:48.61,4:45:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什么碎了？
Dialogue: 0,4:45:49.65,4:45:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,4:45:52.71,4:45:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕，这是有时间限制的那种吗
Dialogue: 0,4:45:59.57,4:46:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,结果以相当微妙的变化结束了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:46:18.82,4:46:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,4:46:19.73,4:46:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,违和感
Dialogue: 0,4:46:22.53,4:46:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,明明能感觉到违和感
Dialogue: 0,4:46:27.62,4:46:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,4:46:33.53,4:46:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不，已经
Dialogue: 0,4:46:35.88,4:46:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,转了一圈哪里都
Dialogue: 0,4:46:38.62,4:46:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到这种事
Dialogue: 0,4:46:41.48,4:46:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不可能
Dialogue: 0,4:46:44.06,4:46:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是漏看了
Dialogue: 0,4:46:52.21,4:46:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,彻底的
Dialogue: 0,4:46:54.48,4:46:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,彻底的干了
Dialogue: 0,4:47:08.84,4:47:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:47:12.01,4:47:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,4:47:14.42,4:47:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好，竟然找到了
Dialogue: 0,4:47:16.71,4:47:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,意外地快要
Dialogue: 0,4:47:18.93,4:47:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也不算快吧，快4点了
Dialogue: 0,4:47:23.22,4:47:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:47:29.70,4:47:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好像听到了上楼梯的声音
Dialogue: 0,4:47:47.93,4:47:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:48:00.35,4:48:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,找
Dialogue: 0,4:48:01.21,4:48:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,4:48:04.08,4:48:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不过从这里开始
Dialogue: 0,4:48:06.47,4:48:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,异变会加速发生
Dialogue: 0,4:48:18.04,4:48:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哇……搞不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,4:48:33.13,4:48:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对漏掉了什么
Dialogue: 0,4:48:38.72,4:48:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,4:48:40.42,4:48:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,找
Dialogue: 0,4:48:41.22,4:48:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,4:48:43.63,4:48:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,找到找到找到
Dialogue: 0,4:48:51.04,4:48:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,4点！
Dialogue: 0,4:48:52.92,4:48:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,4底昂，4低昂是什么……
Dialogue: 0,4:48:54.94,4:48:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,通知您现在是4点
Dialogue: 0,4:49:00.86,4:49:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么变了？
Dialogue: 0,4:49:03.43,4:49:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,4:49:03.83,4:49:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是错觉吧
Dialogue: 0,4:49:07.55,4:49:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,找到
Dialogue: 0,4:49:08.87,4:49:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,简单易懂，帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,4:49:22.63,4:49:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:49:36.72,4:49:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好像起了什么雾
Dialogue: 0,4:49:43.83,4:49:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,烤箱
Dialogue: 0,4:49:48.66,4:49:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,能撑得住吗
Dialogue: 0,4:49:49.79,4:49:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,4:49:54.71,4:49:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,能熬过夜晚吗
Dialogue: 0,4:49:59.73,4:50:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还不能大意，我
Dialogue: 0,4:50:05.71,4:50:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还不好说呢
Dialogue: 0,4:50:17.98,4:50:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得
Dialogue: 0,4:50:19.14,4:50:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,变大了
Dialogue: 0,4:50:40.28,4:50:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哦～真美
Dialogue: 0,4:50:47.90,4:50:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好像写了点什么
Dialogue: 0,4:50:49.69,4:50:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不是符咒
Dialogue: 0,4:50:52.28,4:50:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没那回事吧
Dialogue: 0,4:51:10.24,4:51:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……
Dialogue: 0,4:51:15.11,4:51:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有这样的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,4:51:22.28,4:51:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好像……小推车
Dialogue: 0,4:51:42.60,4:51:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谁——啊
Dialogue: 0,4:51:46.33,4:51:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,4:51:49.51,4:51:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,也许能行
Dialogue: 0,4:51:52.56,4:51:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,已经
Dialogue: 0,4:51:54.05,4:51:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嘎哈哈
Dialogue: 0,4:51:55.07,4:51:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了啊
Dialogue: 0,4:51:59.22,4:52:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了吗
Dialogue: 0,4:52:01.85,4:52:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好像刚才
Dialogue: 0,4:52:04.25,4:52:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了——
Dialogue: 0,4:52:06.41,4:52:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,4:52:06.94,4:52:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,4:52:09.59,4:52:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,报告了28个异常
Dialogue: 0,4:52:12.53,4:52:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,0个异常漏……
Dialogue: 0,4:52:14.38,4:52:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,做到了！
Dialogue: 0,4:52:16.60,4:52:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,完全胜利
Dialogue: 0,4:52:20.00,4:52:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfects
Dialogue: 0,4:52:23.10,4:52:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,「Nice！」谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,4:52:24.60,4:52:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,4:52:25.76,4:52:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了
Dialogue: 0,4:52:27.75,4:52:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了哦
Dialogue: 0,4:52:30.03,4:52:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,4:52:31.06,4:52:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,「现在赋予您的全部」
Dialogue: 0,4:52:34.10,4:52:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,「凶宅的难关监视任务」
Dialogue: 0,4:52:37.27,4:52:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,「已完成」
Dialogue: 0,4:52:38.62,4:52:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,「让我们确认一下是否还有未报告的异常现象」
Dialogue: 0,4:52:41.88,4:52:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好诶
Dialogue: 0,4:52:45.95,4:52:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然
Dialogue: 0,4:52:46.62,4:52:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没有确认到全部异常
Dialogue: 0,4:52:49.68,4:52:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但应该已经弄清楚了不少吧
Dialogue: 0,4:52:54.19,4:52:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，原来会这么展示啊
Dialogue: 0,4:52:58.94,4:53:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此原来如此
Dialogue: 0,4:53:04.01,4:53:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不，虽然还有很多没找到的
Dialogue: 0,4:53:06.88,4:53:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还是相当难
Dialogue: 0,4:53:09.10,4:53:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,4:53:12.34,4:53:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: 0,4:53:13.39,4:53:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个可能是最难的，真的
Dialogue: 0,4:53:17.17,4:53:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,观音崎公园
Dialogue: 0,4:53:21.93,4:53:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很难呢。大家发现了多少异常呢？
Dialogue: 0,4:53:26.80,4:53:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到的、没找到的，以及我没找到但别人找到的等等
Dialogue: 0,4:53:33.75,4:53:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有找到吗？
Dialogue: 0,4:53:37.45,4:53:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不，确实但是呢
Dialogue: 0,4:53:39.40,4:53:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,4:53:42.12,4:53:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,最终来说为了找到什么
Dialogue: 0,4:53:45.29,4:53:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,会把意识集中上去
Dialogue: 0,4:53:47.90,4:53:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然最后没那么害怕了
Dialogue: 0,4:53:51.30,4:53:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,果然一开始最可怕，因为不知道会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,4:53:56.35,4:53:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,「感觉一切都像是异常」
Dialogue: 0,4:53:58.27,4:53:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,「真的好可怕」
Dialogue: 0,4:53:59.38,4:54:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,4:54:00.37,4:54:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然好可怕
Dialogue: 0,4:54:01.87,4:54:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但最后已经不是害怕的情绪了
Dialogue: 0,4:54:05.87,4:54:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而是想着怎么把它找出来
Dialogue: 0,4:54:08.31,4:54:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,到5点前，现实时间的5点前
Dialogue: 0,4:54:10.88,4:54:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想找到异常
Dialogue: 0,4:54:13.71,4:54:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,总算把自己心中的
Dialogue: 0,4:54:16.21,4:54:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,目标
Dialogue: 0,4:54:18.45,4:54:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,达成了
Dialogue: 0,4:54:22.09,4:54:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,「太专注了反而不害怕了呢」
Dialogue: 0,4:54:24.70,4:54:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,4:54:26.37,4:54:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我就能看莉泽大人的录播了，好！
Dialogue: 0,4:54:31.57,4:54:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,4:54:32.46,4:54:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，各位
Dialogue: 0,4:54:33.58,4:54:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也感谢大家的观看
Dialogue: 0,4:54:36.83,4:54:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就能心情愉快地下播了呢
Dialogue: 0,4:54:39.33,4:54:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，特别津贴和普通版都通关了
Dialogue: 0,4:54:42.67,4:54:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然还没有找到所有的异常，但如果大家方便的话
Dialogue: 0,4:54:47.10,4:54:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,自己玩一下，可能会有新的发现
Dialogue: 0,4:54:51.67,4:54:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,请务必务必试试看
Dialogue: 0,4:54:54.03,4:54:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，大家也一起偶尔心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,4:54:57.20,4:54:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在盂兰盆节的时候
Dialogue: 0,4:54:59.52,4:55:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有点凉飕飕的
Dialogue: 0,4:55:01.63,4:55:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖之类的，果然盂兰盆节的时候
Dialogue: 0,4:55:04.11,4:55:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也会想要这么来一下
Dialogue: 0,4:55:06.50,4:55:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一起
Dialogue: 0,4:55:07.32,4:55:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能让大家感受到那种刺激
Dialogue: 0,4:55:10.65,4:55:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我会很高兴的
Dialogue: 0,4:55:13.40,4:55:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,「开始时的声音完全不一样」不是，因为太开心了
Dialogue: 0,4:55:16.47,4:55:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,赢过异变真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,4:55:18.81,4:55:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，各位
Dialogue: 0,4:55:20.55,4:55:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也感谢大家的收看
Dialogue: 0,4:55:24.70,4:55:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，嗯，各位
Dialogue: 0,4:55:26.84,4:55:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微呢，这次…
Dialogue: 0,4:55:28.20,4:55:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,4:55:29.12,4:55:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,的
Dialogue: 0,4:55:29.73,4:55:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还挺认真的
Dialogue: 0,4:55:32.49,4:55:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖房产
Dialogue: 0,4:55:35.19,4:55:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,相当呢，在开头
Dialogue: 0,4:55:38.00,4:55:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,写了可怕的告示
Dialogue: 0,4:55:40.63,4:55:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然可能会有人
Dialogue: 0,4:55:42.18,4:55:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很害怕，但各位最后
Dialogue: 0,4:55:45.46,4:55:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一起除灵
Dialogue: 0,4:55:47.37,4:55:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,结束吧，首先
Dialogue: 0,4:55:49.22,4:55:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然现在是晚上…
Dialogue: 0,4:55:51.46,4:55:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，也有在看录像的观众
Dialogue: 0,4:55:53.50,4:55:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,4:55:54.45,4:55:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,房间的灯，稍微调亮一点，在这个时间
Dialogue: 0,4:55:59.61,4:56:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,首先要把灯调亮
Dialogue: 0,4:56:01.71,4:56:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,4:56:02.60,4:56:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,4:56:04.29,4:56:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,家里有的话，准备一下纺必适，总之向周围用纺必适
Dialogue: 0,4:56:09.60,4:56:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,喷一下
Dialogue: 0,4:56:11.64,4:56:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，然后呢，请把穿着的衣服脱下来乱扔
Dialogue: 0,4:56:16.80,4:56:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,4:56:17.64,4:56:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，一边喊着「令人惊讶的乌托邦」
Dialogue: 0,4:56:20.80,4:56:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一边跳舞
Dialogue: 0,4:56:23.08,4:56:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话，那个驱邪
Dialogue: 0,4:56:25.75,4:56:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就完成了
Dialogue: 0,4:56:28.64,4:56:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，如果在外面的话，稍微亮一点的便利店之类的
Dialogue: 0,4:56:32.69,4:56:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,超市也可以，不过这个时间应该没开门吧，稍微
Dialogue: 0,4:56:37.23,4:56:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,去明亮的地方
Dialogue: 0,4:56:39.34,4:56:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,放下
Dialogue: 0,4:56:40.32,4:56:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请回去吧
Dialogue: 0,4:56:44.58,4:56:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那么大家
Dialogue: 0,4:56:46.13,4:56:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也感谢大家的观看
Dialogue: 0,4:56:49.75,4:56:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那么，让我们下次再见吧
Dialogue: 0,4:56:52.62,4:56:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,再见啦～
Dialogue: 0,4:56:54.47,4:56:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,再见啦～
Dialogue: 0,4:56:56.49,4:56:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦露露啦～
Dialogue: 0,4:58:28.74,4:58:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
